(12, 'Certificate Courses at GoCare Training Institute | GoCare Institute', 'certificate-courses-gocare', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"book-open\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Announcements</span>\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Certificate Courses at GoCare Training Institute</h1>\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">The complete guide to GoCare&apos;s accredited certificate programmes in healthcare, hospitality, and business.</p>\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 4 min read</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 01 Jun 2026</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Announcements</span>\n    </div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC05991.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare certificate courses overview\">\n    <div class=\"bp-body\">\n<p>GoCare Training Institute offers a wide range of accredited certificate programmes designed to equip learners with practical, industry-ready skills across healthcare, hospitality, administration, and community development. All certificate programmes follow the TVET CDACC curriculum and are delivered through competency-based training.</p>\n<h2>Health &amp; Medical Certificate Programmes</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Certificate in Healthcare Support Services (CNA)</strong> &mdash; Competency-based bedside care and patient support training</li>\n  <li><strong>Certificate in Health Care Assistant / Caregiving</strong> &mdash; Skills for caregiving, patient support, and home-based care</li>\n  <li><strong>Certificate in Home-Based Care Support</strong> &mdash; Training in home-based patient care and basic health monitoring</li>\n  <li><strong>Certificate in Perioperative Theatre Technology</strong> &mdash; Foundational training in theatre preparation and surgical support</li>\n  <li><strong>Certificate in Mortuary Science</strong> &mdash; Training in mortuary operations, body handling, and ethical practice</li>\n  <li><strong>Certificate in Orthopaedic and Trauma Medicine</strong> &mdash; Skills in musculoskeletal care and trauma support</li>\n  <li><strong>Certificate in Community Health</strong> &mdash; Community health promotion and public health interventions</li>\n  <li><strong>Certificate in Homecare Management</strong> &mdash; Managing homecare environments and household routines</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Hospitality &amp; Service Certificate Programmes</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Certificate in Front Office Operations</strong> &mdash; Reception duties, customer service, and communication</li>\n  <li><strong>Certificate in Food and Beverage Production</strong> &mdash; Food preparation, kitchen operations, and culinary techniques</li>\n  <li><strong>Certificate in Housekeeping and Accommodation</strong> &mdash; Housekeeping operations and hospitality standards</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Business, Social &amp; Administrative Certificate Programmes</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Certificate in Office Administrator</strong> &mdash; Office procedures, records management, and business communication</li>\n  <li><strong>Certificate in Office Assistant / Customer Service</strong> &mdash; Administrative and customer-facing skills</li>\n  <li><strong>Certificate in Social Work and Community Development</strong> &mdash; Community engagement and social support</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>International certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) &mdash; fully sponsored</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\n      <h3>Ready to Start Your Journey?</h3>\n      <p>Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding career.</p>\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"The complete guide to GoCare&apos;s accredited certificate programmes in healthcare, hospitality, and business. 4 min read 01 Jun 2026 Announcements GoCare Training Institute offers a wide range of accredited certificate programmes designed to equip learners with practical, industry-ready skills across healthcare, hospitality, administration, and community development. All certificate programmes follow the TVET CDACC curriculum and are delivered through competency-based training.\", \"heading\": \"Certificate Courses at GoCare Training Institute\"}, {\"body\": \"Certificate in Healthcare Support Services (CNA) — Competency-based bedside care and patient support training Certificate in Health Care Assistant / Caregiving — Skills for caregiving, patient support, and home-based care Certificate in Home-Based Care Support — Training in home-based patient care and basic health monitoring Certificate in Perioperative Theatre Technology — Foundational training in theatre preparation and surgical support Certificate in Mortuary Science — Training in mortuary operations, body handling, and ethical practice Certificate in Orthopaedic and Trauma Medicine — Skills in musculoskeletal care and trauma support Certificate in Community Health — Community health promotion and public health interventions Certificate in Homecare Management — Managing homecare environments and household routines\", \"heading\": \"Health & Medical Certificate Programmes\"}, {\"body\": \"Certificate in Front Office Operations — Reception duties, customer service, and communication Certificate in Food and Beverage Production — Food preparation, kitchen operations, and culinary techniques Certificate in Housekeeping and Accommodation — Housekeeping operations and hospitality standards\", \"heading\": \"Hospitality & Service Certificate Programmes\"}, {\"body\": \"Certificate in Office Administrator — Office procedures, records management, and business communication Certificate in Office Assistant / Customer Service — Administrative and customer-facing skills Certificate in Social Work and Community Development — Community engagement and social support\", \"heading\": \"Business, Social & Administrative Certificate Programmes\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentInternational certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) — fully sponsoredModern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding career. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Ready to Start Your Journey?\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(13, 'Certificate and Diploma Courses at GoCare Training Institute | GoCare Institute', 'certificate-diploma-courses-gocare', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"book-open\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Announcements</span>\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Certificate and Diploma Courses at GoCare Training Institute</h1>\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Accredited professional training for medical, health sciences, hospitality, and community development careers &mdash; full programme listing.</p>\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 4 min read</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 31 May 2026</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Announcements</span>\n    </div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC06034.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare certificate and diploma courses\">\n    <div class=\"bp-body\">\n<p>GoCare Training Institute offers a wide range of accredited certificate and diploma programmes designed to equip learners with practical, industry-ready skills across healthcare, hospitality, administration, and community development. All programmes follow the TVET CDACC curriculum and are delivered through competency-based training.</p>\n<h2>Health Sciences &amp; Medical Programmes</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>Certificate in Healthcare Support Services / Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA)</li>\n  <li>Certificate in Health Care Assistant / Caregiving</li>\n  <li>Certificate in Home-Based Care Support &ndash; Level 3</li>\n  <li>Certificate &amp; Diploma in Perioperative Theatre Technology</li>\n  <li>Certificate &amp; Diploma in Mortuary Science</li>\n  <li>Certificate &amp; Diploma in Orthopaedic and Trauma Medicine</li>\n  <li>Certificate &amp; Diploma in Community Health Assistant</li>\n  <li>Certificate in Homecare Management</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Hospitality &amp; Service Programmes</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>Certificate in Front Office Operations &ndash; Level 3 &amp; 4</li>\n  <li>Certificate in Food and Beverage Production &ndash; Level 3 &amp; 4</li>\n  <li>Certificate in Housekeeping and Accommodation &ndash; Level 3 &amp; 4</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Business, Social &amp; Administrative Programmes</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>Certificate in Office Administrator &ndash; Level 5</li>\n  <li>Certificate in Office Assistant / Customer Service &ndash; Level 4</li>\n  <li>Diploma in Social Work and Community Development &ndash; Level 6</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>International Certification Programmes</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>SDC Canada CNA Certification (included FREE with eligible programmes)</li>\n  <li>AMCA USA Certification (available for eligible healthcare graduates)</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>All GoCare programmes are TVETA-licensed, TVET CDACC-approved, and NITA-accredited &mdash; ensuring your qualification is nationally recognised and globally competitive.</p></div>\n<h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>International certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) &mdash; fully sponsored</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\n      <h3>Ready to Start Your Journey?</h3>\n      <p>Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding career.</p>\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Accredited professional training for medical, health sciences, hospitality, and community development careers — full programme listing. 4 min read 31 May 2026 Announcements GoCare Training Institute offers a wide range of accredited certificate and diploma programmes designed to equip learners with practical, industry-ready skills across healthcare, hospitality, administration, and community development. All programmes follow the TVET CDACC curriculum and are delivered through competency-based training.\", \"heading\": \"Certificate and Diploma Courses at GoCare Training Institute\"}, {\"body\": \"Certificate in Healthcare Support Services / Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) Certificate in Health Care Assistant / Caregiving Certificate in Home-Based Care Support – Level 3 Certificate & Diploma in Perioperative Theatre Technology Certificate & Diploma in Mortuary Science Certificate & Diploma in Orthopaedic and Trauma Medicine Certificate & Diploma in Community Health Assistant Certificate in Homecare Management\", \"heading\": \"Health Sciences & Medical Programmes\"}, {\"body\": \"Certificate in Front Office Operations – Level 3 & 4 Certificate in Food and Beverage Production – Level 3 & 4 Certificate in Housekeeping and Accommodation – Level 3 & 4\", \"heading\": \"Hospitality & Service Programmes\"}, {\"body\": \"Certificate in Office Administrator – Level 5 Certificate in Office Assistant / Customer Service – Level 4 Diploma in Social Work and Community Development – Level 6\", \"heading\": \"Business, Social & Administrative Programmes\"}, {\"body\": \"SDC Canada CNA Certification (included FREE with eligible programmes) AMCA USA Certification (available for eligible healthcare graduates) All GoCare programmes are TVETA-licensed, TVET CDACC-approved, and NITA-accredited — ensuring your qualification is nationally recognised and globally competitive.\", \"heading\": \"International Certification Programmes\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentInternational certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) — fully sponsoredModern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding career. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Ready to Start Your Journey?\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(14, 'Best Colleges Offering CNA Courses in Kenya | GoCare Institute', 'cna-colleges-kenya', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\n      <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\n      <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"stethoscope\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Healthcare</span>\n      <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Best Colleges Offering CNA Courses in Kenya</h1>\n      <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">A structured guide to Kenya\'s top Certified Nursing Assistant training institutions &mdash; and what sets them apart.</p>\n      <div class=\"bp-meta\">\n        <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 5 min read</span>\n        <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 21 May 2026</span>\n        <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Healthcare</span>\n      </div>\n      <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC01059.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare CNA training students\">\n      <div class=\"bp-body\">\n        <p>The demand for Certified Nursing Assistants (CNA) in Kenya continues to grow as hospitals, clinics, homecare agencies, and international employers seek skilled patient-care professionals. As a result, more students are searching for the best colleges offering CNA courses in Kenya &mdash; institutions that provide accredited, competency-based, and industry-aligned training.</p>\n        <p>Kenya has several institutions offering CNA programmes, but only a few deliver high-quality, practical, and internationally aligned CNA training. Among these, GoCare Training Institute stands out as one of the most reputable and specialised CNA training institutions.</p>\n\n        <h2>What Makes a Good CNA Training College?</h2>\n        <p>A strong CNA institution should offer:</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Competency-based training (CBET)</li>\n          <li>Accredited and regulator-recognised curriculum</li>\n          <li>Practical, hands-on clinical exposure</li>\n          <li>Qualified trainers with medical backgrounds</li>\n          <li>Clear progression pathways</li>\n          <li>High employability for graduates</li>\n          <li>International certification options</li>\n          <li>Practising licence for eligible programmes</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h2>Best Colleges Offering CNA Courses in Kenya</h2>\n\n        <h3>1. GoCare Training Institute</h3>\n        <p>GoCare Training Institute is one of Kenya\'s leading institutions offering Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) training. It stands out for its:</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li>\n          <li>Strong focus on medical and health sciences</li>\n          <li>Practical, hands-on clinical training</li>\n          <li>Government-recognised and approved qualifications</li>\n          <li>Eligibility for KHPOA practising licence</li>\n          <li>International CNA certification pathways (SDC Canada, AMCA USA)</li>\n          <li>High employability in hospitals, clinics, homecare agencies, and international markets</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h3>2. KMTC (Kenya Medical Training College)</h3>\n        <p>KMTC offers various patient-care support programmes, including health assistant and community health programmes that align with CNA-level competencies. It is widely recognised for its medical training infrastructure.</p>\n\n        <h3>3. St. John Ambulance Training Institute</h3>\n        <p>Known for emergency care and first aid training, St. John also offers caregiver and patient-support programmes that complement CNA-level training.</p>\n\n        <h3>4. Nairobi Women\'s Hospital College</h3>\n        <p>Offers health-related certificate programmes with strong clinical exposure, including patient-care support courses relevant to CNA practice.</p>\n\n        <h3>5. AIC Kijabe College of Health Sciences</h3>\n        <p>Provides health assistant and patient-care programmes with strong clinical integration, suitable for learners seeking CNA-equivalent training.</p>\n\n        <h3>6. Mission-Based Medical Colleges</h3>\n        <p>Several mission hospitals across Kenya offer patient-care support programmes aligned with CNA competencies, including Tenwek Hospital Training College, PCEA Chogoria Hospital College, and Kijabe Mission Hospital Training Centre.</p>\n\n        <h2>Why GoCare Training Institute Stands Out</h2>\n        <ol>\n          <li><strong>International CNA Certification Pathways</strong> &mdash; GoCare offers additional pathways to SDC Canada CNA Certification and AMCA USA CNA Certification, giving learners global mobility and international job opportunities.</li>\n          <li><strong>KHPOA Practising Licence Eligibility</strong> &mdash; GoCare\'s CNA programme aligns with Kenya Health Professions Oversight Authority requirements, enabling graduates to pursue formal licensing.</li>\n          <li><strong>Strong Clinical Exposure</strong> &mdash; Learners train in real healthcare environments, gaining practical skills in bedside care, vital signs monitoring, infection control, and basic nursing procedures.</li>\n          <li><strong>Competency-Based Curriculum</strong> &mdash; Training follows the TVET CDACC model, ensuring learners graduate with demonstrable skills and legitimate certifications.</li>\n          <li><strong>High Employability</strong> &mdash; GoCare CNA graduates are highly sought after in hospitals, clinics, nursing homes, homecare agencies, and international healthcare markets.</li>\n        </ol>\n\n        <div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare remains a top choice for students seeking a professional, globally aligned CNA qualification with both local accreditation and international certification pathways.</p></div>\n\n        <h2>Who Should Enrol in a CNA Course?</h2>\n        <p>The CNA programme is ideal for:</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Form Four leavers seeking a medical career</li>\n          <li>Caregivers wanting formal certification</li>\n          <li>Individuals planning to work abroad</li>\n          <li>Students preparing for nursing or clinical careers</li>\n          <li>Anyone passionate about patient care</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bp-cta\">\n        <h3>Ready to Start Your CNA Journey?</h3>\n        <p>Join GoCare\'s accredited CNA programme and gain a nationally recognised qualification with international certification pathways.</p>\n        <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>', '[{\"body\": \"A structured guide to Kenya\'s top Certified Nursing Assistant training institutions — and what sets them apart. 5 min read 21 May 2026 Healthcare The demand for Certified Nursing Assistants (CNA) in Kenya continues to grow as hospitals, clinics, homecare agencies, and international employers seek skilled patient-care professionals. As a result, more students are searching for the best colleges offering CNA courses in Kenya — institutions that provide accredited, competency-based, and industry-aligned training. Kenya has several institutions offering CNA programmes, but only a few deliver high-quality, practical, and internationally aligned CNA training. Among these, GoCare Training Institute stands out as one of the most reputable and specialised CNA training institutions.\", \"heading\": \"Best Colleges Offering CNA Courses in Kenya\"}, {\"body\": \"A strong CNA institution should offer: Competency-based training (CBET) Accredited and regulator-recognised curriculum Practical, hands-on clinical exposure Qualified trainers with medical backgrounds Clear progression pathways High employability for graduates International certification options Practising licence for eligible programmes\", \"heading\": \"What Makes a Good CNA Training College?\"}, {\"body\": \"\", \"heading\": \"Best Colleges Offering CNA Courses in Kenya\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare Training Institute is one of Kenya\'s leading institutions offering Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) training. It stands out for its: Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum Strong focus on medical and health sciences Practical, hands-on clinical training Government-recognised and approved qualifications Eligibility for KHPOA practising licence International CNA certification pathways (SDC Canada, AMCA USA) High employability in hospitals, clinics, homecare agencies, and international markets\", \"heading\": \"1. GoCare Training Institute\"}, {\"body\": \"KMTC offers various patient-care support programmes, including health assistant and community health programmes that align with CNA-level competencies. It is widely recognised for its medical training infrastructure.\", \"heading\": \"2. KMTC (Kenya Medical Training College)\"}, {\"body\": \"Known for emergency care and first aid training, St. John also offers caregiver and patient-support programmes that complement CNA-level training.\", \"heading\": \"3. St. John Ambulance Training Institute\"}, {\"body\": \"Offers health-related certificate programmes with strong clinical exposure, including patient-care support courses relevant to CNA practice.\", \"heading\": \"4. Nairobi Women\'s Hospital College\"}, {\"body\": \"Provides health assistant and patient-care programmes with strong clinical integration, suitable for learners seeking CNA-equivalent training.\", \"heading\": \"5. AIC Kijabe College of Health Sciences\"}, {\"body\": \"Several mission hospitals across Kenya offer patient-care support programmes aligned with CNA competencies, including Tenwek Hospital Training College, PCEA Chogoria Hospital College, and Kijabe Mission Hospital Training Centre.\", \"heading\": \"6. Mission-Based Medical Colleges\"}, {\"body\": \"International CNA Certification Pathways — GoCare offers additional pathways to SDC Canada CNA Certification and AMCA USA CNA Certification, giving learners global mobility and international job opportunities. KHPOA Practising Licence Eligibility — GoCare\'s CNA programme aligns with Kenya Health Professions Oversight Authority requirements, enabling graduates to pursue formal licensing. Strong Clinical Exposure — Learners train in real healthcare environments, gaining practical skills in bedside care, vital signs monitoring, infection control, and basic nursing procedures. Competency-Based Curriculum — Training follows the TVET CDACC model, ensuring learners graduate with demonstrable skills and legitimate certifications. High Employability — GoCare CNA graduates are highly sought after in hospitals, clinics, nursing homes, homecare agencies, and international healthcare markets. GoCare remains a top choice for students seeking a professional, globally aligned CNA qualification with both local accreditation and international certification pathways.\", \"heading\": \"Why GoCare Training Institute Stands Out\"}, {\"body\": \"The CNA programme is ideal for: Form Four leavers seeking a medical career Caregivers wanting formal certification Individuals planning to work abroad Students preparing for nursing or clinical careers Anyone passionate about patient care\", \"heading\": \"Who Should Enrol in a CNA Course?\"}, {\"body\": \"Join GoCare\'s accredited CNA programme and gain a nationally recognised qualification with international certification pathways. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Ready to Start Your CNA Journey?\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(15, 'Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) — Training Options at GoCare | GoCare Institute', 'cna-training-options', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\r\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\r\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"stethoscope\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Healthcare</span>\r\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) &mdash; Training Options at GoCare</h1>\r\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Three accredited pathways to become a competent, job-ready nursing assistant &mdash; choose the route that fits your entry level and timeline.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 5 min read</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 02 Jun 2026</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Healthcare</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC00994.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare CNA training pathways\">\r\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>GoCare Training Institute offers three structured and accredited pathways for learners who want to become Certified Nursing Assistants (CNA). Each option accommodates different academic backgrounds, career goals, and timelines &mdash; while maintaining GoCare&apos;s high standards of practical, competency-based healthcare training.</p>\r\n<p>All options include a second free CNA course with fully sponsored international training and certification, making graduates competitive both locally and internationally.</p>\r\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Option 1: Healthcare Support Services (HSS) &ndash; Level 5 / Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA)</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE D (Plain) and above &bull; Duration: 1&frac12; Years &bull; TVET CDACC + KHPOA Practising Licence</p><p>The highest-level CNA pathway, ideal for learners seeking a licensed, advanced clinical support role. <strong>Learn:</strong> Advanced patient care, Vital signs monitoring, Infection control, Clinical procedures, Professional ethics, Emergency response, Documentation and reporting. <strong>Careers:</strong> Licensed CNA, Healthcare Support Assistant, Hospital Services Assistant, Long-Term Care Assistant.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Option 2: Caregiver Course &ndash; Level 4 / Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA)</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE Certificate (Any Grade) &bull; Duration: 8 Months &bull; TVET CDACC + FREE international CNA cert</p><p>A shorter, practical, and market-ready route into caregiving and CNA roles. <strong>Learn:</strong> Patient hygiene and personal care, Feeding and nutrition support, Vital signs monitoring, Mobility and transfer techniques, Safety and emergency response, Communication and documentation. <strong>Careers:</strong> Caregiver, CNA, Health Care Assistant, Patient Attendant.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Option 3: Home-Based Care Support &ndash; Level 3 / CNA Entry Pathway</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; Duration: 5 Months &bull; TVET CDACC + FREE international cert</p><p>The most accessible entry into the CNA pathway &mdash; open to KCPE and all KCSE grades. Leads directly to Level 4 and Level 5 (CNA) progression. <strong>Learn:</strong> Home-based care, Patient hygiene, Feeding, Mobility assistance, Infection prevention.</p></div>\r\n<h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>FREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div></div>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\r\n      <h3>Start Your CNA Training Today</h3>\r\n      <p>Choose your pathway and begin your journey to becoming a nationally licensed, internationally certified CNA.</p>\r\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Three accredited pathways to become a competent, job-ready nursing assistant — choose the route that fits your entry level and timeline. 5 min read 02 Jun 2026 Healthcare GoCare Training Institute offers three structured and accredited pathways for learners who want to become Certified Nursing Assistants (CNA). Each option accommodates different academic backgrounds, career goals, and timelines — while maintaining GoCare&apos;s high standards of practical, competency-based healthcare training. All options include a second free CNA course with fully sponsored international training and certification, making graduates competitive both locally and internationally.\", \"heading\": \"Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) — Training Options at GoCare\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE D (Plain) and above • Duration: 1½ Years • TVET CDACC + KHPOA Practising LicenceThe highest-level CNA pathway, ideal for learners seeking a licensed, advanced clinical support role. Learn: Advanced patient care, Vital signs monitoring, Infection control, Clinical procedures, Professional ethics, Emergency response, Documentation and reporting. Careers: Licensed CNA, Healthcare Support Assistant, Hospital Services Assistant, Long-Term Care Assistant.\", \"heading\": \"Option 1: Healthcare Support Services (HSS) – Level 5 / Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA)\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE Certificate (Any Grade) • Duration: 8 Months • TVET CDACC + FREE international CNA certA shorter, practical, and market-ready route into caregiving and CNA roles. Learn: Patient hygiene and personal care, Feeding and nutrition support, Vital signs monitoring, Mobility and transfer techniques, Safety and emergency response, Communication and documentation. Careers: Caregiver, CNA, Health Care Assistant, Patient Attendant.\", \"heading\": \"Option 2: Caregiver Course – Level 4 / Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA)\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) • Duration: 5 Months • TVET CDACC + FREE international certThe most accessible entry into the CNA pathway — open to KCPE and all KCSE grades. Leads directly to Level 4 and Level 5 (CNA) progression. Learn: Home-based care, Patient hygiene, Feeding, Mobility assistance, Infection prevention.\", \"heading\": \"Option 3: Home-Based Care Support – Level 3 / CNA Entry Pathway\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentFREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)Modern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Choose your pathway and begin your journey to becoming a nationally licensed, internationally certified CNA. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Start Your CNA Training Today\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(16, 'Colleges Offering TVET CDACC Courses in Kenya | GoCare Institute', 'colleges-tvet-cdacc-kenya', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\r\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\r\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"book-open\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Announcements</span>\r\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Colleges Offering TVET CDACC Courses in Kenya</h1>\r\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">A structured guide to Kenya&apos;s top TVET CDACC institutions &mdash; and why GoCare Training Institute stands out for healthcare, hospitality, and community development.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 5 min read</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 03 Jun 2026</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Announcements</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC01065.jpg\" alt=\"TVET CDACC colleges Kenya\">\r\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>The Technical and Vocational Education and Training Curriculum Development, Assessment and Certification Council (TVET CDACC) is the national body responsible for developing competency-based curricula, conducting assessments, and issuing certifications for TVET programmes in Kenya. As Kenya transitions fully into Competency-Based Education and Training (CBET), more learners are searching for colleges offering TVET CDACC-approved courses.</p>\r\n<h2>What Makes a College a TVET CDACC Institution?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Uses approved CBET curricula</li>\r\n  <li>Employs certified assessors and verifiers</li>\r\n  <li>Provides practical, skills-based training</li>\r\n  <li>Conducts standardised competency assessments</li>\r\n  <li>Maintains quality assurance and compliance</li>\r\n  <li>Issues nationally recognised CDACC certificates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Types of Institutions Offering TVET CDACC Courses in Kenya</h2>\r\n<h3>1. National Polytechnics</h3>\r\n<p>Government-owned institutions offering a wide range of technical and vocational programmes including Kenya Coast National Polytechnic, Kisumu National Polytechnic, Eldoret National Polytechnic, Kabete National Polytechnic, and others across the country.</p>\r\n<h3>2. Technical Training Institutes (TTIs)</h3>\r\n<p>County-level institutions offering vocational and technical training aligned with CBET standards, accessible in most counties across Kenya.</p>\r\n<h3>3. Specialised Private Colleges</h3>\r\n<p>Private institutions that specialise in specific sectors &mdash; healthcare, hospitality, business, or community development &mdash; and deliver TVET CDACC-approved programmes. GoCare Training Institute is among the most reputable in this category.</p>\r\n<h2>GoCare Training Institute &mdash; A Leading TVET CDACC College</h2>\r\n<p>GoCare Training Institute is fully registered, approved, and aligned with TVET CDACC standards. GoCare specialises in:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Medical and health sciences (CNA, Caregiving, Mortuary Science, Theatre Technology, Community Health, Orthopaedic Medicine)</li>\r\n  <li>Hospitality management (Front Office, Housekeeping, Food Production)</li>\r\n  <li>Business and administration (Office Administration, Social Work)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare is additionally accredited by TVETA and NITA, with KHPOA practising licence eligibility for healthcare graduates &mdash; and includes FREE SDC Canada / AMCA USA international certification for eligible programmes.</p></div>\r\n<h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>FREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div></div>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\r\n      <h3>Ready to Start Your Journey?</h3>\r\n      <p>Apply to GoCare Training Institute and take the first step toward a rewarding, in-demand career.</p>\r\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"A structured guide to Kenya&apos;s top TVET CDACC institutions — and why GoCare Training Institute stands out for healthcare, hospitality, and community development. 5 min read 03 Jun 2026 Announcements The Technical and Vocational Education and Training Curriculum Development, Assessment and Certification Council (TVET CDACC) is the national body responsible for developing competency-based curricula, conducting assessments, and issuing certifications for TVET programmes in Kenya. As Kenya transitions fully into Competency-Based Education and Training (CBET), more learners are searching for colleges offering TVET CDACC-approved courses.\", \"heading\": \"Colleges Offering TVET CDACC Courses in Kenya\"}, {\"body\": \"Uses approved CBET curricula Employs certified assessors and verifiers Provides practical, skills-based training Conducts standardised competency assessments Maintains quality assurance and compliance Issues nationally recognised CDACC certificates\", \"heading\": \"What Makes a College a TVET CDACC Institution?\"}, {\"body\": \"\", \"heading\": \"Types of Institutions Offering TVET CDACC Courses in Kenya\"}, {\"body\": \"Government-owned institutions offering a wide range of technical and vocational programmes including Kenya Coast National Polytechnic, Kisumu National Polytechnic, Eldoret National Polytechnic, Kabete National Polytechnic, and others across the country.\", \"heading\": \"1. National Polytechnics\"}, {\"body\": \"County-level institutions offering vocational and technical training aligned with CBET standards, accessible in most counties across Kenya.\", \"heading\": \"2. Technical Training Institutes (TTIs)\"}, {\"body\": \"Private institutions that specialise in specific sectors — healthcare, hospitality, business, or community development — and deliver TVET CDACC-approved programmes. GoCare Training Institute is among the most reputable in this category.\", \"heading\": \"3. Specialised Private Colleges\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare Training Institute is fully registered, approved, and aligned with TVET CDACC standards. GoCare specialises in: Medical and health sciences (CNA, Caregiving, Mortuary Science, Theatre Technology, Community Health, Orthopaedic Medicine) Hospitality management (Front Office, Housekeeping, Food Production) Business and administration (Office Administration, Social Work) GoCare is additionally accredited by TVETA and NITA, with KHPOA practising licence eligibility for healthcare graduates — and includes FREE SDC Canada / AMCA USA international certification for eligible programmes.\", \"heading\": \"GoCare Training Institute — A Leading TVET CDACC College\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentFREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)Modern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Apply to GoCare Training Institute and take the first step toward a rewarding, in-demand career. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Ready to Start Your Journey?\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(17, 'Community Health Courses at GoCare — Certificate Level 5 & Diploma Level 6 | GoCare Institute', 'community-health-courses', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\r\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\r\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"heart-pulse\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Healthcare</span>\r\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Community Health Courses at GoCare &mdash; Certificate Level 5 &amp; Diploma Level 6</h1>\r\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Accredited training for community health and public health practice &mdash; entry requirements, curriculum, career opportunities, and licensing.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 5 min read</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 03 Jun 2026</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Healthcare</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC01088.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare community health training\">\r\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>GoCare Training Institute offers two accredited Community Health programmes designed to prepare learners for professional roles in community health promotion, primary healthcare support, and public health service delivery. Both programmes follow the TVET CDACC curriculum and lead to KHPOA practising licence eligibility.</p>\r\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Certificate in Community Health &ndash; Level 5</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE D+ (Plus) and above, or related Level 4 Certificate &bull; Duration: 1&frac12; Years &bull; TVET CDACC + KHPOA</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Community health support, Basic health promotion, Household and community-level health interventions, Communication and community engagement, Public health safety and basic procedures, Ethical and professional conduct. <strong>Careers:</strong> Community Health Assistant, Community Health Worker, Public Health Support Assistant, Health Outreach Assistant. <strong>Work:</strong> Community health units, Public health programmes, NGOs and health outreach initiatives, Hospitals and health centres.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Diploma in Community Health &ndash; Level 6</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C&ndash; + English/Kiswahili C&ndash;, Biology D+, Maths/Chemistry/Physics/Home Science D Plain, OR Community Health Level 5 &bull; Duration: 2&frac12; Years &bull; TVET CDACC + KHPOA</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Community health systems, Public health interventions, Health promotion and disease prevention, Community-based health programme design and management, Epidemiology and disease surveillance, Referral systems and health data. <strong>Careers:</strong> Community Health Officer, Public Health Practitioner, Health Programme Coordinator. <strong>Work:</strong> County health departments, NGOs, International health organisations, Government public health programmes.</p></div>\r\n<h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>FREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div></div>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\r\n      <h3>Enrol in Community Health at GoCare</h3>\r\n      <p>Train as a community health professional and make a real difference in Kenya\'s public health landscape.</p>\r\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Accredited training for community health and public health practice — entry requirements, curriculum, career opportunities, and licensing. 5 min read 03 Jun 2026 Healthcare GoCare Training Institute offers two accredited Community Health programmes designed to prepare learners for professional roles in community health promotion, primary healthcare support, and public health service delivery. Both programmes follow the TVET CDACC curriculum and lead to KHPOA practising licence eligibility.\", \"heading\": \"Community Health Courses at GoCare — Certificate Level 5 & Diploma Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE D+ (Plus) and above, or related Level 4 Certificate • Duration: 1½ Years • TVET CDACC + KHPOALearn: Community health support, Basic health promotion, Household and community-level health interventions, Communication and community engagement, Public health safety and basic procedures, Ethical and professional conduct. Careers: Community Health Assistant, Community Health Worker, Public Health Support Assistant, Health Outreach Assistant. Work: Community health units, Public health programmes, NGOs and health outreach initiatives, Hospitals and health centres.\", \"heading\": \"Certificate in Community Health – Level 5\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C– + English/Kiswahili C–, Biology D+, Maths/Chemistry/Physics/Home Science D Plain, OR Community Health Level 5 • Duration: 2½ Years • TVET CDACC + KHPOALearn: Community health systems, Public health interventions, Health promotion and disease prevention, Community-based health programme design and management, Epidemiology and disease surveillance, Referral systems and health data. Careers: Community Health Officer, Public Health Practitioner, Health Programme Coordinator. Work: County health departments, NGOs, International health organisations, Government public health programmes.\", \"heading\": \"Diploma in Community Health – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentFREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)Modern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Train as a community health professional and make a real difference in Kenya\'s public health landscape. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Enrol in Community Health at GoCare\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46');
INSERT INTO `blog_posts` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `excerpt`, `content`, `sections`, `image`, `use_builder`, `is_published`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(18, 'How Competency-Based Training Prepares You for the Real World | GoCare Institute', 'competency-based-training', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"zap\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Career Tips</span>\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">How Competency-Based Training Prepares You for the Real World</h1>\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Why employers prefer GoCare graduates &mdash; and how competency-based education gives you practical skills that textbooks alone cannot deliver.</p>\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 5 min read</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 01 May 2026</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Career Tips</span>\n    </div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC01006.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare competency-based training\">\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>One of the most common frustrations among employers across Kenya is hiring graduates who have certificates but cannot perform the tasks those certificates claim to represent. Competency-Based Education and Training (CBET) was designed to solve exactly this problem &mdash; and it is the foundation of everything GoCare teaches.</p>\n\n<h2>What Is Competency-Based Training?</h2>\n<p>Competency-Based Education and Training (CBET) focuses on what a learner can <em>do</em>, not just what they have <em>studied</em>. Assessment is built around demonstrated skills &mdash; can you monitor a patient&apos;s vital signs correctly? Can you prepare a guest room to hotel standards? Can you manage an office filing system? If yes, you are competent. If not, you train until you are.</p>\n<p>This is the model used by Kenya&apos;s TVET CDACC (Technical and Vocational Education and Training Curriculum Development, Assessment and Certification Council) &mdash; and it is the curriculum framework that all GoCare programmes follow.</p>\n\n<h2>Why CBET Produces Job-Ready Graduates</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Skills are verified, not assumed</strong> &mdash; Every graduate is assessed on actual performance, not just written exams.</li>\n  <li><strong>Training mirrors the workplace</strong> &mdash; GoCare&apos;s skills labs simulate real hospital wards, hotel reception desks, and kitchen environments.</li>\n  <li><strong>Attachment is built in</strong> &mdash; All GoCare programmes include guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment, so students gain real work experience before graduation.</li>\n  <li><strong>Employers trust TVET CDACC graduates</strong> &mdash; Because they know what competency assessment means.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>How GoCare Implements CBET</h2>\n<ol>\n  <li><strong>Skills labs</strong> &mdash; Modern, purpose-built labs where students practice clinical, culinary, and administrative tasks in simulated environments.</li>\n  <li><strong>Qualified assessors</strong> &mdash; GoCare&apos;s instructors are industry-experienced professionals, not just academics.</li>\n  <li><strong>Portfolio of evidence</strong> &mdash; Students build a documented record of competencies demonstrated over their training period.</li>\n  <li><strong>Hospital and industrial attachment</strong> &mdash; Real-world placement that bridges the classroom-to-workplace gap.</li>\n  <li><strong>International alignment</strong> &mdash; GoCare&apos;s programmes align with international standards, enabling graduates to earn additional certifications from SDC Canada and AMCA USA.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare graduates don&apos;t just have a certificate. They have demonstrated competencies &mdash; and that is what employers are looking for.</p></div>\n\n<h2>What This Means for Your Career</h2>\n<p>When you graduate from GoCare, you are not starting from scratch in the workplace. You arrive with documented skills, clinical or practical experience, and in many cases an international certification alongside your national qualification. That combination sets you apart from the majority of applicants in any competitive job market.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\n      <h3>Ready to Start Your Journey?</h3>\n      <p>Apply to GoCare Training Institute and take the first step toward a rewarding career.</p>\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Why employers prefer GoCare graduates — and how competency-based education gives you practical skills that textbooks alone cannot deliver. 5 min read 01 May 2026 Career Tips One of the most common frustrations among employers across Kenya is hiring graduates who have certificates but cannot perform the tasks those certificates claim to represent. Competency-Based Education and Training (CBET) was designed to solve exactly this problem — and it is the foundation of everything GoCare teaches.\", \"heading\": \"How Competency-Based Training Prepares You for the Real World\"}, {\"body\": \"Competency-Based Education and Training (CBET) focuses on what a learner can do, not just what they have studied. Assessment is built around demonstrated skills — can you monitor a patient&apos;s vital signs correctly? Can you prepare a guest room to hotel standards? Can you manage an office filing system? If yes, you are competent. If not, you train until you are. This is the model used by Kenya&apos;s TVET CDACC (Technical and Vocational Education and Training Curriculum Development, Assessment and Certification Council) — and it is the curriculum framework that all GoCare programmes follow.\", \"heading\": \"What Is Competency-Based Training?\"}, {\"body\": \"Skills are verified, not assumed — Every graduate is assessed on actual performance, not just written exams. Training mirrors the workplace — GoCare&apos;s skills labs simulate real hospital wards, hotel reception desks, and kitchen environments. Attachment is built in — All GoCare programmes include guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment, so students gain real work experience before graduation. Employers trust TVET CDACC graduates — Because they know what competency assessment means.\", \"heading\": \"Why CBET Produces Job-Ready Graduates\"}, {\"body\": \"Skills labs — Modern, purpose-built labs where students practice clinical, culinary, and administrative tasks in simulated environments. Qualified assessors — GoCare&apos;s instructors are industry-experienced professionals, not just academics. Portfolio of evidence — Students build a documented record of competencies demonstrated over their training period. Hospital and industrial attachment — Real-world placement that bridges the classroom-to-workplace gap. International alignment — GoCare&apos;s programmes align with international standards, enabling graduates to earn additional certifications from SDC Canada and AMCA USA. GoCare graduates don&apos;t just have a certificate. They have demonstrated competencies — and that is what employers are looking for.\", \"heading\": \"How GoCare Implements CBET\"}, {\"body\": \"When you graduate from GoCare, you are not starting from scratch in the workplace. You arrive with documented skills, clinical or practical experience, and in many cases an international certification alongside your national qualification. That combination sets you apart from the majority of applicants in any competitive job market.\", \"heading\": \"What This Means for Your Career\"}, {\"body\": \"Apply to GoCare Training Institute and take the first step toward a rewarding career. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Ready to Start Your Journey?\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(19, 'Best Courses for KCPE Certificate Holders in Kenya | GoCare Institute', 'courses-kcpe', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"book-open\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Admissions Guide</span>\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Best Courses for KCPE Certificate Holders in Kenya</h1>\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Top marketable, practical courses for KCPE graduates &mdash; with a clear step-by-step progression through Kenya\'s TVET system.</p>\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 5 min read</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 21 May 2026</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Admissions Guide</span>\n    </div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_2063.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare KCPE students\">\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>A KCPE Certificate is a strong starting point. KCPE graduates begin at Level 3, progress to Level 4, Level 5, and eventually Level 6 Diplomas &mdash; ensuring every learner has a clear pathway to career success.</p><h2>Level 3 Foundation Courses (KCPE qualifies automatically)</h2><div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Home-Based Care Support &ndash; Level 3</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p>Care skills for home and community settings. Start your healthcare journey here.</p></div><div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Front Office Operations &ndash; Level 3</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p>Foundation for reception, hospitality, and office support roles.</p></div><div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Food Production &amp; Cookery &ndash; Level 3</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p>Practical culinary training for hotels, catering, and hospitality.</p></div><div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Housekeeping &ndash; Level 3</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p>Professional skills for hotels, hospitals, and facilities management.</p></div><h2>After Level 3: Level 4 Programmes</h2><div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Health Care Assistant (HCA)</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Patient support, Infection prevention, Vital signs, Mobility assistance. <strong>Work:</strong> Hospitals, Clinics, Home-based care.</p></div><div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Caregiver &ndash; Level 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE + Level 3 &bull; NITA</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Basic patient care, Hygiene, Feeding assistance, Home care. <strong>Work:</strong> Homes, Clinics, Elderly care facilities.</p></div><div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Certificate in Office Assistance &ndash; Level 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE + Level 3 &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Filing, Customer service, Basic computer skills, Front office support. <strong>Work:</strong> Offices, SMEs, NGOs.</p></div><h2>Progression to Level 5</h2><p>KCPE graduates progress: Level 3 &rarr; Level 4 &rarr; Level 5 (CNA, Community Health, Office Administration). Every step opens new career doors.</p>\n<h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li>\n  <li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li>\n  <li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li>\n  <li>International certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada)</li>\n  <li>Modern practical training labs</li>\n  <li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li>\n  <li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div>\n</div>\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\n      <h3>Ready to Start Your Journey?</h3>\n      <p>Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding, marketable career.</p>\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Top marketable, practical courses for KCPE graduates — with a clear step-by-step progression through Kenya\'s TVET system. 5 min read 21 May 2026 Admissions Guide A KCPE Certificate is a strong starting point. KCPE graduates begin at Level 3, progress to Level 4, Level 5, and eventually Level 6 Diplomas — ensuring every learner has a clear pathway to career success.\", \"heading\": \"Best Courses for KCPE Certificate Holders in Kenya\"}, {\"body\": \"\", \"heading\": \"Level 3 Foundation Courses (KCPE qualifies automatically)\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE • TVET CDACCCare skills for home and community settings. Start your healthcare journey here.\", \"heading\": \"Home-Based Care Support – Level 3\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE • TVET CDACCFoundation for reception, hospitality, and office support roles.\", \"heading\": \"Front Office Operations – Level 3\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE • TVET CDACCPractical culinary training for hotels, catering, and hospitality.\", \"heading\": \"Food Production & Cookery – Level 3\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE • TVET CDACCProfessional skills for hotels, hospitals, and facilities management.\", \"heading\": \"Housekeeping – Level 3\"}, {\"body\": \"\", \"heading\": \"After Level 3: Level 4 Programmes\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE • TVET CDACCLearn: Patient support, Infection prevention, Vital signs, Mobility assistance. Work: Hospitals, Clinics, Home-based care.\", \"heading\": \"Health Care Assistant (HCA)\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE + Level 3 • NITALearn: Basic patient care, Hygiene, Feeding assistance, Home care. Work: Homes, Clinics, Elderly care facilities.\", \"heading\": \"Caregiver – Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE + Level 3 • TVET CDACCLearn: Filing, Customer service, Basic computer skills, Front office support. Work: Offices, SMEs, NGOs.\", \"heading\": \"Certificate in Office Assistance – Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"KCPE graduates progress: Level 3 → Level 4 → Level 5 (CNA, Community Health, Office Administration). Every step opens new career doors.\", \"heading\": \"Progression to Level 5\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment International certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) Modern practical training labs Two campuses — Nairobi CBD and Ruiru High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding, marketable career. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Ready to Start Your Journey?\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(20, 'Best Courses for KCSE A− (Minus) | GoCare Institute', 'courses-kcse-a-minus', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"graduation-cap\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Admissions Guide</span>\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Best Courses for KCSE A&minus; (Minus)</h1>\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Top marketable, practical, and career-focused programmes for KCSE A&minus; students &mdash; full access to advanced Diploma pathways.</p>\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 6 min read</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 22 May 2026</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Admissions Guide</span>\n    </div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC07660.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare A-minus students\">\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>A KCSE A&minus; (Minus) gives students access to the full range of advanced Diploma programmes. A&minus; is one of the strongest entry grades in Kenya\'s TVET system.</p>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>1. Diploma in Perioperative Theatre Technology &ndash; Level 6</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C and above &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p>High-demand surgical support. <strong>Learn:</strong> Theatre setup, Sterilisation, Surgical instrument handling, Infection prevention, Patient preparation. <strong>Work:</strong> Hospitals, Surgical centres, Theatre departments.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>2. Diploma in Orthopaedic &amp; Trauma Medicine &ndash; Level 6</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C &amp; Required Subjects &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Trauma care, Orthopaedic support, Patient handling, Rehabilitation assistance. <strong>Work:</strong> Hospitals, Orthopaedic clinics, Trauma centres.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>3. Diploma in Community Health &ndash; Level 6</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C&ndash; and above &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Community diagnosis, Health promotion, Disease prevention, Public health systems. <strong>Work:</strong> NGOs, County health departments, Public health projects.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>4. Diploma in Mortuary Science &ndash; Level 6</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C&ndash; and above &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Human anatomy, Body preservation, Mortuary operations, Infection control. <strong>Work:</strong> Hospitals, Funeral homes, County morgues.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>5. Diploma in Social Work &ndash; Level 6</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C&ndash; and above &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Social development, Counselling, Community engagement, Case management. <strong>Work:</strong> NGOs, Community programmes, Government agencies.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>6. Certificate in Healthcare Support Services (CNA) &ndash; Level 5</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE D+ and above &bull; TVET CDACC / KHPOA</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Patient care, Vital signs, Infection control, Bedside assistance. <strong>Work:</strong> Hospitals, Clinics, Homecare agencies, International markets.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>7. Certificate in Community Health &ndash; Level 5</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE D+ and above &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Health promotion, Disease prevention, Health education, Field outreach. <strong>Work:</strong> NGOs, County health offices, Community programmes.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>8. Caregiver &ndash; Level 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE Certificate &bull; NITA</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Basic patient care, Hygiene, Feeding and mobility, Home-based care. <strong>Work:</strong> Homes, Clinics, Elderly care facilities.</p></div>\n\n<h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li>\n  <li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li>\n  <li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li>\n  <li>International certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada)</li>\n  <li>Modern practical training labs</li>\n  <li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li>\n  <li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div>\n</div>\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\n      <h3>Ready to Start Your Journey?</h3>\n      <p>Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding, marketable career.</p>\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Top marketable, practical, and career-focused programmes for KCSE A− students — full access to advanced Diploma pathways. 6 min read 22 May 2026 Admissions Guide A KCSE A− (Minus) gives students access to the full range of advanced Diploma programmes. A− is one of the strongest entry grades in Kenya\'s TVET system.\", \"heading\": \"Best Courses for KCSE A− (Minus)\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C and above • TVET CDACCHigh-demand surgical support. Learn: Theatre setup, Sterilisation, Surgical instrument handling, Infection prevention, Patient preparation. Work: Hospitals, Surgical centres, Theatre departments.\", \"heading\": \"1. Diploma in Perioperative Theatre Technology – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C & Required Subjects • TVET CDACCLearn: Trauma care, Orthopaedic support, Patient handling, Rehabilitation assistance. Work: Hospitals, Orthopaedic clinics, Trauma centres.\", \"heading\": \"2. Diploma in Orthopaedic & Trauma Medicine – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C– and above • TVET CDACCLearn: Community diagnosis, Health promotion, Disease prevention, Public health systems. Work: NGOs, County health departments, Public health projects.\", \"heading\": \"3. Diploma in Community Health – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C– and above • TVET CDACCLearn: Human anatomy, Body preservation, Mortuary operations, Infection control. Work: Hospitals, Funeral homes, County morgues.\", \"heading\": \"4. Diploma in Mortuary Science – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C– and above • TVET CDACCLearn: Social development, Counselling, Community engagement, Case management. Work: NGOs, Community programmes, Government agencies.\", \"heading\": \"5. Diploma in Social Work – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE D+ and above • TVET CDACC / KHPOALearn: Patient care, Vital signs, Infection control, Bedside assistance. Work: Hospitals, Clinics, Homecare agencies, International markets.\", \"heading\": \"6. Certificate in Healthcare Support Services (CNA) – Level 5\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE D+ and above • TVET CDACCLearn: Health promotion, Disease prevention, Health education, Field outreach. Work: NGOs, County health offices, Community programmes.\", \"heading\": \"7. Certificate in Community Health – Level 5\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE Certificate • NITALearn: Basic patient care, Hygiene, Feeding and mobility, Home-based care. Work: Homes, Clinics, Elderly care facilities.\", \"heading\": \"8. Caregiver – Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment International certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) Modern practical training labs Two campuses — Nairobi CBD and Ruiru High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding, marketable career. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Ready to Start Your Journey?\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
