(25, 'Best Courses for KCSE C− (Minus) | GoCare Institute', 'courses-kcse-c-minus', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"graduation-cap\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Admissions Guide</span>\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Best Courses for KCSE C&minus; (Minus)</h1>\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Top marketable, practical, and career-focused programmes for KCSE C&minus; students &mdash; more pathways than you think.</p>\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 6 min read</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 25 May 2026</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Admissions Guide</span>\n    </div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC05936.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare C-minus pathway students\">\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>A KCSE C&ndash; (Minus) opens the door to strong training programmes in Kenya\'s TVET system. C&ndash; learners can access Diploma-level programmes in community health, social work, and mortuary science, plus Certificate programmes in healthcare, business, and hospitality.</p><div class=\"course-card\"><h3>1. Diploma in Community Health &ndash; Level 6</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C&ndash; and above &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Community diagnosis, Health promotion, Disease prevention, Public health systems. <strong>Work:</strong> NGOs, County health departments.</p></div><div class=\"course-card\"><h3>2. Diploma in Mortuary Science &ndash; Level 6</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C&ndash; and above &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Human anatomy, Body preservation, Mortuary operations, Infection control. <strong>Work:</strong> Hospitals, Funeral homes, County morgues.</p></div><div class=\"course-card\"><h3>3. Diploma in Social Work &ndash; Level 6</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C&ndash; and above &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Social development, Counselling, Community engagement, Case management. <strong>Work:</strong> NGOs, Government agencies.</p></div><div class=\"course-card\"><h3>4. Certificate in Healthcare Support Services (CNA) &ndash; Level 5</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE D+ and above &bull; TVET CDACC / KHPOA</p><p>C&ndash; qualifies automatically. <strong>Work:</strong> Hospitals, Clinics, Homecare agencies, International markets.</p></div><div class=\"course-card\"><h3>5. Health Care Assistant (HCA)</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C&ndash; / KCPE &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Work:</strong> Hospitals, Clinics, Homecare, Community health programmes.</p></div><div class=\"course-card\"><h3>6. Caregiver &ndash; Level 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE Certificate &bull; NITA</p><p><strong>Work:</strong> Homes, Clinics, Elderly care facilities, Community programmes.</p></div>\n<h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li>\n  <li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li>\n  <li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li>\n  <li>International certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada)</li>\n  <li>Modern practical training labs</li>\n  <li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li>\n  <li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div>\n</div>\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\n      <h3>Ready to Start Your Journey?</h3>\n      <p>Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding, marketable career.</p>\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Top marketable, practical, and career-focused programmes for KCSE C− students — more pathways than you think. 6 min read 25 May 2026 Admissions Guide A KCSE C– (Minus) opens the door to strong training programmes in Kenya\'s TVET system. C– learners can access Diploma-level programmes in community health, social work, and mortuary science, plus Certificate programmes in healthcare, business, and hospitality.\", \"heading\": \"Best Courses for KCSE C− (Minus)\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C– and above • TVET CDACCLearn: Community diagnosis, Health promotion, Disease prevention, Public health systems. Work: NGOs, County health departments.\", \"heading\": \"1. Diploma in Community Health – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C– and above • TVET CDACCLearn: Human anatomy, Body preservation, Mortuary operations, Infection control. Work: Hospitals, Funeral homes, County morgues.\", \"heading\": \"2. Diploma in Mortuary Science – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C– and above • TVET CDACCLearn: Social development, Counselling, Community engagement, Case management. Work: NGOs, Government agencies.\", \"heading\": \"3. Diploma in Social Work – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE D+ and above • TVET CDACC / KHPOAC– qualifies automatically. Work: Hospitals, Clinics, Homecare agencies, International markets.\", \"heading\": \"4. Certificate in Healthcare Support Services (CNA) – Level 5\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C– / KCPE • TVET CDACCWork: Hospitals, Clinics, Homecare, Community health programmes.\", \"heading\": \"5. Health Care Assistant (HCA)\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE Certificate • NITAWork: Homes, Clinics, Elderly care facilities, Community programmes.\", \"heading\": \"6. Caregiver – Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment International certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) Modern practical training labs Two campuses — Nairobi CBD and Ruiru High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding, marketable career. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Ready to Start Your Journey?\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(26, 'Best Courses for KCSE C (Plain) | GoCare Institute', 'courses-kcse-c-plain', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"graduation-cap\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Admissions Guide</span>\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Best Courses for KCSE C (Plain)</h1>\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Top marketable, practical, and career-focused programmes for KCSE C students &mdash; a wide range of Certificate and Diploma options.</p>\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 6 min read</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 25 May 2026</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Admissions Guide</span>\n    </div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC05978.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare C students career guidance\">\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>A KCSE C (Plain) gives students access to a wide range of strong Certificate and Diploma programmes across healthcare, community development, mortuary science, theatre technology, orthopaedics, social work, business, and hospitality.</p>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>1. Diploma in Perioperative Theatre Technology &ndash; Level 6</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C and above &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p>High-demand surgical support. <strong>Learn:</strong> Theatre setup, Sterilisation, Surgical instrument handling, Infection prevention, Patient preparation. <strong>Work:</strong> Hospitals, Surgical centres, Theatre departments.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>2. Diploma in Orthopaedic &amp; Trauma Medicine &ndash; Level 6</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C &amp; Required Subjects &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Trauma care, Orthopaedic support, Patient handling, Rehabilitation assistance. <strong>Work:</strong> Hospitals, Orthopaedic clinics, Trauma centres.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>3. Diploma in Community Health &ndash; Level 6</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C&ndash; and above &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Community diagnosis, Health promotion, Disease prevention, Public health systems. <strong>Work:</strong> NGOs, County health departments, Public health projects.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>4. Diploma in Mortuary Science &ndash; Level 6</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C&ndash; and above &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Human anatomy, Body preservation, Mortuary operations, Infection control. <strong>Work:</strong> Hospitals, Funeral homes, County morgues.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>5. Diploma in Social Work &ndash; Level 6</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C&ndash; and above &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Social development, Counselling, Community engagement, Case management. <strong>Work:</strong> NGOs, Community programmes, Government agencies.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>6. Certificate in Healthcare Support Services (CNA) &ndash; Level 5</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE D+ and above &bull; TVET CDACC / KHPOA</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Patient care, Vital signs, Infection control, Bedside assistance. <strong>Work:</strong> Hospitals, Clinics, Homecare agencies, International markets.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>7. Certificate in Community Health &ndash; Level 5</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE D+ and above &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Health promotion, Disease prevention, Health education, Field outreach. <strong>Work:</strong> NGOs, County health offices, Community programmes.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>8. Caregiver &ndash; Level 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE Certificate &bull; NITA</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Basic patient care, Hygiene, Feeding and mobility, Home-based care. <strong>Work:</strong> Homes, Clinics, Elderly care facilities.</p></div>\n\n<h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li>\n  <li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li>\n  <li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li>\n  <li>International certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada)</li>\n  <li>Modern practical training labs</li>\n  <li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li>\n  <li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div>\n</div>\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\n      <h3>Ready to Start Your Journey?</h3>\n      <p>Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding, marketable career.</p>\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Top marketable, practical, and career-focused programmes for KCSE C students — a wide range of Certificate and Diploma options. 6 min read 25 May 2026 Admissions Guide A KCSE C (Plain) gives students access to a wide range of strong Certificate and Diploma programmes across healthcare, community development, mortuary science, theatre technology, orthopaedics, social work, business, and hospitality.\", \"heading\": \"Best Courses for KCSE C (Plain)\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C and above • TVET CDACCHigh-demand surgical support. Learn: Theatre setup, Sterilisation, Surgical instrument handling, Infection prevention, Patient preparation. Work: Hospitals, Surgical centres, Theatre departments.\", \"heading\": \"1. Diploma in Perioperative Theatre Technology – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C & Required Subjects • TVET CDACCLearn: Trauma care, Orthopaedic support, Patient handling, Rehabilitation assistance. Work: Hospitals, Orthopaedic clinics, Trauma centres.\", \"heading\": \"2. Diploma in Orthopaedic & Trauma Medicine – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C– and above • TVET CDACCLearn: Community diagnosis, Health promotion, Disease prevention, Public health systems. Work: NGOs, County health departments, Public health projects.\", \"heading\": \"3. Diploma in Community Health – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C– and above • TVET CDACCLearn: Human anatomy, Body preservation, Mortuary operations, Infection control. Work: Hospitals, Funeral homes, County morgues.\", \"heading\": \"4. Diploma in Mortuary Science – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C– and above • TVET CDACCLearn: Social development, Counselling, Community engagement, Case management. Work: NGOs, Community programmes, Government agencies.\", \"heading\": \"5. Diploma in Social Work – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE D+ and above • TVET CDACC / KHPOALearn: Patient care, Vital signs, Infection control, Bedside assistance. Work: Hospitals, Clinics, Homecare agencies, International markets.\", \"heading\": \"6. Certificate in Healthcare Support Services (CNA) – Level 5\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE D+ and above • TVET CDACCLearn: Health promotion, Disease prevention, Health education, Field outreach. Work: NGOs, County health offices, Community programmes.\", \"heading\": \"7. Certificate in Community Health – Level 5\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE Certificate • NITALearn: Basic patient care, Hygiene, Feeding and mobility, Home-based care. Work: Homes, Clinics, Elderly care facilities.\", \"heading\": \"8. Caregiver – Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment International certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) Modern practical training labs Two campuses — Nairobi CBD and Ruiru High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding, marketable career. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Ready to Start Your Journey?\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
