(28, 'Best Courses for KCSE D− (Minus) | GoCare Institute', 'courses-kcse-d-minus', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"graduation-cap\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Admissions Guide</span>\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Best Courses for KCSE D&minus; (Minus)</h1>\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Top marketable, regulator-aligned courses for students with KCSE D&minus; and below &mdash; more options than you think.</p>\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 6 min read</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 26 May 2026</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Admissions Guide</span>\n    </div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC07206.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare D-minus pathway students\">\n    <div class=\"bp-body\">\n<p>A KCSE D&ndash; (Minus) and below does not limit your future. Kenya&apos;s TVET system is designed to give every learner &mdash; regardless of grade &mdash; a clear, practical, and employable pathway into the job market.</p>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>1. Home-Based Care Support &ndash; Level 3</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p>One of the strongest foundation courses for D&ndash; learners. <strong>Learn:</strong> Basic caregiving, Hygiene and sanitation, Patient mobility, Home-based care procedures. <strong>Work:</strong> Homes, Clinics, Community health programmes, Elderly care centres.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>2. Health Care Assistant (HCA) &ndash; Level 3 / Level 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE D&ndash;, D Plain, D+, or KCPE &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Patient care support, Vital signs monitoring, Infection prevention, Basic nursing skills, Mobility assistance. <strong>Work:</strong> Hospitals, Clinics, Nursing homes, Home-based care.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>3. Food &amp; Beverage Service &ndash; Level 3</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Table service, Customer care, Restaurant operations, Beverage handling. <strong>Work:</strong> Hotels, Restaurants, Caf&eacute;s, Catering companies.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>4. Housekeeping &amp; Accommodation &ndash; Level 3</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Room cleaning, Laundry operations, Linen management, Hygiene &amp; sanitation. <strong>Work:</strong> Hotels, Lodges, Hospitals, Guest houses, Airlines.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>5. Front Office Operations &ndash; Level 3</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Reception operations, Guest check-in &amp; check-out, Customer service, Telephone etiquette. <strong>Work:</strong> Hotels, Travel agencies, Corporate offices.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>6. Caregiver Course &ndash; Level II (NITA)</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE D&ndash; and above &bull; NITA</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Patient hygiene, Feeding, Grooming, Mobility assistance, Basic supportive nursing. <strong>Work:</strong> Homes, Clinics, Community programmes, International homecare agencies.</p></div>\n<h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>International certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) &mdash; fully sponsored</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\n      <h3>Ready to Start Your Journey?</h3>\n      <p>Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding career.</p>\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Top marketable, regulator-aligned courses for students with KCSE D− and below — more options than you think. 6 min read 26 May 2026 Admissions Guide A KCSE D– (Minus) and below does not limit your future. Kenya&apos;s TVET system is designed to give every learner — regardless of grade — a clear, practical, and employable pathway into the job market.\", \"heading\": \"Best Courses for KCSE D− (Minus)\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) • TVET CDACCOne of the strongest foundation courses for D– learners. Learn: Basic caregiving, Hygiene and sanitation, Patient mobility, Home-based care procedures. Work: Homes, Clinics, Community health programmes, Elderly care centres.\", \"heading\": \"1. Home-Based Care Support – Level 3\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE D–, D Plain, D+, or KCPE • TVET CDACCLearn: Patient care support, Vital signs monitoring, Infection prevention, Basic nursing skills, Mobility assistance. Work: Hospitals, Clinics, Nursing homes, Home-based care.\", \"heading\": \"2. Health Care Assistant (HCA) – Level 3 / Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) • TVET CDACCLearn: Table service, Customer care, Restaurant operations, Beverage handling. Work: Hotels, Restaurants, Cafés, Catering companies.\", \"heading\": \"3. Food & Beverage Service – Level 3\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) • TVET CDACCLearn: Room cleaning, Laundry operations, Linen management, Hygiene & sanitation. Work: Hotels, Lodges, Hospitals, Guest houses, Airlines.\", \"heading\": \"4. Housekeeping & Accommodation – Level 3\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE (Any Grade) • TVET CDACCLearn: Reception operations, Guest check-in & check-out, Customer service, Telephone etiquette. Work: Hotels, Travel agencies, Corporate offices.\", \"heading\": \"5. Front Office Operations – Level 3\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE D– and above • NITALearn: Patient hygiene, Feeding, Grooming, Mobility assistance, Basic supportive nursing. Work: Homes, Clinics, Community programmes, International homecare agencies.\", \"heading\": \"6. Caregiver Course – Level II (NITA)\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentInternational certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) — fully sponsoredModern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding career. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Ready to Start Your Journey?\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(29, 'Best Courses for KCSE D+ (Plus) | GoCare Institute', 'courses-kcse-d-plus', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"graduation-cap\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Admissions Guide</span>\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Best Courses for KCSE D+ (Plus)</h1>\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Top marketable, practical, and regulator-approved courses for KCSE D+ students in Kenya.</p>\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 6 min read</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 26 May 2026</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Admissions Guide</span>\n    </div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC07203.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare D-plus students\">\n    <div class=\"bp-body\">\n<p>A KCSE D+ (Plus) opens the door to many strong, employable, and career-building courses in Kenya&apos;s TVET system. With the right training, D+ students can build successful careers in healthcare, community health, mortuary science, theatre technology, business, social work, hospitality, and entrepreneurship.</p>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>1. Certificate in Community Health &ndash; Level 5</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE D+ and above &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Community mobilisation, Health promotion, Basic epidemiology, First aid, Public health communication. <strong>Work:</strong> NGOs, Community health programmes, Clinics, County health initiatives.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>2. Certificate in Healthcare Support Services (CNA) &ndash; Level 5</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE D (Plain) and above &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Patient care, Vital signs, Infection control, Basic nursing support. <strong>Work:</strong> Hospitals, Clinics, Nursing homes, Home-based care.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>3. Certificate in Mortuary Science &ndash; Level 5</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE D and above &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p>A specialised and highly employable healthcare support programme. <strong>Learn:</strong> Body handling, Preservation basics, Mortuary hygiene, Ethical practice. <strong>Work:</strong> Hospitals, Funeral homes, County morgues, Private mortuaries.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>4. Certificate in Office Administration &ndash; Level 5</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE D and above &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Office procedures, Records management, Customer care, Computer applications. <strong>Work:</strong> Offices, Schools, Hospitals, Law firms, Companies.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>5. Certificate in Caregiving &ndash; Level 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE Certificate (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Elderly care, Childcare, Disability support, Home-based care, Hygiene &amp; sanitation. <strong>Work:</strong> Homes, Clinics, Community programmes, Elderly care centres.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>6. Certificate in Community-Based Services &ndash; Level 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE Certificate &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Community engagement, Basic counselling, Social support skills, Fieldwork preparation. <strong>Work:</strong> NGOs, Community programmes, Social support centres.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>7. Food &amp; Beverage Service &ndash; Level 3 / 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Table service, Customer care, Restaurant operations. <strong>Work:</strong> Hotels, Restaurants, Caf&eacute;s, Catering companies.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>8. Housekeeping &amp; Accommodation &ndash; Level 3 / 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Room cleaning, Laundry operations, Guest room preparation, Linen management. <strong>Work:</strong> Hotels, Lodges, Hospitals, Airlines.</p></div>\n<h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>International certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) &mdash; fully sponsored</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\n      <h3>Ready to Start Your Journey?</h3>\n      <p>Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding career.</p>\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Top marketable, practical, and regulator-approved courses for KCSE D+ students in Kenya. 6 min read 26 May 2026 Admissions Guide A KCSE D+ (Plus) opens the door to many strong, employable, and career-building courses in Kenya&apos;s TVET system. With the right training, D+ students can build successful careers in healthcare, community health, mortuary science, theatre technology, business, social work, hospitality, and entrepreneurship.\", \"heading\": \"Best Courses for KCSE D+ (Plus)\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE D+ and above • TVET CDACCLearn: Community mobilisation, Health promotion, Basic epidemiology, First aid, Public health communication. Work: NGOs, Community health programmes, Clinics, County health initiatives.\", \"heading\": \"1. Certificate in Community Health – Level 5\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE D (Plain) and above • TVET CDACCLearn: Patient care, Vital signs, Infection control, Basic nursing support. Work: Hospitals, Clinics, Nursing homes, Home-based care.\", \"heading\": \"2. Certificate in Healthcare Support Services (CNA) – Level 5\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE D and above • TVET CDACCA specialised and highly employable healthcare support programme. Learn: Body handling, Preservation basics, Mortuary hygiene, Ethical practice. Work: Hospitals, Funeral homes, County morgues, Private mortuaries.\", \"heading\": \"3. Certificate in Mortuary Science – Level 5\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE D and above • TVET CDACCLearn: Office procedures, Records management, Customer care, Computer applications. Work: Offices, Schools, Hospitals, Law firms, Companies.\", \"heading\": \"4. Certificate in Office Administration – Level 5\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE Certificate (Any Grade) • TVET CDACCLearn: Elderly care, Childcare, Disability support, Home-based care, Hygiene & sanitation. Work: Homes, Clinics, Community programmes, Elderly care centres.\", \"heading\": \"5. Certificate in Caregiving – Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE Certificate • TVET CDACCLearn: Community engagement, Basic counselling, Social support skills, Fieldwork preparation. Work: NGOs, Community programmes, Social support centres.\", \"heading\": \"6. Certificate in Community-Based Services – Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) • TVET CDACCLearn: Table service, Customer care, Restaurant operations. Work: Hotels, Restaurants, Cafés, Catering companies.\", \"heading\": \"7. Food & Beverage Service – Level 3 / 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) • TVET CDACCLearn: Room cleaning, Laundry operations, Guest room preparation, Linen management. Work: Hotels, Lodges, Hospitals, Airlines.\", \"heading\": \"8. Housekeeping & Accommodation – Level 3 / 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentInternational certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) — fully sponsoredModern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding career. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Ready to Start Your Journey?\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46');
