(30, 'Best Courses for KCSE E and KCPE Graduates | GoCare Institute', 'courses-kcse-e-kcpe', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"graduation-cap\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Admissions Guide</span>\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Best Courses for KCSE E and KCPE Graduates</h1>\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Practical, marketable, and regulator-approved courses for learners with KCSE E or KCPE &mdash; your future starts here.</p>\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 5 min read</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 27 May 2026</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Admissions Guide</span>\n    </div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC07208.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare E and KCPE students\">\n    <div class=\"bp-body\">\n<p>A KCSE E or KCPE result does not limit your future. Kenya&apos;s TVET system is designed to give every learner &mdash; regardless of grade &mdash; a clear, structured, and employable pathway into the job market. With the right course, KCSE E and KCPE graduates can build successful careers in healthcare, hospitality, business, community support, and more.</p>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>1. Home-Based Care Support &ndash; Level 3</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Basic caregiving, Hygiene, Patient mobility, Home-based care. <strong>Work:</strong> Homes, Clinics, Elderly care centres, Community health.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>2. Health Care Assistant (HCA) &ndash; Level 3</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Patient care support, Vital signs, Infection prevention, Basic nursing. <strong>Work:</strong> Hospitals, Clinics, Nursing homes, Home-based care.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>3. Food &amp; Beverage Service &ndash; Level 3</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Table service, Customer care, Restaurant operations. <strong>Work:</strong> Hotels, Restaurants, Caf&eacute;s, Catering companies.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>4. Housekeeping &amp; Laundry &ndash; Level 3</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Room cleaning, Laundry, Linen management, Hygiene. <strong>Work:</strong> Hotels, Lodges, Hospitals.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>5. Front Office Operations &ndash; Level 3</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Reception duties, Guest check-in/out, Customer service, Telephone etiquette. <strong>Work:</strong> Hotels, Travel agencies, Corporate offices.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>6. Certificate in Community-Based Services &ndash; Level 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE Certificate &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Community engagement, Basic counselling, Fieldwork. <strong>Work:</strong> NGOs, Community programmes, Social support centres.</p></div>\n<h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>International certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) &mdash; fully sponsored</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed