uties, Guest check-in/out, Customer service, Telephone etiquette. Work: Hotels, Travel agencies, Corporate offices.\", \"heading\": \"5. Front Office Operations – Level 3\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE Certificate • TVET CDACCLearn: Community engagement, Basic counselling, Fieldwork. Work: NGOs, Community programmes, Social support centres.\", \"heading\": \"6. Certificate in Community-Based Services – Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentInternational certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) — fully sponsoredModern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding career. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Ready to Start Your Journey?\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(31, 'Best Courses for KCSE E | GoCare Institute', 'courses-kcse-e', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"graduation-cap\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Admissions Guide</span>\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Best Courses for KCSE E</h1>\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Top marketable, practical, and career-focused courses for KCSE E students in Kenya &mdash; clear pathways to success.</p>\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 5 min read</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 27 May 2026</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Admissions Guide</span>\n    </div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC07248.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare KCSE E pathway students\">\n    <div class=\"bp-body\">\n<p>A KCSE Mean Grade E still provides a clear and achievable pathway into strong, practical, and employable skills training. Kenya&apos;s TVET system ensures that every learner &mdash; regardless of grade &mdash; can begin at the right level and progress step-by-step into meaningful careers.</p>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Caregiver &ndash; Level 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE Certificate &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Basic patient care, Hygiene support, Feeding and mobility assistance, Home-based care. <strong>Work:</strong> Homes, Clinics, Community health, Elderly care facilities.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Health Care Assistant (HCA)</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE Certificate &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Patient support, Infection prevention, Vital signs, Mobility and feeding assistance. <strong>Work:</strong> Hospitals, Clinics, Home-based care.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Certificate in Community-Based Services &ndash; Level 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE Certificate &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Community engagement, Basic counselling, Social support, Fieldwork. <strong>Work:</strong> NGOs, Community programmes, Social support centres.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Certificate in Office Assistance &ndash; Level 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE Certificate &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Filing, Documentation, Customer service, Basic computer skills, Front office support. <strong>Work:</strong> Offices, SMEs, NGOs.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Home-Based Care Support &ndash; Level 3</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Patient hygiene, Feeding support, Mobility assistance, Basic home-based care. <strong>Work:</strong> Homes, Clinics, Community programmes.</p></div>\n<h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>International certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) &mdash; fully sponsored</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\n      <h3>Ready to Start Your Journey?</h3>\n      <p>Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding career.</p>\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Top marketable, practical, and career-focused courses for KCSE E students in Kenya — clear pathways to success. 5 min read 27 May 2026 Admissions Guide A KCSE Mean Grade E still provides a clear and achievable pathway into strong, practical, and employable skills training. Kenya&apos;s TVET system ensures that every learner — regardless of grade — can begin at the right level and progress step-by-step into meaningful careers.\", \"heading\": \"Best Courses for KCSE E\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE Certificate • TVET CDACCLearn: Basic patient care, Hygiene support, Feeding and mobility assistance, Home-based care. Work: Homes, Clinics, Community health, Elderly care facilities.\", \"heading\": \"Caregiver – Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE Certificate • TVET CDACCLearn: Patient support, Infection prevention, Vital signs, Mobility and feeding assistance. Work: Hospitals, Clinics, Home-based care.\", \"heading\": \"Health Care Assistant (HCA)\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE Certificate • TVET CDACCLearn: Community engagement, Basic counselling, Social support, Fieldwork. Work: NGOs, Community programmes, Social support centres.\", \"heading\": \"Certificate in Community-Based Services – Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE Certificate • TVET CDACCLearn: Filing, Documentation, Customer service, Basic computer skills, Front office support. Work: Offices, SMEs, NGOs.\", \"heading\": \"Certificate in Office Assistance – Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) • TVET CDACCLearn: Patient hygiene, Feeding support, Mobility assistance, Basic home-based care. Work: Homes, Clinics, Community programmes.\", \"heading\": \"Home-Based Care Support – Level 3\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentInternational certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) — fully sponsoredModern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding career. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Ready to Start Your Journey?\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(32, 'From Classroom to Kitchen: Inside GoCare\'s Culinary & Hospitality Labs | GoCare Institute', 'culinary-hospitality-labs', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"utensils\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Hospitality</span>\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">From Classroom to Kitchen: Inside GoCare\'s Culinary &amp; Hospitality Labs</h1>\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">A behind-the-scenes look at the modern training facilities that make GoCare hospitality graduates stand out in Kenya&apos;s hotel and restaurant industry.</p>\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 4 min read</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 05 May 2026</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Hospitality</span>\n    </div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_4430.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare culinary and hospitality training labs\">\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>Ask any hotel manager what separates a great hospitality hire from an average one, and you will hear the same answer: practical experience. GoCare Training Institute was built around this insight. Our culinary and hospitality training labs are purpose-designed to mirror real hotel, restaurant, and service environments &mdash; so that when our graduates walk into their first shift, they already know exactly what to do.</p>\n\n<h2>The Culinary Arts Lab</h2>\n<p>GoCare&apos;s Food Production and Culinary Arts lab is equipped with commercial-grade kitchen equipment, including professional gas ranges, convection ovens, food preparation stations, and a full service area. Students learn to work in a real kitchen environment &mdash; with the same pressure, hygiene standards, and teamwork dynamics they will encounter in any commercial kitchen.</p>\n<p>What students practice in the lab:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Professional cooking techniques for a range of cuisines</li>\n  <li>Menu planning and portion control</li>\n  <li>Baking, pastry, and dessert preparation</li>\n  <li>Food safety, HACCP compliance, and kitchen hygiene</li>\n  <li>Plating and presentation for service</li>\n  <li>Teamwork and kitchen communication</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>The Front Office &amp; Housekeeping Lab</h2>\n<p>GoCare&apos;s hospitality services lab simulates a hotel front desk and housekeeping environment. Students practice checking in guests, handling reservations, managing complaints, and operating hotel management software (PMS) &mdash; all skills that employers expect from day one.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Reception procedures and check-in/check-out operations</li>\n  <li>Telephone etiquette and professional communication</li>\n  <li>Room cleaning, bed-making, and linen management to hotel standards</li>\n  <li>Guest relations and complaint handling</li>\n  <li>Housekeeping management and supervision principles</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Industrial Attachment in Top Establishments</h2>\n<p>Every GoCare hospitality student completes a structured industrial attachment in real hotels, restaurants, and service establishments across Kenya. This placement is guaranteed and coordinated by GoCare&apos;s industry liaison team, ensuring students gain experience that directly maps to their career goals.</p>\n\n<div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare hospitality graduates are hired by hotels, lodges, airlines, restaurants, and international cruise lines &mdash; because they arrive with skills that have been tested in conditions that mirror the real workplace.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\n      <h3>Ready to Start Your Journey?</h3>\n      <p>Apply to GoCare Training Institute and take the first step toward a rewarding career.</p>\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"A behind-the-scenes look at the modern training facilities that make GoCare hospitality graduates stand out in Kenya&apos;s hotel and restaurant industry. 4 min read 05 May 2026 Hospitality Ask any hotel manager what separates a great hospitality hire from an average one, and you will hear the same answer: practical experience. GoCare Training Institute was built around this insight. Our culinary and hospitality training labs are purpose-designed to mirror real hotel, restaurant, and service environments — so that when our graduates walk into their first shift, they already know exactly what to do.\", \"heading\": \"From Classroom to Kitchen: Inside GoCare\'s Culinary & Hospitality Labs\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare&apos;s Food Production and Culinary Arts lab is equipped with commercial-grade kitchen equipment, including professional gas ranges, convection ovens, food preparation stations, and a full service area. Students learn to work in a real kitchen environment — with the same pressure, hygiene standards, and teamwork dynamics they will encounter in any commercial kitchen. What students practice in the lab: Professional cooking techniques for a range of cuisines Menu planning and portion control Baking, pastry, and dessert preparation Food safety, HACCP compliance, and kitchen hygiene Plating and presentation for service Teamwork and kitchen communication\", \"heading\": \"The Culinary Arts Lab\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare&apos;s hospitality services lab simulates a hotel front desk and housekeeping environment. Students practice checking in guests, handling reservations, managing complaints, and operating hotel management software (PMS) — all skills that employers expect from day one. Reception procedures and check-in/check-out operations Telephone etiquette and professional communication Room cleaning, bed-making, and linen management to hotel standards Guest relations and complaint handling Housekeeping management and supervision principles\", \"heading\": \"The Front Office & Housekeeping Lab\"}, {\"body\": \"Every GoCare hospitality student completes a structured industrial attachment in real hotels, restaurants, and service establishments across Kenya. This placement is guaranteed and coordinated by GoCare&apos;s industry liaison team, ensuring students gain experience that directly maps to their career goals. GoCare hospitality graduates are hired by hotels, lodges, airlines, restaurants, and international cruise lines — because they arrive with skills that have been tested in conditions that mirror the real workplace.\", \"heading\": \"Industrial Attachment in Top Establishments\"}, {\"body\": \"Apply to GoCare Training Institute and take the first step toward a rewarding career. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Ready to Start Your Journey?\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(33, 'Difference Between Caregiver, HCA, and CNA | GoCare Institute', 'difference-caregiver-hca-cna', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\r\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\r\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"stethoscope\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Healthcare</span>\r\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Difference Between Caregiver, HCA, and CNA</h1>\r\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Clear definitions, roles, qualifications, salaries, and career pathways &mdash; so you can choose the right course for your goals.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 6 min read</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 04 Jun 2026</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Healthcare</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC01144.jpg\" alt=\"Difference between caregiver HCA and CNA\">\r\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>Many students confuse the terms Caregiver, Health Care Assistant (HCA), and Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) &mdash; yet these roles are very different in training level, responsibilities, salary, and international opportunities. This guide gives you a clear, simple, and accurate breakdown.</p>\r\n<h2>1. Who Is a Caregiver?</h2>\r\n<p>A Caregiver provides basic support to clients who need help with daily living activities, either at home or in a care facility.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Main duties:</strong> Bathing, grooming, feeding, mobility assistance, repositioning, companionship, light housekeeping</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Where they work:</strong> Private homes, homecare agencies, elderly care centres, disability support homes</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Entry:</strong> KCSE (Any Grade) or KCPE for Level 3</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Courses:</strong> Certificate in Caregiving &ndash; Level 4, Caregiver Course &ndash; Level II (NITA), Home-Based Care Support &ndash; Level 3</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Salary in Kenya:</strong> KES 20,000 &ndash; 45,000/month</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Best for:</strong> Beginners entering the healthcare field</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>2. Who Is a Health Care Assistant (HCA)?</h2>\r\n<p>An HCA works in hospitals, clinics, and medical facilities under the supervision of nurses and clinicians, performing more clinical tasks than caregivers.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Main duties:</strong> Taking vital signs, Assisting nurses, Infection control, Patient hygiene, Feeding and mobility, Bedside care, Basic documentation</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Where they work:</strong> Hospitals, Clinics, Nursing homes, Rehabilitation centres</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Entry:</strong> KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Courses:</strong> Certificate in Health Care Assistant (HCA), Caregiving &ndash; Level 4</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Salary in Kenya:</strong> KES 25,000 &ndash; 50,000/month</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Best for:</strong> Learners who want hospital-based experience</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>3. Who Is a Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA)?</h2>\r\n<p>A CNA is the most advanced of the three roles &mdash; a licensed, clinically trained healthcare professional who works directly within medical teams in hospitals and care facilities.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Main duties:</strong> All HCA duties plus advanced patient monitoring, clinical procedures, emergency response, documentation and reporting to nurses</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Where they work:</strong> Hospitals, Clinics, Long-term care facilities, International healthcare settings</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Entry:</strong> KCSE D (Plain) and above</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Courses:</strong> Healthcare Support Services &ndash; Level 5 (CNA)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Salary in Kenya:</strong> KES 30,000 &ndash; 60,000/month. International: KES 150,000 &ndash; 450,000/month</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Best for:</strong> Learners targeting licensed, hospital-level, and international positions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Quick Comparison</h2>\r\n<div class=\"compare-table-scroll\"><table class=\"compare-table\">\r\n  <thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Caregiver</th><th>HCA</th><th>CNA</th></tr></thead>\r\n  <tbody>\r\n    <tr><td>Entry Grade</td><td>Any grade / KCPE</td><td>Any grade / KCPE</td><td>KCSE D (Plain)+</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>Duration</td><td>5&ndash;8 months</td><td>5 months</td><td>1&frac12; years</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>Clinical Level</td><td>Basic</td><td>Intermediate</td><td>Advanced</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>KHPOA Licence</td><td>No</td><td>No</td><td>Yes (Level 5)</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>International Scope</td><td>Moderate</td><td>Good</td><td>Excellent</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>Kenya Salary</td><td>KES 20k&ndash;45k</td><td>KES 25k&ndash;50k</td><td>KES 30k&ndash;60k</td></tr>\r\n  </tbody>\r\n</table></div>\r\n<div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>All three pathways are available at GoCare Training Institute &mdash; and all include FREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada or AMCA USA) to maximise your global employability.</p></div><h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>FREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div></div>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\r\n      <h3>Choose Your Healthcare Pathway at GoCare</h3>\r\n      <p>From Caregiver Level 3 to CNA Level 5 &mdash; GoCare has the right programme for your grade, timeline, and career goals.</p>\r\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Clear definitions, roles, qualifications, salaries, and career pathways — so you can choose the right course for your goals. 6 min read 04 Jun 2026 Healthcare Many students confuse the terms Caregiver, Health Care Assistant (HCA), and Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) — yet these roles are very different in training level, responsibilities, salary, and international opportunities. This guide gives you a clear, simple, and accurate breakdown.\", \"heading\": \"Difference Between Caregiver, HCA, and CNA\"}, {\"body\": \"A Caregiver provides basic support to clients who need help with daily living activities, either at home or in a care facility. Main duties: Bathing, grooming, feeding, mobility assistance, repositioning, companionship, light housekeeping Where they work: Private homes, homecare agencies, elderly care centres, disability support homes Entry: KCSE (Any Grade) or KCPE for Level 3 Courses: Certificate in Caregiving – Level 4, Caregiver Course – Level II (NITA), Home-Based Care Support – Level 3 Salary in Kenya: KES 20,000 – 45,000/month Best for: Beginners entering the healthcare field\", \"heading\": \"1. Who Is a Caregiver?\"}, {\"body\": \"An HCA works in hospitals, clinics, and medical facilities under the supervision of nurses and clinicians, performing more clinical tasks than caregivers. Main duties: Taking vital signs, Assisting nurses, Infection control, Patient hygiene, Feeding and mobility, Bedside care, Basic documentation Where they work: Hospitals, Clinics, Nursing homes, Rehabilitation centres Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) Courses: Certificate in Health Care Assistant (HCA), Caregiving – Level 4 Salary in Kenya: KES 25,000 – 50,000/month Best for: Learners who want hospital-based experience\", \"heading\": \"2. Who Is a Health Care Assistant (HCA)?\"}, {\"body\": \"A CNA is the most advanced of the three roles — a licensed, clinically trained healthcare professional who works directly within medical teams in hospitals and care facilities. Main duties: All HCA duties plus advanced patient monitoring, clinical procedures, emergency response, documentation and reporting to nurses Where they work: Hospitals, Clinics, Long-term care facilities, International healthcare settings Entry: KCSE D (Plain) and above Courses: Healthcare Support Services – Level 5 (CNA) Salary in Kenya: KES 30,000 – 60,000/month. International: KES 150,000 – 450,000/month Best for: Learners targeting licensed, hospital-level, and international positions\", \"heading\": \"3. Who Is a Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA)?\"}, {\"body\": \"FeatureCaregiverHCACNA Entry GradeAny grade / KCPEAny grade / KCPEKCSE D (Plain)+ Duration5–8 months5 months1½ years Clinical LevelBasicIntermediateAdvanced KHPOA LicenceNoNoYes (Level 5) International ScopeModerateGoodExcellent Kenya SalaryKES 20k–45kKES 25k–50kKES 30k–60k All three pathways are available at GoCare Training Institute — and all include FREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada or AMCA USA) to maximise your global employability.\", \"heading\": \"Quick Comparison\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentFREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)Modern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"From Caregiver Level 3 to CNA Level 5 — GoCare has the right programme for your grade, timeline, and career goals. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Choose Your Healthcare Pathway at GoCare\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(34, 'Difference Between TVET CDACC, TVETA, NITA, and KHPOA | GoCare Institute', 'difference-tvet-cdacc-tveta-nita-khpoa', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\r\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\r\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"info\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Announcements</span>\r\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Difference Between TVET CDACC, TVETA, NITA, and KHPOA</h1>\r\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">A clear, accurate, and regulator-aligned guide to Kenya&apos;s training, assessment, and accreditation bodies &mdash; so you know exactly what your certificate means.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 6 min read</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 04 Jun 2026</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Announcements</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC01150.jpg\" alt=\"TVET CDACC TVETA NITA KHPOA explained\">\r\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>Kenya&apos;s education and skills-training ecosystem includes several regulatory bodies that oversee curriculum development, assessment, accreditation, and industry standards. Understanding the difference between TVET CDACC, TVETA, NITA, and KHPOA is essential when choosing a training institution or career pathway.</p>\r\n<h2>1. TVET CDACC &mdash; Curriculum Development, Assessment &amp; Certification Council</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Focus:</strong> Competency-Based Curriculum, Assessment &amp; Certification (CBET). Established under the TVET Act 2013.</p>\r\n<p>TVET CDACC is responsible for: developing competency-based curricula, registering industry assessors, conducting national assessments, issuing competency-based certificates, and ensuring training aligns with industry needs.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Certification levels:</strong> Level 3 (Artisan), Level 4 (Certificate), Level 5 (Diploma), Level 6 (Higher Diploma)</p>\r\n<div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare is fully registered, approved, and aligned with TVET CDACC standards. All GoCare CBET programmes lead to nationally recognised CDACC certifications.</p></div>\r\n<h2>2. TVETA &mdash; Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Focus:</strong> Institution Registration, Licensing &amp; Quality Assurance.</p>\r\n<p>TVETA is responsible for: licensing and registering TVET institutions, inspecting and auditing training quality, ensuring compliance with national standards, and protecting learners from unaccredited providers.</p>\r\n<p><strong>What it means for learners:</strong> A TVETA-licensed institution has been inspected and approved to offer TVET programmes. GoCare Training Institute is fully TVETA-licensed.</p>\r\n<h2>3. NITA &mdash; National Industrial Training Authority</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Focus:</strong> Industrial Training &amp; Artisan Certification.</p>\r\n<p>NITA is responsible for: regulating industrial training in Kenya, certifying artisan and technical skills, issuing the Caregiver Course &ndash; Level II (NITA) certification, and overseeing apprenticeship programmes.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key GoCare programme:</strong> The Caregiver Course &ndash; Level II (NITA) is examined and certified by NITA. It is highly valued by employers in Kenya, UAE, Qatar, and Saudi Arabia.</p>\r\n<h2>4. KHPOA &mdash; Kenya Health Professions Oversight Authority</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Focus:</strong> Healthcare Professional Regulation &amp; Practising Licences.</p>\r\n<p>KHPOA is responsible for: regulating allied health professionals in Kenya, issuing practising licences to qualified healthcare workers, setting competency standards for clinical and community health roles, and protecting patient safety.</p>\r\n<p><strong>KHPOA-eligible GoCare programmes:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Certificate in Healthcare Support Services &ndash; Level 5 (CNA)</li>\r\n  <li>Certificate in Community Health &ndash; Level 5</li>\r\n  <li>Diploma in Community Health &ndash; Level 6</li>\r\n  <li>Diploma in Perioperative Theatre Technology &ndash; Level 6</li>\r\n  <li>Diploma in Orthopaedic and Trauma Medicine &ndash; Level 6</li>\r\n  <li>Diploma in Mortuary Science &ndash; Level 6</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Summary</h2>\r\n<div class=\"compare-table-scroll\"><table class=\"compare-table\">\r\n  <thead><tr><th>Body</th><th>Role</th><th>What It Issues</th></tr></thead>\r\n  <tbody>\r\n    <tr><td>TVET CDACC</td><td>Curriculum &amp; Assessment</td><td>National CBET Certificates</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>TVETA</td><td>Institution Licensing</td><td>Institution Registration Certificate</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>NITA</td><td>Industrial Training</td><td>Artisan &amp; Caregiver II Certificates</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>KHPOA</td><td>Healthcare Regulation</td><td>Practising Licences</td></tr>\r\n  </tbody>\r\n</table></div><h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>FREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div></div>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\r\n      <h3>Ready to Start Your Journey?</h3>\r\n      <p>Apply to GoCare Training Institute and take the first step toward a rewarding, in-demand career.</p>\r\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"A clear, accurate, and regulator-aligned guide to Kenya&apos;s training, assessment, and accreditation bodies — so you know exactly what your certificate means. 6 min read 04 Jun 2026 Announcements Kenya&apos;s education and skills-training ecosystem includes several regulatory bodies that oversee curriculum development, assessment, accreditation, and industry standards. Understanding the difference between TVET CDACC, TVETA, NITA, and KHPOA is essential when choosing a training institution or career pathway.\", \"heading\": \"Difference Between TVET CDACC, TVETA, NITA, and KHPOA\"}, {\"body\": \"Focus: Competency-Based Curriculum, Assessment & Certification (CBET). Established under the TVET Act 2013. TVET CDACC is responsible for: developing competency-based curricula, registering industry assessors, conducting national assessments, issuing competency-based certificates, and ensuring training aligns with industry needs. Certification levels: Level 3 (Artisan), Level 4 (Certificate), Level 5 (Diploma), Level 6 (Higher Diploma) GoCare is fully registered, approved, and aligned with TVET CDACC standards. All GoCare CBET programmes lead to nationally recognised CDACC certifications.\", \"heading\": \"1. TVET CDACC — Curriculum Development, Assessment & Certification Council\"}, {\"body\": \"Focus: Institution Registration, Licensing & Quality Assurance. TVETA is responsible for: licensing and registering TVET institutions, inspecting and auditing training quality, ensuring compliance with national standards, and protecting learners from unaccredited providers. What it means for learners: A TVETA-licensed institution has been inspected and approved to offer TVET programmes. GoCare Training Institute is fully TVETA-licensed.\", \"heading\": \"2. TVETA — Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority\"}, {\"body\": \"Focus: Industrial Training & Artisan Certification. NITA is responsible for: regulating industrial training in Kenya, certifying artisan and technical skills, issuing the Caregiver Course – Level II (NITA) certification, and overseeing apprenticeship programmes. Key GoCare programme: The Caregiver Course – Level II (NITA) is examined and certified by NITA. It is highly valued by employers in Kenya, UAE, Qatar, and Saudi Arabia.\", \"heading\": \"3. NITA — National Industrial Training Authority\"}, {\"body\": \"Focus: Healthcare Professional Regulation & Practising Licences. KHPOA is responsible for: regulating allied health professionals in Kenya, issuing practising licences to qualified healthcare workers, setting competency standards for clinical and community health roles, and protecting patient safety. KHPOA-eligible GoCare programmes: Certificate in Healthcare Support Services – Level 5 (CNA) Certificate in Community Health – Level 5 Diploma in Community Health – Level 6 Diploma in Perioperative Theatre Technology – Level 6 Diploma in Orthopaedic and Trauma Medicine – Level 6 Diploma in Mortuary Science – Level 6\", \"heading\": \"4. KHPOA — Kenya Health Professions Oversight Authority\"}, {\"body\": \"BodyRoleWhat It Issues TVET CDACCCurriculum & AssessmentNational CBET Certificates TVETAInstitution LicensingInstitution Registration Certificate NITAIndustrial TrainingArtisan & Caregiver II Certificates KHPOAHealthcare RegulationPractising Licences\", \"heading\": \"Summary\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentFREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)Modern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Apply to GoCare Training Institute and take the first step toward a rewarding, in-demand career. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Ready to Start Your Journey?\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(35, 'Diploma Courses at GoCare Training Institute | GoCare Institute', 'diploma-courses-gocare', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\r\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\r\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"book-open\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Announcements</span>\r\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Diploma Courses at GoCare Training Institute</h1>\r\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Accredited professional Diploma programmes in medical, health sciences, and community development &mdash; for serious career advancement.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 4 min read</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 05 Jun 2026</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Announcements</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC01215.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare diploma programmes\">\r\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>GoCare Training Institute offers a range of accredited Diploma programmes designed to prepare learners for professional roles across healthcare, community development, and specialised technical fields. All programmes follow the TVET CDACC curriculum and lead to regulator-recognised qualifications.</p>\r\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Diploma in Perioperative Theatre Technology &ndash; Level 6</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C and above &bull; Duration: 2&frac12; Years &bull; TVET CDACC + KHPOA</p><p>A surgical-support programme training learners in perioperative care, theatre procedures, instrument handling, and operating room coordination. Work in hospitals, surgical centres, and theatre departments across Kenya and internationally.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Diploma in Orthopaedic and Trauma Medicine &ndash; Level 6</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C &amp; Required Subjects &bull; Duration: 2&frac12; Years &bull; TVET CDACC + KHPOA</p><p>A specialised programme equipping learners with skills in musculoskeletal injury management, trauma care support, and orthopaedic clinical procedures. Work in hospitals, orthopaedic clinics, and trauma centres.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Diploma in Mortuary Science &ndash; Level 6</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C&ndash; and above &bull; Duration: 2&frac12; Years &bull; TVET CDACC + KHPOA</p><p>A professional programme preparing learners for advanced roles in mortuary operations, body preservation, post-mortem procedures, and funeral service support. Work in hospitals, funeral homes, and county morgues.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Diploma in Community Health &ndash; Level 6</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C&ndash; &amp; Required Subjects &bull; Duration: 2&frac12; Years &bull; TVET CDACC + KHPOA</p><p>A competency-based programme focused on community health systems, public health interventions, health promotion, and community-level service delivery. Work in NGOs, county health departments, and government public health programmes.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>Diploma in Social Work and Community Development &ndash; Level 6</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE C&ndash; and above &bull; Duration: 2&frac12; Years &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p>A community-focused programme preparing learners to support social welfare programmes, community development initiatives, and vulnerable populations. Work in NGOs, community programmes, government agencies, and international development organisations.</p></div>\r\n<h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>FREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div></div>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\r\n      <h3>Enrol in a GoCare Diploma Programme</h3>\r\n      <p>Take your career to the highest level with an accredited Diploma qualification and KHPOA practising licence eligibility.</p>\r\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Accredited professional Diploma programmes in medical, health sciences, and community development — for serious career advancement. 4 min read 05 Jun 2026 Announcements GoCare Training Institute offers a range of accredited Diploma programmes designed to prepare learners for professional roles across healthcare, community development, and specialised technical fields. All programmes follow the TVET CDACC curriculum and lead to regulator-recognised qualifications.\", \"heading\": \"Diploma Courses at GoCare Training Institute\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C and above • Duration: 2½ Years • TVET CDACC + KHPOAA surgical-support programme training learners in perioperative care, theatre procedures, instrument handling, and operating room coordination. Work in hospitals, surgical centres, and theatre departments across Kenya and internationally.\", \"heading\": \"Diploma in Perioperative Theatre Technology – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C & Required Subjects • Duration: 2½ Years • TVET CDACC + KHPOAA specialised programme equipping learners with skills in musculoskeletal injury management, trauma care support, and orthopaedic clinical procedures. Work in hospitals, orthopaedic clinics, and trauma centres.\", \"heading\": \"Diploma in Orthopaedic and Trauma Medicine – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C– and above • Duration: 2½ Years • TVET CDACC + KHPOAA professional programme preparing learners for advanced roles in mortuary operations, body preservation, post-mortem procedures, and funeral service support. Work in hospitals, funeral homes, and county morgues.\", \"heading\": \"Diploma in Mortuary Science – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C– & Required Subjects • Duration: 2½ Years • TVET CDACC + KHPOAA competency-based programme focused on community health systems, public health interventions, health promotion, and community-level service delivery. Work in NGOs, county health departments, and government public health programmes.\", \"heading\": \"Diploma in Community Health – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE C– and above • Duration: 2½ Years • TVET CDACCA community-focused programme preparing learners to support social welfare programmes, community development initiatives, and vulnerable populations. Work in NGOs, community programmes, government agencies, and international development organisations.\", \"heading\": \"Diploma in Social Work and Community Development – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentFREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)Modern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Take your career to the highest level with an accredited Diploma qualification and KHPOA practising licence eligibility. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Enrol in a GoCare Diploma Programme\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46');
INSERT INTO `blog_posts` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `excerpt`, `content`, `sections`, `image`, `use_builder`, `is_published`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(36, 'First Aid Training Colleges in Kenya — AHA Certified | GoCare Institute', 'first-aid-training-kenya', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\n      <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\n      <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"heart-pulse\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Certifications</span>\n      <h1 class=\"bp-title\">First Aid Training Colleges in Kenya &mdash; AHA Certified</h1>\n      <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">AHA Heartsaver First Aid training that prepares anyone to respond to everyday injuries and medical emergencies.</p>\n      <div class=\"bp-meta\">\n        <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 5 min read</span>\n        <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 05 Jun 2026</span>\n        <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Certifications &middot; Healthcare</span>\n      </div>\n      <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_7868.JPG\" alt=\"GoCare Heartsaver First Aid practical session\">\n\n      <div class=\"bp-body\">\n        <p>Emergencies can happen anywhere &mdash; at home, at work, in school, or in public spaces. In these critical moments, the ability to respond quickly and correctly can make all the difference. Heartsaver First Aid, an American Heart Association (AHA) program, equips learners with essential skills to manage common injuries and medical emergencies before professional help arrives.</p>\n        <p>At GoCare Training Institute, our Heartsaver First Aid course provides internationally recognized training suitable for both medical and non-medical learners.</p>\n        <h2>Why First Aid Training Matters</h2>\n        <p>First aid is often the first and most important step in saving a life. Early intervention can:</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Reduce the severity of injuries</li>\n          <li>Prevent complications</li>\n          <li>Promote faster recovery</li>\n          <li>Provide comfort and reassurance to the injured person</li>\n          <li>Stabilize a situation until medical professionals take over</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>Whether you are a caregiver, teacher, parent, security officer, or employee, first aid knowledge is a valuable and empowering skill.</p>\n        <h2>Who Should Enroll for Heartsaver First Aid?</h2>\n        <p>This course is ideal for:</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Corporates and workplace safety teams</li>\n          <li>Schools, teachers, and support staff</li>\n          <li>Security personnel</li>\n          <li>Caregivers and home-based care providers</li>\n          <li>Community responders</li>\n          <li>KCPE / KCSE graduates</li>\n          <li>General public</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>No medical background is required &mdash; the course is open to everyone.</p></div>\n        <h2>What You Will Learn in AHA Heartsaver First Aid</h2>\n        <p>The Heartsaver First Aid curriculum covers a wide range of real-world emergencies, including:</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Bleeding control</li>\n          <li>Burns, fractures, and sprains</li>\n          <li>Allergic reactions and anaphylaxis</li>\n          <li>Seizures and fainting</li>\n          <li>Diabetic emergencies</li>\n          <li>Stroke and heart attack recognition</li>\n          <li>Basic emergency response procedures</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>Training is delivered through hands-on demonstrations, guided practice, and scenario-based learning to ensure practical understanding.</p>\n        <h2>Why GoCare Offers Leading First Aid Training in Kenya</h2>\n        <p>GoCare Training Institute is known for delivering high-quality, internationally aligned emergency care programs. Our Heartsaver First Aid training stands out because of:</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>AHA-certified instructors</li>\n          <li>Practical, scenario-based learning</li>\n          <li>Modern emergency response equipment</li>\n          <li>Flexible day, evening, and weekend schedules</li>\n          <li>Certification recognized locally and internationally</li>\n          <li>Accessible training for both individuals and organizations</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>Our approach ensures every participant gains the confidence and competence needed to respond effectively in an emergency.</p>\n        <h2>Training Duration</h2>\n        <p><strong>One (1) Day</strong> &mdash; Designed to accommodate busy individuals, workplaces, and community groups.</p>\n        <div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>If you are looking for reliable, accredited, and practical First Aid training in Kenya, GoCare Training Institute provides a trusted learning experience that empowers you to act confidently when emergencies occur.</p></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bp-cta\">\n        <h3>Be Prepared to Save a Life</h3>\n        <p>Enrol in GoCare\'s AHA Heartsaver First Aid course and act confidently when emergencies occur.</p>\n        <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>', '[{\"body\": \"AHA Heartsaver First Aid training that prepares anyone to respond to everyday injuries and medical emergencies. 5 min read 05 Jun 2026 Certifications · Healthcare Emergencies can happen anywhere — at home, at work, in school, or in public spaces. In these critical moments, the ability to respond quickly and correctly can make all the difference. Heartsaver First Aid, an American Heart Association (AHA) program, equips learners with essential skills to manage common injuries and medical emergencies before professional help arrives. At GoCare Training Institute, our Heartsaver First Aid course provides internationally recognized training suitable for both medical and non-medical learners.\", \"heading\": \"First Aid Training Colleges in Kenya — AHA Certified\"}, {\"body\": \"First aid is often the first and most important step in saving a life. Early intervention can: Reduce the severity of injuries Prevent complications Promote faster recovery Provide comfort and reassurance to the injured person Stabilize a situation until medical professionals take over Whether you are a caregiver, teacher, parent, security officer, or employee, first aid knowledge is a valuable and empowering skill.\", \"heading\": \"Why First Aid Training Matters\"}, {\"body\": \"This course is ideal for: Corporates and workplace safety teams Schools, teachers, and support staff Security personnel Caregivers and home-based care providers Community responders KCPE / KCSE graduates General public No medical background is required — the course is open to everyone.\", \"heading\": \"Who Should Enroll for Heartsaver First Aid?\"}, {\"body\": \"The Heartsaver First Aid curriculum covers a wide range of real-world emergencies, including: Bleeding control Burns, fractures, and sprains Allergic reactions and anaphylaxis Seizures and fainting Diabetic emergencies Stroke and heart attack recognition Basic emergency response procedures Training is delivered through hands-on demonstrations, guided practice, and scenario-based learning to ensure practical understanding.\", \"heading\": \"What You Will Learn in AHA Heartsaver First Aid\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare Training Institute is known for delivering high-quality, internationally aligned emergency care programs. Our Heartsaver First Aid training stands out because of: AHA-certified instructors Practical, scenario-based learning Modern emergency response equipment Flexible day, evening, and weekend schedules Certification recognized locally and internationally Accessible training for both individuals and organizations Our approach ensures every participant gains the confidence and competence needed to respond effectively in an emergency.\", \"heading\": \"Why GoCare Offers Leading First Aid Training in Kenya\"}, {\"body\": \"One (1) Day — Designed to accommodate busy individuals, workplaces, and community groups. If you are looking for reliable, accredited, and practical First Aid training in Kenya, GoCare Training Institute provides a trusted learning experience that empowers you to act confidently when emergencies occur.\", \"heading\": \"Training Duration\"}, {\"body\": \"Enrol in GoCare\'s AHA Heartsaver First Aid course and act confidently when emergencies occur. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Be Prepared to Save a Life\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(37, 'Front Office vs Housekeeping — Which Hospitality Course Should You Choose? | GoCare Institute', 'front-office-vs-housekeeping', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\r\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\r\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"utensils\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Hospitality</span>\r\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Front Office vs Housekeeping &mdash; Which Hospitality Course Should You Choose?</h1>\r\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">A clear, practical comparison to help you choose the best hospitality course for your personality, strengths, and career goals.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 5 min read</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 05 Jun 2026</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Hospitality</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC01270.jpg\" alt=\"Front office vs housekeeping course comparison\">\r\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>Front Office and Housekeeping are two of the most popular and employable hospitality courses in Kenya. Both offer fast job placement, strong career growth, and opportunities in hotels, restaurants, airlines, and international hospitality environments. But they are very different roles &mdash; and choosing the right one depends on your personality and strengths.</p>\r\n<h2>What Is Front Office?</h2>\r\n<p>Front Office is the guest-facing department of a hotel &mdash; the first point of contact for all guests.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Key duties:</strong> Guest check-in &amp; check-out, handling reservations, managing phone calls, customer service, handling guest complaints, using hotel software (PMS), managing payments</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Skills required:</strong> Communication, Confidence, Fluency in English, Computer literacy, Professional appearance</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Best for:</strong> People who enjoy interacting with guests and working at the reception</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>What Is Housekeeping?</h2>\r\n<p>Housekeeping is the heart of hotel operations &mdash; responsible for cleanliness, comfort, and guest satisfaction.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Key duties:</strong> Cleaning guest rooms, Making beds, Laundry operations, Linen management, Maintaining hygiene standards, Reporting room status, Assisting guests with room needs</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Skills required:</strong> Attention to detail, Speed and efficiency, Physical stamina, Organisation, Teamwork</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Best for:</strong> People who enjoy hands-on work and maintaining high cleanliness standards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Entry Requirements for Both Courses</h2>\r\n<p>Both courses are accessible to all learners: KCSE (Any Grade) or KCPE for Level 3 entry. This makes them ideal for students with D+, D Plain, D&ndash;, E, or KCPE.</p>\r\n<h2>Comparison at a Glance</h2>\r\n<div class=\"compare-table-scroll\"><table class=\"compare-table\">\r\n  <thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Front Office</th><th>Housekeeping</th></tr></thead>\r\n  <tbody>\r\n    <tr><td>Guest Interaction</td><td>Very High</td><td>Moderate</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>Physical Work</td><td>Low</td><td>High</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>Computer Use</td><td>High</td><td>Low</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>Customer Service</td><td>Very High</td><td>Moderate</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>International Scope</td><td>Hotels, airlines, travel agencies</td><td>Hotels, ships, airlines, hospitals</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>Career Progression</td><td>Supervisor &rarr; Manager</td><td>Supervisor &rarr; Executive Housekeeper</td></tr>\r\n  </tbody>\r\n</table></div>\r\n<h2>Which Should You Choose?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Choose <strong>Front Office</strong> if you are confident, love talking to people, enjoy problem-solving, and are comfortable with computers and administration.</li>\r\n  <li>Choose <strong>Housekeeping</strong> if you are detail-oriented, enjoy hands-on work, are physically fit, and take pride in creating clean, welcoming environments.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>Both courses are offered at GoCare Training Institute and lead to strong employment in Kenya&apos;s hotel industry, international cruise lines, airlines, and hospitals.</p></div><h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>FREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div></div>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\r\n      <h3>Start Your Hospitality Career at GoCare</h3>\r\n      <p>Both Front Office and Housekeeping programmes are available at GoCare &mdash; open to all grades.</p>\r\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"A clear, practical comparison to help you choose the best hospitality course for your personality, strengths, and career goals. 5 min read 05 Jun 2026 Hospitality Front Office and Housekeeping are two of the most popular and employable hospitality courses in Kenya. Both offer fast job placement, strong career growth, and opportunities in hotels, restaurants, airlines, and international hospitality environments. But they are very different roles — and choosing the right one depends on your personality and strengths.\", \"heading\": \"Front Office vs Housekeeping — Which Hospitality Course Should You Choose?\"}, {\"body\": \"Front Office is the guest-facing department of a hotel — the first point of contact for all guests. Key duties: Guest check-in & check-out, handling reservations, managing phone calls, customer service, handling guest complaints, using hotel software (PMS), managing payments Skills required: Communication, Confidence, Fluency in English, Computer literacy, Professional appearance Best for: People who enjoy interacting with guests and working at the reception\", \"heading\": \"What Is Front Office?\"}, {\"body\": \"Housekeeping is the heart of hotel operations — responsible for cleanliness, comfort, and guest satisfaction. Key duties: Cleaning guest rooms, Making beds, Laundry operations, Linen management, Maintaining hygiene standards, Reporting room status, Assisting guests with room needs Skills required: Attention to detail, Speed and efficiency, Physical stamina, Organisation, Teamwork Best for: People who enjoy hands-on work and maintaining high cleanliness standards\", \"heading\": \"What Is Housekeeping?\"}, {\"body\": \"Both courses are accessible to all learners: KCSE (Any Grade) or KCPE for Level 3 entry. This makes them ideal for students with D+, D Plain, D–, E, or KCPE.\", \"heading\": \"Entry Requirements for Both Courses\"}, {\"body\": \"FeatureFront OfficeHousekeeping Guest InteractionVery HighModerate Physical WorkLowHigh Computer UseHighLow Customer ServiceVery HighModerate International ScopeHotels, airlines, travel agenciesHotels, ships, airlines, hospitals Career ProgressionSupervisor → ManagerSupervisor → Executive Housekeeper\", \"heading\": \"Comparison at a Glance\"}, {\"body\": \"Choose Front Office if you are confident, love talking to people, enjoy problem-solving, and are comfortable with computers and administration. Choose Housekeeping if you are detail-oriented, enjoy hands-on work, are physically fit, and take pride in creating clean, welcoming environments. Both courses are offered at GoCare Training Institute and lead to strong employment in Kenya&apos;s hotel industry, international cruise lines, airlines, and hospitals.\", \"heading\": \"Which Should You Choose?\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentFREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)Modern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Both Front Office and Housekeeping programmes are available at GoCare — open to all grades. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Start Your Hospitality Career at GoCare\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(38, 'Inside GoCare\'s Learning Environment | GoCare Institute', 'gocare-learning-environment', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"book-open\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Announcements</span>\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Inside GoCare\'s Learning Environment</h1>\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">What makes GoCare different isn\'t just what we teach &mdash; it\'s how we teach it. A look inside our classrooms, skills labs, and practical training approach.</p>\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 5 min read</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 18 May 2026</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Announcements</span>\n    </div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/PXL_20260218_064240333.MP~2.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare students studying in modern classroom\">\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>What makes GoCare Training Institute different is not simply the programmes on offer. It is the way those programmes are delivered. GoCare was built on a single belief: that every learner &mdash; regardless of their starting grade, background, or life circumstances &mdash; deserves a training environment that takes their future seriously.</p>\n\n<h2>Modern Classrooms Built for Learning</h2>\n<p>GoCare&apos;s classrooms are designed to support active, engaged learning. Comfortable seating, good ventilation, projection facilities, and well-organised learning resources create an environment where students can focus. Both campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru &mdash; are equipped with modern learning infrastructure.</p>\n\n<h2>Clinical Skills Labs</h2>\n<p>GoCare&apos;s clinical skills labs are where healthcare training comes to life. Students practice real patient-care procedures in simulated ward environments before stepping into hospital attachment. The labs are equipped with:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Patient mannequins and simulation equipment</li>\n  <li>Vital signs monitoring devices (blood pressure cuffs, stethoscopes, thermometers, pulse oximeters)</li>\n  <li>Hospital beds, wheelchairs, and mobility aids</li>\n  <li>Personal Protective Equipment (PPE) for infection control practice</li>\n  <li>Dressing and wound-care materials</li>\n  <li>Feeding and nutrition support equipment</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Hospitality &amp; Business Labs</h2>\n<p>Hospitality students train in kitchens and service environments that mirror real hotel and restaurant settings. Business and administration students have access to fully equipped computer labs with industry-standard software.</p>\n\n<h2>Qualified, Experienced Instructors</h2>\n<p>GoCare&apos;s instructors are not just academics &mdash; they are industry professionals who bring real-world knowledge into the classroom. Healthcare instructors have clinical backgrounds. Hospitality instructors have hotel industry experience. This means students learn not just the theory, but the practical judgement that comes from working in the field.</p>\n\n<h2>Guaranteed Hospital &amp; Industrial Attachment</h2>\n<p>Every GoCare programme includes a structured attachment component &mdash; guaranteed and coordinated by the institution. Healthcare students are placed in hospitals, clinics, and homecare settings. Hospitality students are placed in hotels, restaurants, and service establishments. This attachment is not optional or student-arranged &mdash; it is a core part of every programme at GoCare.</p>\n\n<div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>At GoCare, the learning environment is designed to produce graduates who are not just qualified, but truly competent &mdash; professionals who can perform from day one in any workplace that requires their skills.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\n      <h3>Come and See for Yourself</h3>\n      <p>Visit one of our campuses in Nairobi CBD or Ruiru, meet our team, and see our training facilities firsthand.</p>\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"What makes GoCare different isn\'t just what we teach — it\'s how we teach it. A look inside our classrooms, skills labs, and practical training approach. 5 min read 18 May 2026 Announcements What makes GoCare Training Institute different is not simply the programmes on offer. It is the way those programmes are delivered. GoCare was built on a single belief: that every learner — regardless of their starting grade, background, or life circumstances — deserves a training environment that takes their future seriously.\", \"heading\": \"Inside GoCare\'s Learning Environment\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare&apos;s classrooms are designed to support active, engaged learning. Comfortable seating, good ventilation, projection facilities, and well-organised learning resources create an environment where students can focus. Both campuses — Nairobi CBD and Ruiru — are equipped with modern learning infrastructure.\", \"heading\": \"Modern Classrooms Built for Learning\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare&apos;s clinical skills labs are where healthcare training comes to life. Students practice real patient-care procedures in simulated ward environments before stepping into hospital attachment. The labs are equipped with: Patient mannequins and simulation equipment Vital signs monitoring devices (blood pressure cuffs, stethoscopes, thermometers, pulse oximeters) Hospital beds, wheelchairs, and mobility aids Personal Protective Equipment (PPE) for infection control practice Dressing and wound-care materials Feeding and nutrition support equipment\", \"heading\": \"Clinical Skills Labs\"}, {\"body\": \"Hospitality students train in kitchens and service environments that mirror real hotel and restaurant settings. Business and administration students have access to fully equipped computer labs with industry-standard software.\", \"heading\": \"Hospitality & Business Labs\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare&apos;s instructors are not just academics — they are industry professionals who bring real-world knowledge into the classroom. Healthcare instructors have clinical backgrounds. Hospitality instructors have hotel industry experience. This means students learn not just the theory, but the practical judgement that comes from working in the field.\", \"heading\": \"Qualified, Experienced Instructors\"}, {\"body\": \"Every GoCare programme includes a structured attachment component — guaranteed and coordinated by the institution. Healthcare students are placed in hospitals, clinics, and homecare settings. Hospitality students are placed in hotels, restaurants, and service establishments. This attachment is not optional or student-arranged — it is a core part of every programme at GoCare. At GoCare, the learning environment is designed to produce graduates who are not just qualified, but truly competent — professionals who can perform from day one in any workplace that requires their skills.\", \"heading\": \"Guaranteed Hospital & Industrial Attachment\"}, {\"body\": \"Visit one of our campuses in Nairobi CBD or Ruiru, meet our team, and see our training facilities firsthand. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Come and See for Yourself\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(39, 'GoCare Celebrates Its Largest Graduating Class Yet | GoCare Institute', 'graduation-class-2026', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"star\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Announcements</span>\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">GoCare Celebrates Its Largest Graduating Class Yet</h1>\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Over 300 graduates crossed the stage at this year\'s ceremony &mdash; a record that reflects GoCare\'s commitment to transforming lives through quality, accessible education.</p>\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 8 min read</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 15 May 2026</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Announcements</span>\n    </div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC05908.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare graduation ceremony 2026\">\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>GoCare Training Institute marked a historic milestone at its 2026 graduation ceremony as over 300 graduates crossed the stage &mdash; the largest cohort in the institution&apos;s history. The event, held at our Ruiru campus, was a celebration of resilience, hard work, and the transformative power of competency-based education.</p>\n\n<h2>A Record-Breaking Class</h2>\n<p>The class of 2026 represented graduates from across all of GoCare&apos;s programmes &mdash; from Healthcare Support Services and Caregiving to Perioperative Theatre Technology, Mortuary Science, Hospitality Management, and Business Administration. Many had enrolled with little more than a KCSE certificate and a determination to build something better for themselves and their families.</p>\n<p>Among the graduates were working mothers who attended evening classes, young men who had been told their KCSE grades weren&apos;t good enough for further education, and professionals who retrained for overseas opportunities. Every story was different. The destination was the same: a nationally accredited qualification and a clear path forward.</p>\n\n<h2>International Certification Highlights</h2>\n<p>A significant proportion of the class of 2026 also received international certifications alongside their national qualifications:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>SDC Canada CNA Certification for eligible caregiving and healthcare graduates</li>\n  <li>AMCA USA Certification for qualifying healthcare support and CNA graduates</li>\n  <li>KHPOA-aligned practising licence eligibility for Healthcare Support Services graduates</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare graduates hold dual qualifications &mdash; a nationally accredited TVET CDACC certificate and an internationally recognised credential &mdash; making them among the most competitive healthcare and hospitality professionals in the job market.</p></div>\n\n<h2>Graduate Placement and Outcomes</h2>\n<p>GoCare&apos;s placement record continues to grow. The class of 2026 has graduates placed in:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Hospitals and clinics across Nairobi, Mombasa, Kisumu, and Nakuru</li>\n  <li>Homecare agencies and NGOs throughout Kenya</li>\n  <li>International markets including Canada, UAE, Qatar, Saudi Arabia, and the UK</li>\n  <li>Hotels and hospitality establishments in Nairobi and Mombasa</li>\n  <li>Self-employment and entrepreneurship ventures</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>A Message from GoCare</h2>\n<p>To every graduate: your qualification is only the beginning. GoCare has equipped you with the skills, certification, and professional identity to make your mark &mdash; in Kenya and beyond. We celebrate you, and we are proud to call you alumni of GoCare Training Institute.</p>\n<p>To every prospective student: what you see in this graduating class is what is possible when you commit to your training. Your grade, your background, your starting point &mdash; none of it determines your finish line.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\n      <h3>Be Part of the Next Graduating Class</h3>\n      <p>Enrol at GoCare Training Institute and join thousands of graduates building successful careers across Kenya and internationally.</p>\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Over 300 graduates crossed the stage at this year\'s ceremony — a record that reflects GoCare\'s commitment to transforming lives through quality, accessible education. 8 min read 15 May 2026 Announcements GoCare Training Institute marked a historic milestone at its 2026 graduation ceremony as over 300 graduates crossed the stage — the largest cohort in the institution&apos;s history. The event, held at our Ruiru campus, was a celebration of resilience, hard work, and the transformative power of competency-based education.\", \"heading\": \"GoCare Celebrates Its Largest Graduating Class Yet\"}, {\"body\": \"The class of 2026 represented graduates from across all of GoCare&apos;s programmes — from Healthcare Support Services and Caregiving to Perioperative Theatre Technology, Mortuary Science, Hospitality Management, and Business Administration. Many had enrolled with little more than a KCSE certificate and a determination to build something better for themselves and their families. Among the graduates were working mothers who attended evening classes, young men who had been told their KCSE grades weren&apos;t good enough for further education, and professionals who retrained for overseas opportunities. Every story was different. The destination was the same: a nationally accredited qualification and a clear path forward.\", \"heading\": \"A Record-Breaking Class\"}, {\"body\": \"A significant proportion of the class of 2026 also received international certifications alongside their national qualifications: SDC Canada CNA Certification for eligible caregiving and healthcare graduates AMCA USA Certification for qualifying healthcare support and CNA graduates KHPOA-aligned practising licence eligibility for Healthcare Support Services graduates GoCare graduates hold dual qualifications — a nationally accredited TVET CDACC certificate and an internationally recognised credential — making them among the most competitive healthcare and hospitality professionals in the job market.\", \"heading\": \"International Certification Highlights\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare&apos;s placement record continues to grow. The class of 2026 has graduates placed in: Hospitals and clinics across Nairobi, Mombasa, Kisumu, and Nakuru Homecare agencies and NGOs throughout Kenya International markets including Canada, UAE, Qatar, Saudi Arabia, and the UK Hotels and hospitality establishments in Nairobi and Mombasa Self-employment and entrepreneurship ventures\", \"heading\": \"Graduate Placement and Outcomes\"}, {\"body\": \"To every graduate: your qualification is only the beginning. GoCare has equipped you with the skills, certification, and professional identity to make your mark — in Kenya and beyond. We celebrate you, and we are proud to call you alumni of GoCare Training Institute. To every prospective student: what you see in this graduating class is what is possible when you commit to your training. Your grade, your background, your starting point — none of it determines your finish line.\", \"heading\": \"A Message from GoCare\"}, {\"body\": \"Enrol at GoCare Training Institute and join thousands of graduates building successful careers across Kenya and internationally. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Be Part of the Next Graduating Class\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(40, 'Health Care Assistant Course (HCA) at GoCare | GoCare Institute', 'health-care-assistant-course-hca', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\r\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\r\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"heart-pulse\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Healthcare</span>\r\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Health Care Assistant Course (HCA) at GoCare</h1>\r\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Foundational home-care and patient support training for community and clinical settings &mdash; open to KCPE and all KCSE grades.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 5 min read</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 06 Jun 2026</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Healthcare</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_5545.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare HCA course students\">\r\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>The Health Care Assistant Course at GoCare Training Institute equips learners with essential, hands-on skills required to support patients in homes, communities, and basic care environments. This foundational healthcare programme focuses on practical training that prepares students to deliver safe, compassionate, and reliable patient support.</p>\r\n<h2>Who This Course Is For</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>KCPE or KCSE graduates (any grade)</li>\r\n  <li>Individuals seeking an accessible entry into healthcare</li>\r\n  <li>Students targeting caregiver, HCA, or CNA roles</li>\r\n  <li>Working adults looking for a short, marketable healthcare qualification</li>\r\n  <li>Learners preparing for international caregiver opportunities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Course Details</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Entry:</strong> KCPE or KCSE Certificate (Any Grade)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Duration:</strong> 5 months (classroom instruction + skills-lab practice + homecare exposure)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Exam Body:</strong> TVET CDACC</li>\r\n  <li><strong>International Certification:</strong> Fully sponsored &mdash; included at no extra cost</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>What You Will Learn</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Patient hygiene and personal care</li>\r\n  <li>Feeding and nutrition support</li>\r\n  <li>Basic vital signs monitoring</li>\r\n  <li>Infection prevention and control</li>\r\n  <li>Bed making and homecare procedures</li>\r\n  <li>Mobility and transfer assistance</li>\r\n  <li>Safety and emergency response</li>\r\n  <li>Communication and documentation</li>\r\n  <li>Professional ethics and patient dignity</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Career Opportunities</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Health Care Assistant in hospitals, clinics, and community programmes</li>\r\n  <li>Home-Care Support Worker in families and homecare agencies</li>\r\n  <li>Community Health Support Assistant in NGOs</li>\r\n  <li>International caregiver (Canada, UAE, Qatar, Saudi Arabia)</li>\r\n  <li>Progression to Caregiving Level 4 and CNA Level 5</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>This programme includes FREE fully sponsored international certification &mdash; significantly boosting your employability both locally and globally.</p></div><h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>FREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div></div>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\r\n      <h3>Enrol in the HCA Course Today</h3>\r\n      <p>Open to KCPE and all KCSE grades. Start your healthcare career in just 5 months.</p>\r\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Foundational home-care and patient support training for community and clinical settings — open to KCPE and all KCSE grades. 5 min read 06 Jun 2026 Healthcare The Health Care Assistant Course at GoCare Training Institute equips learners with essential, hands-on skills required to support patients in homes, communities, and basic care environments. This foundational healthcare programme focuses on practical training that prepares students to deliver safe, compassionate, and reliable patient support.\", \"heading\": \"Health Care Assistant Course (HCA) at GoCare\"}, {\"body\": \"KCPE or KCSE graduates (any grade) Individuals seeking an accessible entry into healthcare Students targeting caregiver, HCA, or CNA roles Working adults looking for a short, marketable healthcare qualification Learners preparing for international caregiver opportunities\", \"heading\": \"Who This Course Is For\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE or KCSE Certificate (Any Grade) Duration: 5 months (classroom instruction + skills-lab practice + homecare exposure) Exam Body: TVET CDACC International Certification: Fully sponsored — included at no extra cost\", \"heading\": \"Course Details\"}, {\"body\": \"Patient hygiene and personal care Feeding and nutrition support Basic vital signs monitoring Infection prevention and control Bed making and homecare procedures Mobility and transfer assistance Safety and emergency response Communication and documentation Professional ethics and patient dignity\", \"heading\": \"What You Will Learn\"}, {\"body\": \"Health Care Assistant in hospitals, clinics, and community programmes Home-Care Support Worker in families and homecare agencies Community Health Support Assistant in NGOs International caregiver (Canada, UAE, Qatar, Saudi Arabia) Progression to Caregiving Level 4 and CNA Level 5 This programme includes FREE fully sponsored international certification — significantly boosting your employability both locally and globally.\", \"heading\": \"Career Opportunities\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentFREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)Modern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Open to KCPE and all KCSE grades. Start your healthcare career in just 5 months. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Enrol in the HCA Course Today\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(41, 'Best Healthcare Courses for KCSE D+ and Below | GoCare Institute', 'healthcare-courses-kcse-d-plus', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"stethoscope\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Healthcare</span>\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Best Healthcare Courses for KCSE D+ and Below</h1>\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Real opportunities for students with KCSE D+, D Plain, D&minus;, E and even KCPE &mdash; build a medical career from any grade.</p>\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 6 min read</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 28 May 2026</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Healthcare</span>\n    </div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_4411.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare healthcare students D+ and below\">\n    <div class=\"bp-body\">\n<p>Many students believe that a low KCSE grade closes the door to healthcare careers. That is NOT true. Kenya&apos;s TVET system is designed to give every learner a pathway into the medical field &mdash; regardless of their KCSE grade. Whether you scored D+, D Plain, D&ndash;, E or even KCPE, you can still build a respected, well-paying healthcare career in Kenya and abroad.</p>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>1. Certificate in Healthcare Support Services (CNA) &ndash; Level 5</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE D (Plain) and above &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p>The strongest healthcare course for D Plain and above. <strong>Learn:</strong> Vital signs, Anatomy &amp; physiology, Infection control, Patient care, Emergency response. <strong>Why:</strong> Leads to KHPOA licensing, eligible for FREE SDC Canada CNA certification, strong overseas opportunities.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>2. Certificate in Caregiving &ndash; Level 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p>The most popular healthcare course for D+, D Plain, D&ndash; and E learners. <strong>Learn:</strong> First aid, Infection control, Patient care, Nutrition support, Home-based care. <strong>Why:</strong> Eligible for FREE international certification, direct pathway to CNA Level 5.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>3. Caregiver Course &ndash; Level II (NITA)</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE D&ndash; and above &bull; NITA</p><p>Fast, practical healthcare course. <strong>Learn:</strong> Patient hygiene, Feeding &amp; grooming, Mobility assistance, Basic nursing. <strong>Why:</strong> Short duration, NITA certification highly respected, high demand in UAE, Qatar, Saudi Arabia.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>4. Certificate in Home-Based Care Support &ndash; Level 3</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p>Best starting point for KCPE, E, D&ndash;, D Plain, or D+ learners. <strong>Learn:</strong> Patient hygiene, Feeding, Mobility, Basic home-based care. <strong>Why:</strong> Short duration, direct pathway to Caregiving Level 4 and CNA Level 5, eligible for FREE SDC Canada certification.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>5. Health Care Assistant (HCA)</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Patient handling, Vital signs, Infection control, Nutrition support. <strong>Work:</strong> Hospitals, Clinics, Home-based care, Community health.</p></div>\n<h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>International certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) &mdash; fully sponsored</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\n      <h3>Ready to Start Your Journey?</h3>\n      <p>Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding career.</p>\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Real opportunities for students with KCSE D+, D Plain, D−, E and even KCPE — build a medical career from any grade. 6 min read 28 May 2026 Healthcare Many students believe that a low KCSE grade closes the door to healthcare careers. That is NOT true. Kenya&apos;s TVET system is designed to give every learner a pathway into the medical field — regardless of their KCSE grade. Whether you scored D+, D Plain, D–, E or even KCPE, you can still build a respected, well-paying healthcare career in Kenya and abroad.\", \"heading\": \"Best Healthcare Courses for KCSE D+ and Below\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE D (Plain) and above • TVET CDACCThe strongest healthcare course for D Plain and above. Learn: Vital signs, Anatomy & physiology, Infection control, Patient care, Emergency response. Why: Leads to KHPOA licensing, eligible for FREE SDC Canada CNA certification, strong overseas opportunities.\", \"heading\": \"1. Certificate in Healthcare Support Services (CNA) – Level 5\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE (Any Grade) • TVET CDACCThe most popular healthcare course for D+, D Plain, D– and E learners. Learn: First aid, Infection control, Patient care, Nutrition support, Home-based care. Why: Eligible for FREE international certification, direct pathway to CNA Level 5.\", \"heading\": \"2. Certificate in Caregiving – Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE D– and above • NITAFast, practical healthcare course. Learn: Patient hygiene, Feeding & grooming, Mobility assistance, Basic nursing. Why: Short duration, NITA certification highly respected, high demand in UAE, Qatar, Saudi Arabia.\", \"heading\": \"3. Caregiver Course – Level II (NITA)\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) • TVET CDACCBest starting point for KCPE, E, D–, D Plain, or D+ learners. Learn: Patient hygiene, Feeding, Mobility, Basic home-based care. Why: Short duration, direct pathway to Caregiving Level 4 and CNA Level 5, eligible for FREE SDC Canada certification.\", \"heading\": \"4. Certificate in Home-Based Care Support – Level 3\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) • TVET CDACCLearn: Patient handling, Vital signs, Infection control, Nutrition support. Work: Hospitals, Clinics, Home-based care, Community health.\", \"heading\": \"5. Health Care Assistant (HCA)\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentInternational certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) — fully sponsoredModern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding career. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Ready to Start Your Journey?\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46');
INSERT INTO `blog_posts` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `excerpt`, `content`, `sections`, `image`, `use_builder`, `is_published`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(42, 'Healthcare Support Services (HSS) – Level 5 / Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) | GoCare Institute', 'healthcare-support-services-level-5-cna', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\r\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\r\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"stethoscope\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Healthcare</span>\r\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Healthcare Support Services (HSS) &ndash; Level 5 / Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA)</h1>\r\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Comprehensive training for hospital, clinical, and home-care careers in Kenya and abroad &mdash; GoCare&apos;s flagship healthcare programme.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 6 min read</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 06 Jun 2026</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Healthcare</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_6389.JPG\" alt=\"GoCare HSS Level 5 CNA training\">\r\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>The Healthcare Support Services (HSS) &ndash; Level 5 / Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) programme at GoCare Training Institute is one of the most marketable and globally competitive healthcare qualifications in Kenya. It prepares learners with the practical skills, clinical competencies, and professional discipline required to work in hospitals, clinics, long-term care facilities, and international healthcare environments.</p>\r\n<h2>Who This Course Is For</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>KCSE graduates with D (Plain) and above</li>\r\n  <li>Students seeking a clinical healthcare career</li>\r\n  <li>Individuals targeting international caregiver, HCA, or CNA jobs</li>\r\n  <li>Working adults seeking a professional healthcare qualification</li>\r\n  <li>Learners who want a clear progression to diploma-level medical programmes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Course Details</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Entry:</strong> KCSE Mean Grade D (Plain) and above</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Duration:</strong> 1&frac12; years (classroom training + skills-lab practice + clinical attachment)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Exam Body:</strong> TVET CDACC</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Practising Licence:</strong> Kenya Health Professions Oversight Authority (KHPOA)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>International Certification:</strong> FREE SDC Canada CNA Certification &amp; AMCA USA Certification</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>What You Will Learn</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Patient hygiene and personal care</li>\r\n  <li>Vital signs monitoring</li>\r\n  <li>Infection prevention and control</li>\r\n  <li>Feeding and nutrition support</li>\r\n  <li>Mobility and transfer techniques</li>\r\n  <li>Bed making and ward procedures</li>\r\n  <li>Clinical procedures and emergency response</li>\r\n  <li>Communication, documentation, and reporting</li>\r\n  <li>Professional ethics and patient dignity</li>\r\n  <li>Anatomy &amp; physiology fundamentals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Career Opportunities</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Licensed CNA in hospitals and clinics (KHPOA-certified)</li>\r\n  <li>Healthcare Support Assistant in long-term care facilities</li>\r\n  <li>Patient Care Technician in specialist wards</li>\r\n  <li>International CNA in Canada, USA, UK, Germany, UAE, Qatar, Saudi Arabia</li>\r\n  <li>Progression to Diploma in Theatre Technology, Community Health, or Orthopaedic Medicine</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>HSS Level 5 / CNA graduates hold a national TVET CDACC certificate, a KHPOA practising licence, and internationally recognised SDC Canada or AMCA USA certification &mdash; the most powerful combination for a healthcare career in Kenya and abroad.</p></div><h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>FREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div></div>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\r\n      <h3>Enrol in the CNA Programme at GoCare</h3>\r\n      <p>Entry: KCSE D (Plain) and above. Includes FREE international CNA certification and KHPOA practising licence eligibility.</p>\r\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Comprehensive training for hospital, clinical, and home-care careers in Kenya and abroad — GoCare&apos;s flagship healthcare programme. 6 min read 06 Jun 2026 Healthcare The Healthcare Support Services (HSS) – Level 5 / Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) programme at GoCare Training Institute is one of the most marketable and globally competitive healthcare qualifications in Kenya. It prepares learners with the practical skills, clinical competencies, and professional discipline required to work in hospitals, clinics, long-term care facilities, and international healthcare environments.\", \"heading\": \"Healthcare Support Services (HSS) – Level 5 / Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA)\"}, {\"body\": \"KCSE graduates with D (Plain) and above Students seeking a clinical healthcare career Individuals targeting international caregiver, HCA, or CNA jobs Working adults seeking a professional healthcare qualification Learners who want a clear progression to diploma-level medical programmes\", \"heading\": \"Who This Course Is For\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE Mean Grade D (Plain) and above Duration: 1½ years (classroom training + skills-lab practice + clinical attachment) Exam Body: TVET CDACC Practising Licence: Kenya Health Professions Oversight Authority (KHPOA) International Certification: FREE SDC Canada CNA Certification & AMCA USA Certification\", \"heading\": \"Course Details\"}, {\"body\": \"Patient hygiene and personal care Vital signs monitoring Infection prevention and control Feeding and nutrition support Mobility and transfer techniques Bed making and ward procedures Clinical procedures and emergency response Communication, documentation, and reporting Professional ethics and patient dignity Anatomy & physiology fundamentals\", \"heading\": \"What You Will Learn\"}, {\"body\": \"Licensed CNA in hospitals and clinics (KHPOA-certified) Healthcare Support Assistant in long-term care facilities Patient Care Technician in specialist wards International CNA in Canada, USA, UK, Germany, UAE, Qatar, Saudi Arabia Progression to Diploma in Theatre Technology, Community Health, or Orthopaedic Medicine HSS Level 5 / CNA graduates hold a national TVET CDACC certificate, a KHPOA practising licence, and internationally recognised SDC Canada or AMCA USA certification — the most powerful combination for a healthcare career in Kenya and abroad.\", \"heading\": \"Career Opportunities\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentFREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)Modern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE D (Plain) and above. Includes FREE international CNA certification and KHPOA practising licence eligibility. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Enrol in the CNA Programme at GoCare\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(43, 'Best Hospitality Courses in Kenya for Quick Employment | GoCare Institute', 'hospitality-courses-kenya', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"utensils\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Hospitality</span>\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">Best Hospitality Courses in Kenya for Quick Employment</h1>\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Top marketable hospitality courses that guarantee fast job placement in hotels, restaurants, airlines, and tourism.</p>\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 5 min read</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 28 May 2026</span>\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Hospitality</span>\n    </div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_4428.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare hospitality students\">\n    <div class=\"bp-body\">\n<p>Kenya&apos;s hospitality industry is one of the fastest-growing sectors, driven by tourism, hotels, restaurants, airlines, events, and the expanding service economy. This growth has created high demand for skilled hospitality professionals, especially those with practical, competency-based training.</p>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>1. Food &amp; Beverage Service &ndash; Level 3 &amp; Level 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p>One of the most marketable hospitality courses in Kenya. <strong>Learn:</strong> Table service, Buffet service, Customer care, Restaurant operations, Beverage handling, Service etiquette. <strong>Work:</strong> Hotels, Restaurants, Caf&eacute;s, Resorts, Catering companies.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>2. Certificate in Housekeeping &amp; Accommodation &ndash; Level 3 &amp; Level 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Room cleaning, Laundry operations, Guest room preparation, Hygiene &amp; sanitation, Linen management. <strong>Work:</strong> Hotels, Lodges, Hospitals, Airlines, Cruise ships.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>3. Certificate in Front Office Operations &ndash; Level 3 &amp; Level 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Reception operations, Guest check-in &amp; check-out, Reservation systems, Customer service, Telephone etiquette, Hotel software (PMS). <strong>Work:</strong> Hotels, Lodges, Travel agencies, Airlines, Corporate offices.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>4. Certificate in Food Production (Culinary Arts)</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Cooking techniques, Menu planning, Kitchen operations, Baking &amp; pastry, Food safety. <strong>Work:</strong> Hotels, Restaurants, Bakeries, Catering companies, Cruise ships.</p></div>\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>5. Certificate in Tour Guiding &amp; Travel Operations</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p><strong>Learn:</strong> Tour planning, Wildlife knowledge, Customer service, Travel operations, Guiding techniques. <strong>Work:</strong> Tour companies, Safari operators, Hotels, National parks.</p></div>\n<h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>International certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) &mdash; fully sponsored</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\n      <h3>Ready to Start Your Journey?</h3>\n      <p>Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding career.</p>\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Top marketable hospitality courses that guarantee fast job placement in hotels, restaurants, airlines, and tourism. 5 min read 28 May 2026 Hospitality Kenya&apos;s hospitality industry is one of the fastest-growing sectors, driven by tourism, hotels, restaurants, airlines, events, and the expanding service economy. This growth has created high demand for skilled hospitality professionals, especially those with practical, competency-based training.\", \"heading\": \"Best Hospitality Courses in Kenya for Quick Employment\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) • TVET CDACCOne of the most marketable hospitality courses in Kenya. Learn: Table service, Buffet service, Customer care, Restaurant operations, Beverage handling, Service etiquette. Work: Hotels, Restaurants, Cafés, Resorts, Catering companies.\", \"heading\": \"1. Food & Beverage Service – Level 3 & Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) • TVET CDACCLearn: Room cleaning, Laundry operations, Guest room preparation, Hygiene & sanitation, Linen management. Work: Hotels, Lodges, Hospitals, Airlines, Cruise ships.\", \"heading\": \"2. Certificate in Housekeeping & Accommodation – Level 3 & Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE (Any Grade) • TVET CDACCLearn: Reception operations, Guest check-in & check-out, Reservation systems, Customer service, Telephone etiquette, Hotel software (PMS). Work: Hotels, Lodges, Travel agencies, Airlines, Corporate offices.\", \"heading\": \"3. Certificate in Front Office Operations – Level 3 & Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE (Any Grade) • TVET CDACCLearn: Cooking techniques, Menu planning, Kitchen operations, Baking & pastry, Food safety. Work: Hotels, Restaurants, Bakeries, Catering companies, Cruise ships.\", \"heading\": \"4. Certificate in Food Production (Culinary Arts)\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE (Any Grade) • TVET CDACCLearn: Tour planning, Wildlife knowledge, Customer service, Travel operations, Guiding techniques. Work: Tour companies, Safari operators, Hotels, National parks.\", \"heading\": \"5. Certificate in Tour Guiding & Travel Operations\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentInternational certification pathways (AMCA USA, SDC Canada) — fully sponsoredModern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification options, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Apply to GoCare Training Institute today and take the first step toward a rewarding career. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Ready to Start Your Journey?\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(44, 'How GoCare Students Qualify for International Jobs | GoCare Institute', 'how-gocare-students-qualify-international-jobs', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\r\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\r\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"globe\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Healthcare</span>\r\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">How GoCare Students Qualify for International Jobs</h1>\r\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">A clear, practical guide to overseas opportunities for caregivers, HCAs, CNAs, hospitality, and business graduates from GoCare.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 6 min read</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 07 Jun 2026</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Healthcare</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_6391.JPG\" alt=\"GoCare students international job opportunities\">\r\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>International job opportunities have become a major goal for many Kenyan students. Countries such as Canada, USA, UK, Germany, Ireland, UAE, Qatar, and Saudi Arabia continue to recruit skilled workers in healthcare, hospitality, and business support roles. GoCare Training Institute has positioned itself as one of the strongest pathways for students who want to work abroad.</p>\r\n<h2>1. Accredited Training That Meets Global Standards</h2>\r\n<p>GoCare offers nationally accredited programmes under TVETA, TVET CDACC, NITA, and KHPOA. International employers prefer graduates from accredited institutions because it guarantees verified training, standardised competencies, authentic certification, and professional credibility.</p>\r\n<h2>2. International Certification Pathways (FREE)</h2>\r\n<p>GoCare provides direct access to globally recognised certifications included free with eligible programmes:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>SDC Canada Certification</strong> &mdash; trusted by Canadian healthcare employers</li>\r\n  <li><strong>AMCA USA Certification</strong> &mdash; aligned with U.S. healthcare standards</li>\r\n  <li><strong>ICDL Digital Skills Certification</strong> &mdash; for business and ICT graduates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>Even entry-level Caregiver Level 4 and Home-Based Care Level 3 students qualify for international certification through GoCare&apos;s Second Course Sponsorship programme.</p></div>\r\n<h2>3. Guaranteed Industrial Attachment</h2>\r\n<p>International employers want candidates with real experience. GoCare ensures every student completes guaranteed attachment in hospitals, clinics, hotels, offices, and community programmes &mdash; providing documented practical experience that employers abroad trust.</p>\r\n<h2>4. Professional CV and Application Support</h2>\r\n<p>GoCare prepares students for the international job market through CV preparation workshops, interview coaching, job-readiness training, and links to international employer networks and recruitment agencies.</p>\r\n<h2>5. KHPOA Practising Licence (Healthcare)</h2>\r\n<p>For CNA and allied health graduates, KHPOA licensing significantly strengthens international healthcare job applications &mdash; especially for Canada, UK, and Germany visa categories.</p>\r\n<h2>Countries Where GoCare Graduates Work</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Canada</strong> &mdash; Home Support Worker Programme, Long-term care facilities</li>\r\n  <li><strong>United Kingdom</strong> &mdash; Health &amp; Care Worker Visa (SOC 6145)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>UAE, Qatar, Saudi Arabia</strong> &mdash; Homecare companies, Hospitals, Private families</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Germany &amp; Ireland</strong> &mdash; Healthcare assistant and caregiver roles</li>\r\n</ul><h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>FREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div></div>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\r\n      <h3>Build Your International Career from GoCare</h3>\r\n      <p>GoCare gives you accredited training, FREE international certification, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; everything you need to compete globally.</p>\r\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"A clear, practical guide to overseas opportunities for caregivers, HCAs, CNAs, hospitality, and business graduates from GoCare. 6 min read 07 Jun 2026 Healthcare International job opportunities have become a major goal for many Kenyan students. Countries such as Canada, USA, UK, Germany, Ireland, UAE, Qatar, and Saudi Arabia continue to recruit skilled workers in healthcare, hospitality, and business support roles. GoCare Training Institute has positioned itself as one of the strongest pathways for students who want to work abroad.\", \"heading\": \"How GoCare Students Qualify for International Jobs\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare offers nationally accredited programmes under TVETA, TVET CDACC, NITA, and KHPOA. International employers prefer graduates from accredited institutions because it guarantees verified training, standardised competencies, authentic certification, and professional credibility.\", \"heading\": \"1. Accredited Training That Meets Global Standards\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare provides direct access to globally recognised certifications included free with eligible programmes: SDC Canada Certification — trusted by Canadian healthcare employers AMCA USA Certification — aligned with U.S. healthcare standards ICDL Digital Skills Certification — for business and ICT graduates Even entry-level Caregiver Level 4 and Home-Based Care Level 3 students qualify for international certification through GoCare&apos;s Second Course Sponsorship programme.\", \"heading\": \"2. International Certification Pathways (FREE)\"}, {\"body\": \"International employers want candidates with real experience. GoCare ensures every student completes guaranteed attachment in hospitals, clinics, hotels, offices, and community programmes — providing documented practical experience that employers abroad trust.\", \"heading\": \"3. Guaranteed Industrial Attachment\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare prepares students for the international job market through CV preparation workshops, interview coaching, job-readiness training, and links to international employer networks and recruitment agencies.\", \"heading\": \"4. Professional CV and Application Support\"}, {\"body\": \"For CNA and allied health graduates, KHPOA licensing significantly strengthens international healthcare job applications — especially for Canada, UK, and Germany visa categories.\", \"heading\": \"5. KHPOA Practising Licence (Healthcare)\"}, {\"body\": \"Canada — Home Support Worker Programme, Long-term care facilities United Kingdom — Health & Care Worker Visa (SOC 6145) UAE, Qatar, Saudi Arabia — Homecare companies, Hospitals, Private families Germany & Ireland — Healthcare assistant and caregiver roles\", \"heading\": \"Countries Where GoCare Graduates Work\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentFREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)Modern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare gives you accredited training, FREE international certification, and guaranteed attachment — everything you need to compete globally. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Build Your International Career from GoCare\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(45, 'How to Apply to GoCare Training Institute | GoCare Institute', 'how-to-apply-gocare', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\r\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\r\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"file-text\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Announcements</span>\r\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">How to Apply to GoCare Training Institute</h1>\r\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">A simple, clear, step-by-step guide for new students and parents &mdash; everything you need to know about the GoCare admission process.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 4 min read</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 08 Jun 2026</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Announcements</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_6506.JPG\" alt=\"How to apply to GoCare Training Institute\">\r\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>Applying to GoCare Training Institute is a straightforward process designed to help students join their preferred programme quickly and confidently. Whether you are a KCSE graduate, a working adult, or a parent assisting your child, this guide explains exactly how to complete the admission process.</p>\r\n<h2>Step 1: Choose Your Course</h2>\r\n<p>GoCare offers accredited programmes in Healthcare, Hospitality, and Business and Office Administration. Each programme has clear entry requirements and progression pathways from Level 3 to Level 6. If you are unsure which course fits you, GoCare provides free career guidance to help you choose the right path.</p>\r\n<h2>Step 2: Confirm You Meet the Entry Requirements</h2>\r\n<p>GoCare accepts learners with KCSE A to E, KCPE (for Level 3 foundation programmes), adult learners returning to school, and students seeking a career change. Healthcare, hospitality, and business programmes all have flexible entry points.</p>\r\n<h2>Step 3: Prepare Your Admission Documents</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>National ID or Birth Certificate</li>\r\n  <li>KCSE or KCPE results slip</li>\r\n  <li>Two passport-size photos</li>\r\n  <li>Registration fee (varies by programme)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>If you do not have your original documents yet, GoCare allows provisional admission using available results.</p>\r\n<h2>Step 4: Visit Any GoCare Campus for Registration</h2>\r\n<p>GoCare has two accessible campuses: <strong>Nairobi CBD</strong> (GatKim Complex, Temple Road, behind Ronald Ngala Street Post Office) and <strong>Ruiru Campus</strong> (Eastern Bypass, Kamakis, near GreenSpot Gardens). At the campus you will: fill in the admission form, submit your documents, select your study mode (day, evening, or Saturday), and receive your admission letter.</p>\r\n<h2>Step 5: Pay the Registration Fee</h2>\r\n<p>Once your documents are verified, you pay the registration fee to secure your slot. GoCare offers flexible payment plans to make fees manageable for all students.</p>\r\n<h2>Step 6: Begin Your Studies</h2>\r\n<p>After registration, you will receive your timetable, student handbook, and orientation details. Your journey at GoCare begins immediately.</p>\r\n<div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>You can also apply online or call GoCare&apos;s admissions team directly: 0703 115 502 | 0745 229 485 | 0745 220 344 | info@gocareinstitute.ac.ke</p></div></div>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\r\n      <h3>Apply to GoCare Today</h3>\r\n      <p>The admission process takes just minutes. Visit our Nairobi CBD or Ruiru campus and start your journey.</p>\r\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"A simple, clear, step-by-step guide for new students and parents — everything you need to know about the GoCare admission process. 4 min read 08 Jun 2026 Announcements Applying to GoCare Training Institute is a straightforward process designed to help students join their preferred programme quickly and confidently. Whether you are a KCSE graduate, a working adult, or a parent assisting your child, this guide explains exactly how to complete the admission process.\", \"heading\": \"How to Apply to GoCare Training Institute\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare offers accredited programmes in Healthcare, Hospitality, and Business and Office Administration. Each programme has clear entry requirements and progression pathways from Level 3 to Level 6. If you are unsure which course fits you, GoCare provides free career guidance to help you choose the right path.\", \"heading\": \"Step 1: Choose Your Course\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare accepts learners with KCSE A to E, KCPE (for Level 3 foundation programmes), adult learners returning to school, and students seeking a career change. Healthcare, hospitality, and business programmes all have flexible entry points.\", \"heading\": \"Step 2: Confirm You Meet the Entry Requirements\"}, {\"body\": \"National ID or Birth Certificate KCSE or KCPE results slip Two passport-size photos Registration fee (varies by programme) If you do not have your original documents yet, GoCare allows provisional admission using available results.\", \"heading\": \"Step 3: Prepare Your Admission Documents\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare has two accessible campuses: Nairobi CBD (GatKim Complex, Temple Road, behind Ronald Ngala Street Post Office) and Ruiru Campus (Eastern Bypass, Kamakis, near GreenSpot Gardens). At the campus you will: fill in the admission form, submit your documents, select your study mode (day, evening, or Saturday), and receive your admission letter.\", \"heading\": \"Step 4: Visit Any GoCare Campus for Registration\"}, {\"body\": \"Once your documents are verified, you pay the registration fee to secure your slot. GoCare offers flexible payment plans to make fees manageable for all students.\", \"heading\": \"Step 5: Pay the Registration Fee\"}, {\"body\": \"After registration, you will receive your timetable, student handbook, and orientation details. Your journey at GoCare begins immediately. You can also apply online or call GoCare&apos;s admissions team directly: 0703 115 502 | 0745 229 485 | 0745 220 344 | info@gocareinstitute.ac.ke\", \"heading\": \"Step 6: Begin Your Studies\"}, {\"body\": \"The admission process takes just minutes. Visit our Nairobi CBD or Ruiru campus and start your journey. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Apply to GoCare Today\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(46, 'How to Become a Chef in Kenya (Step-by-Step Guide) | GoCare Institute', 'how-to-become-chef-kenya', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\r\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\r\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"utensils\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Hospitality</span>\r\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">How to Become a Chef in Kenya (Step-by-Step Guide)</h1>\r\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Your complete guide to training, requirements, skills, salary, and career growth in Kenya&apos;s booming culinary industry.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 6 min read</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 09 Jun 2026</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Hospitality</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_6649.JPG\" alt=\"How to become a chef in Kenya\">\r\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>Becoming a chef in Kenya is one of the most exciting and rewarding career paths for anyone passionate about food, creativity, and hospitality. Kenya&apos;s culinary industry is booming &mdash; from hotels and restaurants to airlines, resorts, catering companies, and private dining services.</p>\r\n<h2>Who Is a Chef?</h2>\r\n<p>A chef is a professionally trained culinary expert responsible for preparing meals, designing menus, managing kitchens, and ensuring food quality and safety. Chefs work in hotels, restaurants, resorts, airlines, cruise ships, catering companies, bakeries, and as personal chefs.</p>\r\n<h2>Minimum Requirements to Become a Chef in Kenya</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>KCSE (Any Grade) &mdash; hospitality and culinary courses are open to all learners</li>\r\n  <li>KCPE (for Level 3 entry)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Best Courses to Become a Chef in Kenya</h2>\r\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>1. Certificate in Food Production (Culinary Arts)</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p>The most recommended course for aspiring chefs. <strong>Learn:</strong> Cooking techniques, Food preparation, Menu planning, Baking &amp; pastry, Kitchen operations, Food safety &amp; hygiene, Plating &amp; presentation.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>2. Food &amp; Beverage Production &ndash; Level 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p>A practical course focused on kitchen skills, food preparation, and professional cooking standards.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"course-card\"><h3>3. Food &amp; Beverage Service &ndash; Level 3 &amp; 4</h3><p class=\"entry\">Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) &bull; TVET CDACC</p><p>Ideal for students who want to understand both cooking and service in professional hospitality settings.</p></div>\r\n<h2>Career Progression for Chefs in Kenya</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Commis Chef &rarr; Chef de Partie &rarr; Sous Chef &rarr; Head Chef &rarr; Executive Chef</li>\r\n  <li>International opportunities in hotels, cruise ships, resorts, and restaurants globally</li>\r\n  <li>Entrepreneurship: start your own restaurant, catering business, or bakery</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Chef Salary in Kenya</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Entry-level (Commis Chef):</strong> KES 20,000 &ndash; 35,000/month</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Experienced Chef de Partie:</strong> KES 40,000 &ndash; 70,000/month</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Sous Chef:</strong> KES 60,000 &ndash; 100,000/month</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Head Chef / Executive Chef:</strong> KES 80,000 &ndash; 200,000+/month</li>\r\n  <li><strong>International (cruise ships, resorts):</strong> KES 150,000 &ndash; 500,000+/month</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare&apos;s culinary training is conducted in modern, commercially equipped kitchens with guaranteed industrial attachment in top hotels and restaurants &mdash; giving you real experience before graduation.</p></div><h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>FREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div></div>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\r\n      <h3>Start Your Culinary Career at GoCare</h3>\r\n      <p>Hospitality courses are open to all grades. Train in GoCare\'s modern kitchen labs with guaranteed hotel placement.</p>\r\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Your complete guide to training, requirements, skills, salary, and career growth in Kenya&apos;s booming culinary industry. 6 min read 09 Jun 2026 Hospitality Becoming a chef in Kenya is one of the most exciting and rewarding career paths for anyone passionate about food, creativity, and hospitality. Kenya&apos;s culinary industry is booming — from hotels and restaurants to airlines, resorts, catering companies, and private dining services.\", \"heading\": \"How to Become a Chef in Kenya (Step-by-Step Guide)\"}, {\"body\": \"A chef is a professionally trained culinary expert responsible for preparing meals, designing menus, managing kitchens, and ensuring food quality and safety. Chefs work in hotels, restaurants, resorts, airlines, cruise ships, catering companies, bakeries, and as personal chefs.\", \"heading\": \"Who Is a Chef?\"}, {\"body\": \"KCSE (Any Grade) — hospitality and culinary courses are open to all learners KCPE (for Level 3 entry)\", \"heading\": \"Minimum Requirements to Become a Chef in Kenya\"}, {\"body\": \"\", \"heading\": \"Best Courses to Become a Chef in Kenya\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE (Any Grade) • TVET CDACCThe most recommended course for aspiring chefs. Learn: Cooking techniques, Food preparation, Menu planning, Baking & pastry, Kitchen operations, Food safety & hygiene, Plating & presentation.\", \"heading\": \"1. Certificate in Food Production (Culinary Arts)\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCSE (Any Grade) • TVET CDACCA practical course focused on kitchen skills, food preparation, and professional cooking standards.\", \"heading\": \"2. Food & Beverage Production – Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry: KCPE or KCSE (Any Grade) • TVET CDACCIdeal for students who want to understand both cooking and service in professional hospitality settings.\", \"heading\": \"3. Food & Beverage Service – Level 3 & 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Commis Chef → Chef de Partie → Sous Chef → Head Chef → Executive Chef International opportunities in hotels, cruise ships, resorts, and restaurants globally Entrepreneurship: start your own restaurant, catering business, or bakery\", \"heading\": \"Career Progression for Chefs in Kenya\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry-level (Commis Chef): KES 20,000 – 35,000/month Experienced Chef de Partie: KES 40,000 – 70,000/month Sous Chef: KES 60,000 – 100,000/month Head Chef / Executive Chef: KES 80,000 – 200,000+/month International (cruise ships, resorts): KES 150,000 – 500,000+/month GoCare&apos;s culinary training is conducted in modern, commercially equipped kitchens with guaranteed industrial attachment in top hotels and restaurants — giving you real experience before graduation.\", \"heading\": \"Chef Salary in Kenya\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentFREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)Modern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Hospitality courses are open to all grades. Train in GoCare\'s modern kitchen labs with guaranteed hotel placement. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Start Your Culinary Career at GoCare\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(47, 'How to Become a Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) in Kenya | GoCare Institute', 'how-to-become-cna-kenya', NULL, '<div class=\"bp-wrap\">\r\n    <a href=\"blog.html\" class=\"bp-back\"><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i> Back to Blog</a>\r\n    <span class=\"bp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"stethoscope\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Healthcare</span>\r\n    <h1 class=\"bp-title\">How to Become a Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) in Kenya</h1>\r\n    <p class=\"bp-subtitle\">Your complete step-by-step guide to becoming a licensed and internationally recognised CNA &mdash; qualifications, training, licensing, and career outcomes.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-meta\">\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 7 min read</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"calendar\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> 09 Jun 2026</span>\r\n      <span><i data-lucide=\"tag\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px\"></i> Healthcare</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"bp-hero\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_6646.JPG\" alt=\"How to become CNA Kenya\">\r\n    <div class=\"bp-body\"><p>The demand for Certified Nursing Assistants (CNAs) in Kenya and abroad has never been higher. Hospitals, clinics, nursing homes, and international healthcare agencies are actively recruiting CNAs because they provide essential patient care and support within medical teams.</p>\r\n<h2>What Is a Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA)?</h2>\r\n<p>A CNA is a trained healthcare professional who provides basic patient care, vital signs monitoring, hygiene and grooming support, feeding and nutrition assistance, mobility and repositioning, infection control support, bedside procedures, and patient observation and reporting. CNAs work under nurses and clinicians in hospitals, clinics, nursing homes, and home-based care environments.</p>\r\n<h2>Why Become a CNA in Kenya?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>High demand in hospitals, clinics, and long-term care facilities</li>\r\n  <li>Strong overseas opportunities (Canada, USA, UK, Germany, Middle East)</li>\r\n  <li>Short training period relative to career benefits</li>\r\n  <li>Clear career progression to Diploma-level programmes</li>\r\n  <li>Competitive salaries (KES 30,000&ndash;60,000 locally; much higher abroad)</li>\r\n  <li>KHPOA practising licence eligibility</li>\r\n  <li>International certification options (SDC Canada, AMCA USA)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Step-by-Step: How to Become a CNA in Kenya</h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n  <li><strong>Meet the minimum entry requirements</strong> &mdash; KCSE D (Plain) and above qualifies you directly for the Certificate in Healthcare Support Services Level 5 (CNA). If you scored lower, you can still become a CNA through the progressive pathway: Level 3 &rarr; Level 4 &rarr; Level 5.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Enrol in the CNA programme</strong> &mdash; Choose an accredited institution. GoCare Training Institute offers three CNA pathways (Level 3, Level 4, Level 5) to accommodate all entry grades.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Complete the training</strong> &mdash; Duration: 1&frac12; years for HSS Level 5. Includes classroom instruction, skills-lab practice, and guaranteed clinical attachment.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Sit for the TVET CDACC national assessment</strong> &mdash; Pass your competency-based assessments to earn your national CNA certificate.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Apply for your KHPOA practising licence</strong> &mdash; With your TVET CDACC Level 5 certificate, apply to the Kenya Health Professions Oversight Authority for your practising licence.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Earn your international CNA certification</strong> &mdash; GoCare includes FREE SDC Canada and AMCA USA certification with the HSS Level 5 programme.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Start your career</strong> &mdash; Apply to hospitals, clinics, homecare agencies, NGOs, or international healthcare employers.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare Training Institute is one of the few institutions in Kenya offering all three CNA pathways (Level 3, 4, and 5) with guaranteed clinical attachment and FREE international certification included in the programme.</p></div><h2>Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?</h2><ul><li>Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmes</li><li>Competency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculum</li><li>Guaranteed industrial and hospital attachment</li><li>FREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)</li><li>Modern practical skills labs</li><li>Two campuses &mdash; Nairobi CBD and Ruiru</li><li>High graduate employability in Kenya and abroad</li></ul><div class=\"bp-callout\"><p>GoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment &mdash; giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.</p></div></div>\r\n    <div class=\"bp-cta\">\r\n      <h3>Start Your CNA Journey at GoCare</h3>\r\n      <p>Entry from KCSE D (Plain). Includes KHPOA practising licence eligibility and FREE SDC Canada / AMCA USA certification.</p>\r\n      <a href=\"apply.html\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px\"></i></a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>', '[{\"body\": \"Your complete step-by-step guide to becoming a licensed and internationally recognised CNA — qualifications, training, licensing, and career outcomes. 7 min read 09 Jun 2026 Healthcare The demand for Certified Nursing Assistants (CNAs) in Kenya and abroad has never been higher. Hospitals, clinics, nursing homes, and international healthcare agencies are actively recruiting CNAs because they provide essential patient care and support within medical teams.\", \"heading\": \"How to Become a Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) in Kenya\"}, {\"body\": \"A CNA is a trained healthcare professional who provides basic patient care, vital signs monitoring, hygiene and grooming support, feeding and nutrition assistance, mobility and repositioning, infection control support, bedside procedures, and patient observation and reporting. CNAs work under nurses and clinicians in hospitals, clinics, nursing homes, and home-based care environments.\", \"heading\": \"What Is a Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA)?\"}, {\"body\": \"High demand in hospitals, clinics, and long-term care facilities Strong overseas opportunities (Canada, USA, UK, Germany, Middle East) Short training period relative to career benefits Clear career progression to Diploma-level programmes Competitive salaries (KES 30,000–60,000 locally; much higher abroad) KHPOA practising licence eligibility International certification options (SDC Canada, AMCA USA)\", \"heading\": \"Why Become a CNA in Kenya?\"}, {\"body\": \"Meet the minimum entry requirements — KCSE D (Plain) and above qualifies you directly for the Certificate in Healthcare Support Services Level 5 (CNA). If you scored lower, you can still become a CNA through the progressive pathway: Level 3 → Level 4 → Level 5. Enrol in the CNA programme — Choose an accredited institution. GoCare Training Institute offers three CNA pathways (Level 3, Level 4, Level 5) to accommodate all entry grades. Complete the training — Duration: 1½ years for HSS Level 5. Includes classroom instruction, skills-lab practice, and guaranteed clinical attachment. Sit for the TVET CDACC national assessment — Pass your competency-based assessments to earn your national CNA certificate. Apply for your KHPOA practising licence — With your TVET CDACC Level 5 certificate, apply to the Kenya Health Professions Oversight Authority for your practising licence. Earn your international CNA certification — GoCare includes FREE SDC Canada and AMCA USA certification with the HSS Level 5 programme. Start your career — Apply to hospitals, clinics, homecare agencies, NGOs, or international healthcare employers. GoCare Training Institute is one of the few institutions in Kenya offering all three CNA pathways (Level 3, 4, and 5) with guaranteed clinical attachment and FREE international certification included in the programme.\", \"heading\": \"Step-by-Step: How to Become a CNA in Kenya\"}, {\"body\": \"Accredited and TVETA-licensed programmesCompetency-based, TVET CDACC-aligned curriculumGuaranteed industrial and hospital attachmentFREE fully sponsored international certification (SDC Canada / AMCA USA)Modern practical skills labsTwo campuses — Nairobi CBD and RuiruHigh graduate employability in Kenya and abroadGoCare equips you with nationally accredited qualifications, international certification, and guaranteed attachment — giving you the competence and confidence to succeed anywhere.\", \"heading\": \"Why Train at GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry from KCSE D (Plain). Includes KHPOA practising licence eligibility and FREE SDC Canada / AMCA USA certification. Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"Start Your CNA Journey at GoCare\"}]', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-08-03 10:34:46', '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46');
