Caregiving – Level 4 (Advanced Healthcare Assistant)\"}, {\"body\": \"Read More Healthcare 5 min read · 02 Jun 2026\", \"heading\": \"Certificate in Home-Based Care Support – Level 3\"}, {\"body\": \"Read More Announcements 5 min read · 03 Jun 2026\", \"heading\": \"Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) — Training Options at GoCare\"}, {\"body\": \"Read More Healthcare 5 min read · 03 Jun 2026\", \"heading\": \"Colleges Offering TVET CDACC Courses in Kenya\"}, {\"body\": \"Read More Healthcare 6 min read · 04 Jun 2026\", \"heading\": \"Community Health Courses — Certificate Level 5 & Diploma Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Read More Announcements 6 min read · 04 Jun 2026\", \"heading\": \"Difference Between Caregiver, HCA, and CNA\"}, {\"body\": \"Read More Announcements 4 min read · 05 Jun 2026\", \"heading\": \"Difference Between TVET CDACC, TVETA, NITA, and KHPOA\"}, {\"body\": \"Read More Hospitality 5 min read · 05 Jun 2026\", \"heading\": \"Diploma Courses at GoCare Training Institute\"}, {\"body\": \"Read More Healthcare 5 min read · 06 Jun 2026\", \"heading\": \"Front Office vs Housekeeping — Which Course Should You Choose?\"}, {\"body\": \"Read More Healthcare 6 min read · 06 Jun 2026\", \"heading\": \"Health Care Assistant Course (HCA) at GoCare\"}, {\"body\": \"Read More Healthcare 6 min read · 07 Jun 2026\", \"heading\": \"Healthcare Support Services – Level 5 / Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA)\"}, {\"body\": \"Read More Certifications 5 min read · 07 Jun 2026\", \"heading\": \"How GoCare Students Qualify for International Jobs\"}, {\"body\": \"Read More Healthcare 7 min read · 08 Jun 2026\", \"heading\": \"How International Certification Increases Your Chances of Working Abroad\"}, {\"body\": \"Read More Announcements 4 min read · 08 Jun 2026\", \"heading\": \"How to Apply for the UK Health & Care Worker Visa (Caregiver Pathway)\"}, {\"body\": \"Read More Healthcare 7 min read · 09 Jun 2026\", \"heading\": \"How to Apply to GoCare Training Institute\"}, {\"body\": \"Read More Hospitality 6 min read · 09 Jun 2026\", \"heading\": \"How to Become a Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) in Kenya\"}, {\"body\": \"Read More Healthcare 5 min read · 10 Jun 2026\", \"heading\": \"How to Become a Chef in Kenya (Step-by-Step Guide)\"}, {\"body\": \"Read More Business & ICT 6 min read · 10 Jun 2026\", \"heading\": \"How to Become a Patient Attendant in Kenya\"}, {\"body\": \"Read More Feature Article\", \"heading\": \"How to Become an Office Administrator in Kenya\"}, {\"body\": \"What makes GoCare different isn\'t just what we teach — it\'s how we teach it. Step inside our classrooms, skills labs, and simulation centres and discover why our hands-on, competency-based approach produces graduates who are truly job-ready from day one. Read Full Story Newsletter\", \"heading\": \"Inside GoCare\'s Learning Environment\"}, {\"body\": \"Get the latest articles, career tips, programme news, and student stories delivered straight to your inbox. Subscribe\", \"heading\": \"Stay Informed with GoCare Insights\"}, {\"body\": \"Join thousands of GoCare graduates building successful careers across Kenya and internationally. Apply Now Download Prospectus\", \"heading\": \"Ready to Begin Your Journey?\"}]', 'blog.html', 1, '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46');
INSERT INTO `site_pages` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `image`, `use_builder`, `sections`, `source_path`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(12, 'Career Pathways | GoCare Training Institute', 'careers', '<!-- COOKIE CONSENT -->\n  <div id=\"cookie-banner\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"Cookie consent\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n    <div class=\"ck-inner\">\n      <div class=\"ck-left\">\n        <div class=\"ck-icon-wrap\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n            <path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 10 10 4 4 0 0 1-5-5 4 4 0 0 1-5-5\"/>\n            <path d=\"M8.5 8.5v.01\"/><path d=\"M16 15.5v.01\"/><path d=\"M12 12v.01\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ck-copy\">\n          <strong>We use cookies</strong>\n          <p>We use cookies to improve your experience, analyse site traffic, and personalise content. By continuing, you agree to our <a href=\"#\">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ck-actions\">\n        <button class=\"ck-btn-decline\" id=\"ckDecline\">Decline</button>\n        <button class=\"ck-btn-accept\" id=\"ckAccept\">Accept All</button>\n        <button class=\"ck-close\" id=\"ckClose\" aria-label=\"Close\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- TOP BAR -->\n\n\n  <!-- NAVBAR -->\n  \n  <!-- -- NAVBAR ---------------------------------------- -->\n  \n  <!-- -- NAVBAR ---------------------------------------- -->\n  \n\n  <!-- -- SUB BAR --------------------------------------- -->\n  <div class=\"subbar\">\n    <div class=\"wrap subbar-inner\">\n      <span class=\"subbar-tagline\">Train With The Experts... Become an Expert!</span>\n      <div class=\"subbar-portals\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"subbar-btn subbar-btn--student\">Student Portal</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"subbar-btn subbar-btn--staff\">Staff Portal</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n<div class=\"cs-page\">\n\n  <!-- HERO -->\n    <!-- PAGE HERO -->\n  <section class=\"ph\">\n    <div class=\"ph-bg\">\n      <img loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/PXL_20260407_060321091.MP~2.jpg\" alt=\"Career Pathways\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ph-overlay\"></div>\n    <div class=\"ph-inner\">\n      <div class=\"ph-content\">\n        <span class=\"ph-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"briefcase\"></i> Career Pathways</span>\n        \n        <h1>Your <em>Career</em> Starts Here</h1>\n        <p>Launch a rewarding career in healthcare, hospitality, or social sciences. GoCare graduates are employed across Kenya and internationally in leading institutions.</p>\n        <div class=\"ph-btns\">\n          <a href=\"apply.html\" class=\"ph-btn-primary\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\"></i></a>\n          <a href=\"courses.html\" class=\"ph-btn-ghost\">Explore Courses <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\"></i></a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- ── SECTION 1: CAREER PATHS &mdash; image left, cards right ── -->\n  <section class=\"cp-split\">\n    <div class=\"cp-split-img\">\n      <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_4408.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare students in healthcare scrubs\">\n      <div class=\"cp-split-badge\"><i data-lucide=\"briefcase\"></i> 3 Career Pathways</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cp-split-body\">\n      <span class=\"cp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"map\"></i> Your Career Options</span>\n      <h2>Three Pathways to a <em>Rewarding Career</em></h2>\n      <p>GoCare equips graduates with the skills, certifications, and networks to thrive &mdash; whether you choose employment, entrepreneurship, or further professional growth.</p>\n      <div class=\"cp-path-stack\">\n        <div class=\"cp-path-item\">\n          <div class=\"cp-path-ico\"><i data-lucide=\"building-2\" style=\"width:22px;height:22px\"></i></div>\n          <div>\n            <strong>Employment Opportunities</strong>\n            <span>Placed in hospitals, hotels, NGOs and corporates through our industry partnerships and recruitment fairs.</span>\n            <a href=\"industry-liaison.html\">Explore placements <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:13px;height:13px\"></i></a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cp-path-item\">\n          <div class=\"cp-path-ico\"><i data-lucide=\"lightbulb\" style=\"width:22px;height:22px\"></i></div>\n          <div>\n            <strong>Entrepreneurship</strong>\n            <span>Launch your own business with mentorship, business planning modules, and access to startup support.</span>\n            <a href=\"#\">Learn more <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:13px;height:13px\"></i></a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cp-path-item\">\n          <div class=\"cp-path-ico\"><i data-lucide=\"award\" style=\"width:22px;height:22px\"></i></div>\n          <div>\n            <strong>Professional Certifications</strong>\n            <span>Advance with KNEC, CDACC, and internationally recognised credentials that open global doors.</span>\n            <a href=\"schools/international-certifications.html\">View certifications <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:13px;height:13px\"></i></a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ── SECTION 2: WHERE GRADUATES WORK &mdash; dark grid ── -->\n  <section class=\"cp-sectors\">\n    <div class=\"cp-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"cp-section-hd\">\n        <span class=\"cp-eyebrow cp-eyebrow--light\"><i data-lucide=\"globe\"></i> Industry Reach</span>\n        <h2>Where Our Graduates Work</h2>\n        <p>GoCare-trained professionals are trusted across Kenya and internationally in high-growth industries.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cp-sectors-grid\">\n        <div class=\"cp-sector-card\">\n          <div class=\"cp-sector-icon\"><i data-lucide=\"heart-pulse\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px\"></i></div>\n          <h4>Healthcare &amp; Medical</h4>\n          <ul><li>Public &amp; Private Hospitals</li><li>Rehabilitation Centres</li><li>Home Based Care Agencies</li><li>Funeral Homes &amp; Mortuaries</li></ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cp-sector-card\">\n          <div class=\"cp-sector-icon\"><i data-lucide=\"utensils\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px\"></i></div>\n          <h4>Hospitality &amp; Tourism</h4>\n          <ul><li>Luxury Hotels &amp; Resorts</li><li>Catering &amp; Event Firms</li><li>Cruise Lines &amp; Airlines</li><li>Corporate Hospitality</li></ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cp-sector-card\">\n          <div class=\"cp-sector-icon\"><i data-lucide=\"users\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px\"></i></div>\n          <h4>Social &amp; Community</h4>\n          <ul><li>International NGOs</li><li>Community Based Orgs</li><li>Faith Based Institutions</li><li>Social Welfare Agencies</li></ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cp-sector-card\">\n          <div class=\"cp-sector-icon\"><i data-lucide=\"building-2\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px\"></i></div>\n          <h4>Business &amp; Admin</h4>\n          <ul><li>Corporate Offices</li><li>Customer Support Hubs</li><li>Digital Marketing Firms</li><li>SME Management</li></ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <!-- campus image strip -->\n      <div class=\"cp-campus-strip\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_4430.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare students at campus\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_2202.JPG\" alt=\"GoCare campus activities\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/PXL_20260207_075037132.PORTRAIT.ORIGINAL~2.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare student group\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ── SECTION 3: GRADUATION BANNER ── -->\n  <section class=\"cp-grad-banner\">\n    <div class=\"cp-grad-bg\">\n      <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC05531.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare graduation ceremony\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cp-grad-overlay\"></div>\n    <div class=\"cp-wrap cp-grad-inner\">\n      <h2>Celebrating <em>Every Graduate</em></h2>\n      <p>Hundreds of GoCare graduates cross the stage each year &mdash; equipped, certified, and ready to transform lives.</p>\n      <div class=\"cp-stats-row\">\n        <div class=\"cp-stat\"><span>5000+</span><small>Graduates</small></div>\n        <div class=\"cp-stat-div\"></div>\n        <div class=\"cp-stat\"><span>95%</span><small>Employment Rate</small></div>\n        <div class=\"cp-stat-div\"></div>\n        <div class=\"cp-stat\"><span>30+</span><small>Industrial Partners</small></div>\n        <div class=\"cp-stat-div\"></div>\n        <div class=\"cp-stat\"><span>6+</span><small>Countries Reached</small></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ── SECTION 4: ALUMNI STORIES &mdash; image right, testimonials left ── -->\n  <section class=\"cp-alumni-sec\">\n    <div class=\"cp-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"cp-alumni-layout\">\n        <div class=\"cp-alumni-left\">\n          <span class=\"cp-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"message-circle\"></i> Alumni Voices</span>\n          <h2>From GoCare to <em>Great Careers</em></h2>\n          <p>Our graduates are working in leading hospitals, running their own businesses, and representing Kenya on the global stage. Here is what some of them have to say.</p>\n          <div class=\"cp-testimonials\">\n            <div class=\"cp-tcard\">\n              <div class=\"cp-tcard-top\">\n                <div class=\"cp-tavatar\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC05638.jpg\" alt=\"Graduate speaking at ceremony\"></div>\n                <div><strong>Sarah M.</strong><span>Clinic Manager, Nairobi</span></div>\n              </div>\n              <blockquote>\"GoCare gave me the foundation to grow from a nursing assistant to managing an entire clinic within three years.\"</blockquote>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"cp-tcard\">\n              <div class=\"cp-tcard-top\">\n                <div class=\"cp-tavatar\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC00715.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare graduates\"></div>\n                <div><strong>James K.</strong><span>Entrepreneur &amp; Agency Owner</span></div>\n              </div>\n              <blockquote>\"The entrepreneurship module helped me launch my own home-care agency. I now employ 15 graduates.\"</blockquote>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"cp-tcard\">\n              <div class=\"cp-tcard-top\">\n                <div class=\"cp-tavatar\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC01270.jpg\" alt=\"Graduation celebration\"></div>\n                <div><strong>Grace A.</strong><span>International Placement, UK</span></div>\n              </div>\n              <blockquote>\"My AMCA certification from GoCare opened a door to a healthcare job in the UK. I am forever grateful.\"</blockquote>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cp-alumni-right\">\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG-20211115-WA0002.jpg.jpeg\" alt=\"GoCare graduation group photo\" class=\"cp-alumni-hero-img\">\n          <div class=\"cp-alumni-img-caption\">\n            <i data-lucide=\"graduation-cap\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px\"></i>\n            GoCare Annual Graduation Ceremony\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ── SECTION 5: CTA ── -->\n  <section class=\"cp-cta\">\n    <div class=\"cp-cta-bg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_8347.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare students\"></div>\n    <div class=\"cp-cta-overlay\"></div>\n    <div class=\"cp-wrap cp-cta-inner\">\n      <h2>Ready to Start Your Journey?</h2>\n      <p>Take the first step toward a rewarding career. Apply today and join thousands of successful GoCare graduates who are making a difference across Kenya and beyond.</p>\n      <div class=\"cp-cta-btns\">\n        <a href=\"apply.html\" class=\"cp-cta-btn-primary\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px\"></i></a>\n        <a href=\"courses.html\" class=\"cp-cta-btn-ghost\">Explore Courses <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px\"></i></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n\n  \n\n  \n  <!-- BACK TO TOP -->\n  <button class=\"back-to-top\" id=\"backToTop\" aria-label=\"Back to top\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 15l-6-6-6 6\"/></svg>\n  </button>', 'images/new-images/PXL_20260407_060321091.MP~2.jpg', 0, '[{\"body\": \"Launch a rewarding career in healthcare, hospitality, or social sciences. GoCare graduates are employed across Kenya and internationally in leading institutions. Apply Now Explore Courses 3 Career Pathways Your Career Options\", \"heading\": \"Your Career Starts Here\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare equips graduates with the skills, certifications, and networks to thrive — whether you choose employment, entrepreneurship, or further professional growth. Employment Opportunities Placed in hospitals, hotels, NGOs and corporates through our industry partnerships and recruitment fairs. Explore placements Entrepreneurship Launch your own business with mentorship, business planning modules, and access to startup support. Learn more Professional Certifications Advance with KNEC, CDACC, and internationally recognised credentials that open global doors. View certifications Industry Reach\", \"heading\": \"Three Pathways to a Rewarding Career\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare-trained professionals are trusted across Kenya and internationally in high-growth industries.\", \"heading\": \"Where Our Graduates Work\"}, {\"body\": \"Public & Private HospitalsRehabilitation CentresHome Based Care AgenciesFuneral Homes & Mortuaries\", \"heading\": \"Healthcare & Medical\"}, {\"body\": \"Luxury Hotels & ResortsCatering & Event FirmsCruise Lines & AirlinesCorporate Hospitality\", \"heading\": \"Hospitality & Tourism\"}, {\"body\": \"International NGOsCommunity Based OrgsFaith Based InstitutionsSocial Welfare Agencies\", \"heading\": \"Social & Community\"}, {\"body\": \"Corporate OfficesCustomer Support HubsDigital Marketing FirmsSME Management\", \"heading\": \"Business & Admin\"}, {\"body\": \"Hundreds of GoCare graduates cross the stage each year — equipped, certified, and ready to transform lives. 5000+Graduates 95%Employment Rate 30+Industrial Partners 6+Countries Reached Alumni Voices\", \"heading\": \"Celebrating Every Graduate\"}, {\"body\": \"Our graduates are working in leading hospitals, running their own businesses, and representing Kenya on the global stage. Here is what some of them have to say. Sarah M.Clinic Manager, Nairobi \\\"GoCare gave me the foundation to grow from a nursing assistant to managing an entire clinic within three years.\\\" James K.Entrepreneur & Agency Owner \\\"The entrepreneurship module helped me launch my own home-care agency. I now employ 15 graduates.\\\" Grace A.International Placement, UK \\\"My AMCA certification from GoCare opened a door to a healthcare job in the UK. I am forever grateful.\\\" GoCare Annual Graduation Ceremony\", \"heading\": \"From GoCare to Great Careers\"}, {\"body\": \"Take the first step toward a rewarding career. Apply today and join thousands of successful GoCare graduates who are making a difference across Kenya and beyond. Apply Now Explore Courses\", \"heading\": \"Ready to Start Your Journey?\"}]', 'careers.html', 1, '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:46'),
(13, 'Customer Service Chatbot', 'chatbot', '<!-- Demo page background content -->\r\n  <div class=\"text-center px-6 select-none\">\r\n    <div class=\"text-6xl mb-4\">🛒</div>\r\n    <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-slate-700 mb-2\">ShopEase Store</h1>\r\n    <p class=\"text-slate-500 text-lg mb-1\">Your one-stop online shop</p>\r\n    <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm\">Click the chat button at the bottom-right to get help</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════\r\n       FLOATING TOGGLE BUTTON\r\n  ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->\r\n  <button\r\n    id=\"chatToggle\"\r\n    onclick=\"toggleChat()\"\r\n    class=\"fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-50 w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-brand shadow-lg shadow-blue-300/50 text-white flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-brand-dark active:scale-95 transition-all duration-200 focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 focus:ring-blue-300\"\r\n    aria-label=\"Open customer support chat\"\r\n  >\r\n    <!-- Chat icon (shown when closed) -->\r\n    <svg id=\"iconOpen\" class=\"w-7 h-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\r\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M8 10h.01M12 10h.01M16 10h.01M21 15a2 2 0 01-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v10z\"/>\r\n    </svg>\r\n    <!-- Close icon (shown when open) -->\r\n    <svg id=\"iconClose\" class=\"w-7 h-7 hidden\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\r\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12\"/>\r\n    </svg>\r\n    <!-- Notification badge -->\r\n    <span id=\"notifBadge\" class=\"absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-5 h-5 bg-red-500 text-white text-xs rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">1</span>\r\n  </button>\r\n\r\n  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════\r\n       CHAT WINDOW\r\n  ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->\r\n  <div\r\n    id=\"chatWindow\"\r\n    class=\"hidden-chat fixed bottom-24 right-6 z-40 w-[370px] max-w-[calc(100vw-1.5rem)] bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-2xl shadow-slate-300/60 flex flex-col overflow-hidden\"\r\n    style=\"height: 540px; max-height: calc(100vh - 120px);\"\r\n    role=\"dialog\"\r\n    aria-label=\"Customer support chat\"\r\n  >\r\n    <!-- Header -->\r\n    <div class=\"bg-brand px-4 py-3 flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0\">\r\n      <div class=\"relative\">\r\n        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-xl\">🎧</div>\r\n        <span class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 bg-green-400 border-2 border-brand rounded-full\"></span>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div class=\"flex-1\">\r\n        <p class=\"text-white font-semibold text-sm leading-tight\">ShopEase Support</p>\r\n        <p class=\"text-blue-200 text-xs\">Typically replies instantly</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <!-- Escalation buttons -->\r\n      <div class=\"flex gap-2\">\r\n        <a href=\"https://wa.me/254700000000\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"WhatsApp\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/15 hover:bg-white/30 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Contact via WhatsApp\">\r\n          <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-white\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\r\n            <path d=\"M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347z\"/>\r\n            <path d=\"M11.999 2C6.477 2 2 6.477 2 12c0 1.887.502 3.659 1.381 5.193L2 22l4.878-1.361A9.937 9.937 0 0012 22c5.523 0 10-4.477 10-10S17.522 2 11.999 2zm.001 18.182a8.181 8.181 0 01-4.164-1.133l-.299-.177-3.091.863.872-3.018-.194-.31A8.183 8.183 0 013.818 12c0-4.512 3.67-8.182 8.183-8.182 4.512 0 8.182 3.67 8.182 8.182 0 4.513-3.67 8.182-8.182 8.182z\"/>\r\n          </svg>\r\n        </a>\r\n        <a href=\"mailto:support@shopease.com\" title=\"Email\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/15 hover:bg-white/30 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Contact via Email\">\r\n          <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\r\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z\"/>\r\n          </svg>\r\n        </a>\r\n        <button onclick=\"toggleChat()\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/15 hover:bg-white/30 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Close chat\">\r\n          <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\r\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12\"/>\r\n          </svg>\r\n        </button>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Messages area -->\r\n    <div id=\"chatMessages\" class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto px-4 py-4 flex flex-col gap-3 bg-slate-50\"></div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Quick replies -->\r\n    <div id=\"quickReplies\" class=\"px-4 py-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2 bg-white border-t border-slate-100 shrink-0\"></div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Input bar -->\r\n    <div class=\"px-3 py-3 bg-white border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0\">\r\n      <input\r\n        id=\"chatInput\"\r\n        type=\"text\"\r\n        placeholder=\"Type a message&hellip;\"\r\n        maxlength=\"300\"\r\n        class=\"flex-1 text-sm bg-slate-100 rounded-full px-4 py-2.5 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand/40 placeholder-slate-400 text-slate-700 transition-all\"\r\n        onkeydown=\"handleKey(event)\"\r\n        aria-label=\"Type your message\"\r\n      />\r\n      <button\r\n        id=\"sendBtn\"\r\n        onclick=\"handleSend()\"\r\n        class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand text-white flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-brand-dark active:scale-95 transition-all shrink-0 disabled:opacity-40\"\r\n        aria-label=\"Send message\"\r\n      >\r\n        <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 rotate-45 -translate-y-px\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\r\n          <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M12 19l9 2-9-18-9 18 9-2zm0 0v-8\"/>\r\n        </svg>\r\n      </button>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Footer -->\r\n    <p class=\"text-center text-[10px] text-slate-400 py-1.5 bg-white shrink-0\">\r\n      Powered by <span class=\"font-semibold text-brand\">ShopEase</span> &middot; <a href=\"mailto:support@shopease.com\" class=\"hover:underline\">support@shopease.com</a>\r\n    </p>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════\r\n       CHATBOT SCRIPT\r\n  ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->', NULL, 0, '[{\"body\": \"Your one-stop online shop Click the chat button at the bottom-right to get help 1 🎧 ShopEase Support Typically replies instantly Powered by ShopEase · support@shopease.com\", \"heading\": \"ShopEase Store\"}]', 'chatbot.html', 1, '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:47'),
(14, 'Contact Us · GoCare Training Institute \' Kenya\'s Leading Healthcare College', 'contact', '<!-- COOKIE CONSENT -->\n  <div id=\"cookie-banner\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"Cookie consent\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n    <div class=\"ck-inner\">\n      <div class=\"ck-left\">\n        <div class=\"ck-icon-wrap\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n            <path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 10 10 4 4 0 0 1-5-5 4 4 0 0 1-5-5\"/>\n            <path d=\"M8.5 8.5v.01\"/><path d=\"M16 15.5v.01\"/><path d=\"M12 12v.01\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ck-copy\">\n          <strong>We use cookies</strong>\n          <p>We use cookies to improve your experience, analyse site traffic, and personalise content. By continuing, you agree to our <a href=\"index.html\">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ck-actions\">\n        <button class=\"ck-btn-decline\" id=\"ckDecline\">Decline</button>\n        <button class=\"ck-btn-accept\" id=\"ckAccept\">Accept All</button>\n        <button class=\"ck-close\" id=\"ckClose\" aria-label=\"Close\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- -- NAVBAR ---------------------------------------- -->\n  \n\n  <!-- -- SUB BAR --------------------------------------- -->\n  <div class=\"subbar\">\n    <div class=\"wrap subbar-inner\">\n      <span class=\"subbar-tagline\">Train With The Experts... Become an Expert!</span>\n      <div class=\"subbar-portals\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"subbar-btn subbar-btn--student\">Student Portal</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"subbar-btn subbar-btn--staff\">Staff Portal</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <!-- â”€â”€ PAGE TITLE HERO â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€ -->\n    <!-- PAGE HERO -->\n  <section class=\"ph\">\n    <div class=\"ph-bg\">\n      <img loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/contact-us-header.png\" alt=\"Get In Touch\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ph-overlay\"></div>\n    <div class=\"ph-inner\">\n      <div class=\"ph-content\">\n        <span class=\"ph-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"phone-call\"></i> Get In Touch</span>\n        \n        <h1>Contact <em>Us</em></h1>\n        <p>We&#8217;re here to support you at every step. Reach out for course guidance, admissions queries, accommodation information, or any other questions.</p>\n        <div class=\"ph-btns\">\n          <a href=\"contact.html#contact-form\" class=\"ph-btn-primary\">Send a Message <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\"></i></a>\n          <a href=\"contact.html#location\" class=\"ph-btn-ghost\">Find Our Campus <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\"></i></a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- â”€â”€ CONTACT CONTENT â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€ -->\n  <section class=\"contact-sec\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"contact-intro reveal\">\n        <h2>We\'re Here to Support You \' <span class=\"accent\">Every Step of the Way.</span></h2>\n        <p>Whether you need help choosing a course, understanding fees, confirming admission requirements, or asking about accommodation, the GoCare Training Institute team is ready to assist you.</p>\n        <p>Reach out through any of the channels below and our staff will respond promptly.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Photo strip -->\n      <div class=\"ct-photo-strip reveal\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_7779.JPG\" alt=\"GoCare nursing students in the skills lab\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_2910.JPG\" alt=\"GoCare students at the campus\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC05638.jpg\" alt=\"Training session\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC05648.jpg\" alt=\"Students learning\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC05724.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare campus\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/WhatsApp Image 2026-05-05 at 15.49.47.jpeg\" alt=\"Healthcare training\">\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"contact-methods-grid reveal delay-1\">\n        <div class=\"contact-method-card\">\n          <div class=\"method-icon\"><i data-lucide=\"phone\"></i></div>\n          <h3>Call or WhatsApp Us</h3>\n          <p>For quick assistance, inquiries, or admissions support:</p>\n          <div class=\"contact-item\">\n            <strong>Nairobi City Campus</strong>\n            <a href=\"tel:+254745220344\">0745 220 344</a>\n            <p>For campus specific inquiries, class schedules, directions, and student support.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"contact-item\">\n            <strong>Thika Road / Ruiru Campus</strong>\n            <a href=\"tel:+254745229485\">0745 229 485</a>\n            <p>For inquiries related to the Eastern Bypass, Kamakis campus, programs, and support services.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"contact-item\">\n            <strong>Admissions Office</strong>\n            <a href=\"tel:+254703115502\">0703 115 502</a>\n            <p>For all admission inquiries, course guidance, intakes, and application support.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"contact-method-card\">\n          <div class=\"method-icon\"><i data-lucide=\"mail\"></i></div>\n          <h3>Email Us</h3>\n          <a href=\"mailto:info@gocareinstitute.ac.ke\" class=\"email-link\">info@gocareinstitute.ac.ke</a>\n          <p>Our admissions and support teams respond promptly during working hours.</p>\n          <div class=\"contact-form-embed\">\n            <h4>Send us a Message</h4>\n            <form id=\"contactForm\" onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault();this.innerHTML=\'<div style=\\\'text-align:center;padding:40px 0;color:var(--p)\\\'><i data-lucide=\\\'check-circle-2\\\' style=\\\'width:48px;height:48px;margin-bottom:16px\\\'></i><h3>Message Sent!</h3><p>We will get back to you shortly.</p></div>\';lucide.createIcons()\">\n              <div class=\"form-group\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Full Name\" required></div>\n              <div class=\"form-group\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Email Address\" required></div>\n              <div class=\"form-group\"><textarea class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"How can we help you?\" rows=\"3\" required></textarea></div>\n              <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width:100%\">Send Message <i data-lucide=\"send\"></i></button>\n            </form>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"campus-locations reveal\">\n        <h3>Visit Our Campuses</h3>\n        <div class=\"campus-grid\">\n          <div class=\"campus-card\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"campus-card-img\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_8771.jpg.jpeg\" alt=\"GoCare Nairobi City Campus\">\n            <h4>Nairobi City Campus</h4>\n            <p class=\"address\">Nairobi City Campus, Nairobi CBD, GatKim Complex, Temple Road (Behind Ronald Ngala Street Post Office)</p>\n            <p>This central location is easily accessible via public and private transport, making it ideal for students within Nairobi and surrounding areas.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"campus-card\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"campus-card-img\" src=\"images/new-images/PXL_20260205_094049025.PORTRAIT.ORIGINAL~2.jpg.jpeg\" alt=\"GoCare Ruiru Campus\">\n            <h4>Thika Road / Ruiru Campus</h4>\n            <p class=\"address\">Eastern Bypass, Kamakis (Near GreenSpot Gardens), Ruiru</p>\n            <p>A modern, spacious learning environment serving students along Thika Road, Ruiru, Kiambu County, and surrounding regions. - With hostels.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"campus-amenities\">\n          <h5>Both campuses offer:</h5>\n          <ul>\n            <li><i data-lucide=\"check-circle\"></i> Modern classrooms</li>\n            <li><i data-lucide=\"check-circle\"></i> Practical training labs</li>\n            <li><i data-lucide=\"check-circle\"></i> Student support services</li>\n            <li><i data-lucide=\"check-circle\"></i> Safe, student friendly environments</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Campus map -->\n      <div class=\"campus-map reveal\" id=\"location\">\n        <h3>Find Us on the Map</h3>\n        <p class=\"campus-map-sub\">GoCare Training Institute has two strategic campuses serving Nairobi and the greater Thika Road / Ruiru region.</p>\n        <div class=\"campus-map-grid\">\n\n          <!-- Nairobi City Campus -->\n          <div class=\"campus-map-card\">\n            <h4>Nairobi City Campus</h4>\n            <p class=\"campus-map-addr\">Nairobi City Campus, Nairobi CBD, GatKim Complex, Temple Road (Behind Ronald Ngala Street Post Office)</p>\n            <div class=\"campus-map-embed\">\n              <iframe\n                src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3988.9!2d36.8290!3d-1.2818!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x182f1143a142f57d%3A0xf3bf6e2d6b445988!2sGoCare%20Training%20Institute%20Nairobi%20City%20Campus!5e0!3m2!1sen!2ske!4v1718000000000!5m2!1sen!2ske\"\n                title=\"GoCare Training Institute &ndash; Nairobi City Campus location\"\n                width=\"100%\"\n                height=\"380\"\n                style=\"border:0;\"\n                allowfullscreen=\"\"\n                loading=\"lazy\"\n                referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>\n            </div>\n            <a class=\"campus-map-link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/GoCare+Training+Institute+Nairobi+City+Campus,+Temple+Rd,+Nairobi/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x182f1143a142f57d:0xf3bf6e2d6b445988\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n              Get Directions <i data-lucide=\"external-link\"></i>\n            </a>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Thika Road / Ruiru Campus -->\n          <div class=\"campus-map-card\">\n            <h4>Thika Road / Ruiru Campus</h4>\n            <p class=\"campus-map-addr\">Eastern Bypass, Kamakis (Near GreenSpot Gardens), Ruiru</p>\n            <div class=\"campus-map-embed\">\n              <iframe\n                src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3988.7!2d36.9755504!3d-1.163872!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x182f418fec5ebdf3%3A0x8b7212e652b4e914!2sGoCare%20Medical%20Training%20College%20and%20Health%20Sciences%20-%20Thika%20Road%20%2F%20Ruiru%20Campus!5e0!3m2!1sen!2ske!4v1718000000000!5m2!1sen!2ske\"\n                title=\"GoCare Medical Training College &ndash; Thika Road / Ruiru Campus location\"\n                width=\"100%\"\n                height=\"380\"\n                style=\"border:0;\"\n                allowfullscreen=\"\"\n                loading=\"lazy\"\n                referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>\n            </div>\n            <a class=\"campus-map-link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/GoCare+Medical+Training+College+and+Health+Sciences+-+Thika+Road+%2F+Ruiru+Campus/@-1.163872,36.9755504,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x182f418fec5ebdf3:0x8b7212e652b4e914!8m2!3d-1.163872!4d36.9755504!16s%2Fg%2F11y3jpxmct\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n              Get Directions <i data-lucide=\"external-link\"></i>\n            </a>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Life at GoCare mosaic -->\n      <div class=\"ct-mosaic reveal\">\n        <p class=\"ct-mosaic-eyebrow\">Campus Life</p>\n        <h3>A Glimpse Into Life at GoCare</h3>\n        <div class=\"ct-mosaic-grid\">\n          <div class=\"ct-mosaic-cell ct-mosaic-cell--tall\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/PXL_20251203_111229925.PORTRAIT.jpg\" alt=\"GoCare student in the clinical skills lab\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ct-mosaic-cell\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/Certificate-culinary-arts.jpg\" alt=\"Culinary arts practicals\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ct-mosaic-cell\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/Hotel-and-Hospitality-Management.jpg\" alt=\"Hospitality &amp; front office training\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ct-mosaic-cell\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/Social%20Work-Community-Development.jpg\" alt=\"Social work &amp; community development\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ct-mosaic-cell\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/office-administrator-level-5.png\" alt=\"Business &amp; office administration\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"social-section reveal\">\n        <h3>Social Media (All Platforms)</h3>\n        <p>Stay updated with announcements, intakes, events, and opportunities:</p>\n        <div class=\"social-links-grid\">\n          <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/GoCareTrainingInstitute/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"social-link\"><i class=\"fab fa-facebook\"></i> Facebook</a>\n          <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/gocaretraininginstitute/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"social-link\"><i class=\"fab fa-instagram\"></i> Instagram</a>\n          <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@gocaretraininginstitute\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"social-link\"><i class=\"fab fa-tiktok\"></i> TikTok</a>\n          <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@gocaretraininginstitute\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"social-link\"><i class=\"fab fa-youtube\"></i> YouTube</a>\n          <a href=\"https://ke.linkedin.com/company/gocaretraininginstitute\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"social-link\"><i class=\"fab fa-linkedin\"></i> LinkedIn</a>\n          <a href=\"https://x.com/GoCareInstitute\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"social-link\"><i class=\"fab fa-x-twitter\"></i> X</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"why-contact reveal\">\n        <h3>Why Contact GoCare Training Institute?</h3>\n        <ul class=\"why-list\">\n          <li><a href=\"courses.html\"><i data-lucide=\"chevron-right\"></i> Course guidance and career advice</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"admissions.html#requirements\"><i data-lucide=\"chevron-right\"></i> Admission requirements and intakes</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"admissions.html#fees\"><i data-lucide=\"chevron-right\"></i> Fee structure and payment plans</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"hostels-and-accommodation.html\"><i data-lucide=\"chevron-right\"></i> Hostel and accommodation inquiries</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"industrial-attachment.html\"><i data-lucide=\"chevron-right\"></i> Industrial attachment information</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"schools/international-certifications.html\"><i data-lucide=\"chevron-right\"></i> International certification details</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"contact.html#location\"><i data-lucide=\"chevron-right\"></i> Campus visits and tours</a></li>\n        </ul>\n        <p class=\"team-note\">Our team is friendly, professional, and ready to help you start your journey.</p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- -- NEWSLETTER ------------------------------------- -->\n  <section class=\"nl-sec\">\n    <div class=\"wrap nl-inner\">\n      <h2>Your Future Starts with a Conversation</h2>\n      <p>Whether you call, WhatsApp, email, or visit us \' GoCare Training Institute is here to guide you toward a brighter, more successful future.</p>\n      <a href=\"apply.html\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\">Start Your Journey <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\"></i></a>\n      <h2>Subscribe &amp; Stay Updated</h2>\n      <p>Get the latest programme news, intake dates and healthcare career tips \' no spam, ever.</p>\n      <form class=\"nl-form\" onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault();this.innerHTML=\'<p style=\\\'color:#F5F0E8;font-weight:700;padding:16px 24px;font-size:.95rem\\\'>&#x2705; Subscribed! Thank you.</p>\'\">\n        <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Enter your email address&ndash;\" required>\n        <button type=\"submit\">Join 2,500+ Students</button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n\n  \n  <!-- BACK TO TOP -->\n  <button class=\"back-to-top\" id=\"backToTop\" aria-label=\"Back to top\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 15l-6-6-6 6\"/></svg>\n  </button>', 'images/new-images/contact-us-header.png', 0, '[{\"body\": \"We’re here to support you at every step. Reach out for course guidance, admissions queries, accommodation information, or any other questions. Send a Message Find Our Campus\", \"heading\": \"Contact Us\"}, {\"body\": \"Whether you need help choosing a course, understanding fees, confirming admission requirements, or asking about accommodation, the GoCare Training Institute team is ready to assist you. Reach out through any of the channels below and our staff will respond promptly.\", \"heading\": \"We\'re Here to Support You \' Every Step of the Way.\"}, {\"body\": \"For quick assistance, inquiries, or admissions support: Nairobi City Campus 0745 220 344 For campus specific inquiries, class schedules, directions, and student support. Thika Road / Ruiru Campus 0745 229 485 For inquiries related to the Eastern Bypass, Kamakis campus, programs, and support services. Admissions Office 0703 115 502 For all admission inquiries, course guidance, intakes, and application support.\", \"heading\": \"Call or WhatsApp Us\"}, {\"body\": \"info@gocareinstitute.ac.ke Our admissions and support teams respond promptly during working hours.\", \"heading\": \"Email Us\"}, {\"body\": \"\", \"heading\": \"Send us a Message\"}, {\"body\": \"We will get back to you shortly.\';lucide.createIcons()\\\"> Send Message\", \"heading\": \"Message Sent!\"}, {\"body\": \"\", \"heading\": \"Visit Our Campuses\"}, {\"body\": \"Nairobi City Campus, Nairobi CBD, GatKim Complex, Temple Road (Behind Ronald Ngala Street Post Office) This central location is easily accessible via public and private transport, making it ideal for students within Nairobi and surrounding areas.\", \"heading\": \"Nairobi City Campus\"}, {\"body\": \"Eastern Bypass, Kamakis (Near GreenSpot Gardens), Ruiru A modern, spacious learning environment serving students along Thika Road, Ruiru, Kiambu County, and surrounding regions. - With hostels.\", \"heading\": \"Thika Road / Ruiru Campus\"}, {\"body\": \"Modern classrooms Practical training labs Student support services Safe, student friendly environments\", \"heading\": \"Both campuses offer:\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare Training Institute has two strategic campuses serving Nairobi and the greater Thika Road / Ruiru region.\", \"heading\": \"Find Us on the Map\"}, {\"body\": \"Nairobi City Campus, Nairobi CBD, GatKim Complex, Temple Road (Behind Ronald Ngala Street Post Office) Get Directions\", \"heading\": \"Nairobi City Campus\"}, {\"body\": \"Eastern Bypass, Kamakis (Near GreenSpot Gardens), Ruiru Get Directions Campus Life\", \"heading\": \"Thika Road / Ruiru Campus\"}, {\"body\": \"\", \"heading\": \"A Glimpse Into Life at GoCare\"}, {\"body\": \"Stay updated with announcements, intakes, events, and opportunities: Facebook Instagram TikTok YouTube LinkedIn X\", \"heading\": \"Social Media (All Platforms)\"}, {\"body\": \"Course guidance and career advice Admission requirements and intakes Fee structure and payment plans Hostel and accommodation inquiries Industrial attachment information International certification details Campus visits and tours Our team is friendly, professional, and ready to help you start your journey.\", \"heading\": \"Why Contact GoCare Training Institute?\"}, {\"body\": \"Whether you call, WhatsApp, email, or visit us \' GoCare Training Institute is here to guide you toward a brighter, more successful future. Start Your Journey\", \"heading\": \"Your Future Starts with a Conversation\"}, {\"body\": \"Get the latest programme news, intake dates and healthcare career tips \' no spam, ever. Join 2,500+ Students\", \"heading\": \"Subscribe & Stay Updated\"}]', 'contact.html', 1, '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:47');
INSERT INTO `site_pages` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `image`, `use_builder`, `sections`, `source_path`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(15, 'Health Care Assistant / Caregiver – GoCare Training Institute', 'course-details', '<div class=\"wrap\">\r\n      <div class=\"course-grid-layout\">\r\n        <div class=\"course-body\">\r\n          <section class=\"course-description\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"course-sec-title\">Programme Overview</h2>\r\n            <p>The Health Care Assistant / Caregiver programme at GoCare Training Institute is designed to equip learners\r\n              with the practical skills and theoretical knowledge required to provide high-quality care to individuals\r\n              in various healthcare settings.</p>\r\n            <p>Our curriculum focuses on patient safety, personal hygiene, basic nursing care, and effective\r\n              communication. Graduates are highly sought after by hospitals and international agencies due to our\r\n              hands-on training approach in modern labs.</p>\r\n          </section>\r\n\r\n          <section class=\"modules-list\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"course-sec-title\">What You\'ll Learn</h2>\r\n            <div class=\"module-item\">\r\n              <div class=\"module-num\">01</div>\r\n              <div class=\"module-info\">\r\n                <h4>Foundations of Caregiving</h4>\r\n                <p>Understanding the role and ethics of a health care assistant.</p>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"module-item\">\r\n              <div class=\"module-num\">02</div>\r\n              <div class=\"module-info\">\r\n                <h4>Basic Nursing Procedures</h4>\r\n                <p>Vital signs monitoring, wound care, and infection control.</p>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"module-item\">\r\n              <div class=\"module-num\">03</div>\r\n              <div class=\"module-info\">\r\n                <h4>Anatomy & Physiology</h4>\r\n                <p>Basic understanding of human body systems and common disorders.</p>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"module-item\">\r\n              <div class=\"module-num\">04</div>\r\n              <div class=\"module-info\">\r\n                <h4>First Aid & CPR</h4>\r\n                <p>Emergency response skills certified by international standards.</p>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"module-item\">\r\n              <div class=\"module-num\">05</div>\r\n              <div class=\"module-info\">\r\n                <h4>Nutrition & Dietetics</h4>\r\n                <p>Planning and preparing healthy meals for patients with specific needs.</p>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </section>\r\n\r\n          <section class=\"requirements-box\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"course-sec-title\">Entry Requirements</h2>\r\n            <div class=\"requirements-grid\">\r\n              <div class=\"req-item\">\r\n                <i data-lucide=\"check-circle-2\"></i>\r\n                <div>\r\n                  <strong>Academic Qualification</strong>\r\n                  <p>Open to KCSE graduates (Grade D and above) or equivalent.</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"req-item\">\r\n                <i data-lucide=\"check-circle-2\"></i>\r\n                <div>\r\n                  <strong>Documentation</strong>\r\n                  <p>Copy of ID/Passport, KCSE Result Slip, and 2 passport photos.</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"req-item\">\r\n                <i data-lucide=\"check-circle-2\"></i>\r\n                <div>\r\n                  <strong>Passion for Care</strong>\r\n                  <p>A genuine desire to help and care for others is highly valued.</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"req-item\">\r\n                <i data-lucide=\"check-circle-2\"></i>\r\n                <div>\r\n                  <strong>Language Skills</strong>\r\n                  <p>Proficiency in English and Kiswahili for effective communication.</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </section>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <aside class=\"course-sidebar\">\r\n          <div class=\"sidebar-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"price-box\">\r\n              <span class=\"price-label\">Estimated Tuition</span>\r\n              <div class=\"price-value\">Ksh 45,000</div>\r\n              <p class=\"price-sub\">Installment plans available</p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"sidebar-btns\">\r\n              <a href=\"apply.html\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Enroll in this Course</a>\r\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-outline\"><i data-lucide=\"download\"></i> Download Brochure</a>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"sidebar-info-list\">\r\n              <div class=\"side-info-item\">\r\n                <span>Next Intake</span>\r\n                <strong>May 2026</strong>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"side-info-item\">\r\n                <span>Campus</span>\r\n                <strong>Nairobi / Ruiru</strong>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"side-info-item\">\r\n                <span>Study Mode</span>\r\n                <strong>Full-time / Part-time</strong>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"help-card\">\r\n            <h4>Need Help?</h4>\r\n            <p>Our admissions team is ready to guide you through the process.</p>\r\n            <a href=\"tel:+254703115502\" class=\"help-link\"><i data-lucide=\"phone-call\"></i> 0703 115 502</a>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </aside>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>', NULL, 0, '[{\"body\": \"The Health Care Assistant / Caregiver programme at GoCare Training Institute is designed to equip learners with the practical skills and theoretical knowledge required to provide high-quality care to individuals in various healthcare settings. Our curriculum focuses on patient safety, personal hygiene, basic nursing care, and effective communication. Graduates are highly sought after by hospitals and international agencies due to our hands-on training approach in modern labs.\", \"heading\": \"Programme Overview\"}, {\"body\": \"01\", \"heading\": \"What You\'ll Learn\"}, {\"body\": \"Understanding the role and ethics of a health care assistant. 02\", \"heading\": \"Foundations of Caregiving\"}, {\"body\": \"Vital signs monitoring, wound care, and infection control. 03\", \"heading\": \"Basic Nursing Procedures\"}, {\"body\": \"Basic understanding of human body systems and common disorders. 04\", \"heading\": \"Anatomy & Physiology\"}, {\"body\": \"Emergency response skills certified by international standards. 05\", \"heading\": \"First Aid & CPR\"}, {\"body\": \"Planning and preparing healthy meals for patients with specific needs.\", \"heading\": \"Nutrition & Dietetics\"}, {\"body\": \"Academic Qualification Open to KCSE graduates (Grade D and above) or equivalent. Documentation Copy of ID/Passport, KCSE Result Slip, and 2 passport photos. Passion for Care A genuine desire to help and care for others is highly valued. Language Skills Proficiency in English and Kiswahili for effective communication. Estimated Tuition Ksh 45,000 Installment plans available Enroll in this Course Download Brochure Next Intake May 2026 Campus Nairobi / Ruiru Study Mode Full-time / Part-time\", \"heading\": \"Entry Requirements\"}, {\"body\": \"Our admissions team is ready to guide you through the process. 0703 115 502\", \"heading\": \"Need Help?\"}]', 'course-details.html', 1, '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:47');
INSERT INTO `site_pages` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `image`, `use_builder`, `sections`, `source_path`, `is_published`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(16, 'View All Courses | GoCare Training Institute', 'courses', '<!-- COOKIE CONSENT -->\n  <div id=\"cookie-banner\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"Cookie consent\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n    <div class=\"ck-inner\">\n      <div class=\"ck-left\">\n        <div class=\"ck-icon-wrap\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n            <path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 10 10 4 4 0 0 1-5-5 4 4 0 0 1-5-5\"/>\n            <path d=\"M8.5 8.5v.01\"/><path d=\"M16 15.5v.01\"/><path d=\"M12 12v.01\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ck-copy\">\n          <strong>We use cookies</strong>\n          <p>We use cookies to improve your experience, analyse site traffic, and personalise content. By continuing, you agree to our <a href=\"#\">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ck-actions\">\n        <button class=\"ck-btn-decline\" id=\"ckDecline\">Decline</button>\n        <button class=\"ck-btn-accept\" id=\"ckAccept\">Accept All</button>\n        <button class=\"ck-close\" id=\"ckClose\" aria-label=\"Close\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- -- NAVBAR ---------------------------------------- -->\n\n\n  <!-- -- SUB BAR --------------------------------------- -->\n  <div class=\"subbar\">\n    <div class=\"wrap subbar-inner\">\n      <span class=\"subbar-tagline\">Train With The Experts... Become an Expert!</span>\n      <div class=\"subbar-portals\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"subbar-btn subbar-btn--student\">Student Portal</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"subbar-btn subbar-btn--staff\">Staff Portal</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n  <!-- PAGE HERO (full-bleed, outside wrap) -->\n  <section class=\"ph ph--split\">\n    <div class=\"ph-bg\">\n      <img loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/courses/hero-courses.jpeg\" alt=\"Explore Our Programmes\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ph-overlay\"></div>\n    <div class=\"ph-inner\">\n      <div class=\"ph-content\">\n        <span class=\"ph-eyebrow\"><i data-lucide=\"search\"></i> Explore Our Programmes</span>\n        \n        <h1>View All <em>Courses</em></h1>\n        <p>Browse GoCare&#8217;s full range of certificate and diploma programmes in healthcare, hospitality, social sciences, and internationally recognised certifications.</p>\n        <div class=\"ph-btns\">\n          <a href=\"courses.html#all-courses\" class=\"ph-btn-primary\">Browse Courses <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\"></i></a>\n          <a href=\"apply.html\" class=\"ph-btn-ghost\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\"></i></a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ph-form-card\">\n        <h3>Find Your Course</h3>\n        <p>Filter by school, level, or duration.</p>\n        <div class=\"ph-form-group\">\n          <label>School / Category</label>\n          <select class=\"ph-form-input\" id=\"heroSchoolFilter\">\n            <option value=\"all\">All Schools</option>\n            <option value=\"med\">Medical &amp; Health Sciences</option>\n            <option value=\"hosp\">Hospitality Management</option>\n            <option value=\"social\">Social Sciences &amp; Business</option>\n            <option value=\"intl\">International Certifications</option>\n          </select>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ph-form-group\">\n          <label>Study Duration</label>\n          <select class=\"ph-form-input\" id=\"heroDurFilter\">\n            <option value=\"\">Any duration</option>\n            <option>6 Months</option>\n            <option>1 Year</option>\n            <option>2 Years</option>\n          </select>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"ph-form-submit\" onclick=\"document.getElementById(\'all-courses\')?.scrollIntoView({behavior:\'smooth\'})\">Browse Courses &rarr;</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n\n<div class=\"ac-page\">\n    \n\n    <!-- Category Schools Grid (image cards) -->\n    <section class=\"ac-schools-sec\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <div class=\"ac-schools-grid\">\n\n          <a href=\"schools/medical-health-sciences.html\" class=\"ac-school-item\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/Nursing-Assistant.jpg\" alt=\"Medical & Health Sciences\">\n            <div class=\"ac-school-overlay\"></div>\n            <div class=\"ac-school-body\">\n              <div class=\"ac-school-icon\"><i data-lucide=\"stethoscope\"></i></div>\n              <h4>Medical &amp; Health Sciences</h4>\n              <span class=\"ac-school-btn\">View Courses <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"schools/hospitality-management.html\" class=\"ac-school-item\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/Hotel-and-Hospitality-Management.jpg\" alt=\"Hospitality Management\">\n            <div class=\"ac-school-overlay\"></div>\n            <div class=\"ac-school-body\">\n              <div class=\"ac-school-icon\"><i data-lucide=\"utensils\"></i></div>\n              <h4>Hospitality Management</h4>\n              <span class=\"ac-school-btn\">View Courses <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"schools/social-sciences-business.html\" class=\"ac-school-item\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/Social Work-Community-Development.jpg\" alt=\"Social Sciences & Business\">\n            <div class=\"ac-school-overlay\"></div>\n            <div class=\"ac-school-body\">\n              <div class=\"ac-school-icon\"><i data-lucide=\"users\"></i></div>\n              <h4>Social Sciences &amp; Business</h4>\n              <span class=\"ac-school-btn\">View Courses <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"schools/international-certifications.html\" class=\"ac-school-item\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/Healthcare-professional.jpg\" alt=\"International Certifications\">\n            <div class=\"ac-school-overlay\"></div>\n            <div class=\"ac-school-body\">\n              <div class=\"ac-school-icon\"><i data-lucide=\"globe\"></i></div>\n              <h4>International Certifications</h4>\n              <span class=\"ac-school-btn\">View Courses <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Photo strip break -->\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"ac-photo-strip\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/courses/Gallery-1.jpeg\" alt=\"GoCare students\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/courses/Gallery-2.jpeg\" alt=\"GoCare practical\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/courses/Gallery-3.jpeg\" alt=\"GoCare campus\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/courses/Gallery-4.jpeg\" alt=\"GoCare graduates\">\n        <div class=\"ac-strip-overlay\">\n          <div class=\"ac-strip-text\">\n            <strong>Real Training.<br>Real Results.</strong>\n            <span>Industry-aligned programmes across 4 schools</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Course Listings -->\n    <section id=\"all-courses\" style=\"padding:64px 0 80px;background:#f8f6fc;\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n\n        <!-- Section header -->\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:40px;\">\n          <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:rgba(100,42,126,.1);color:var(--p);padding:6px 18px;border-radius:50px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:16px;\"><i data-lucide=\"layout-grid\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i> All Programmes</div>\n          <h2 style=\"font-size:2.4rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:12px;\">Browse Our <em style=\"color:var(--o);font-style:normal;\">Courses</em></h2>\n          <p style=\"color:#64748b;max-width:540px;margin:0 auto;font-size:1rem;\">Practical, accredited programmes across healthcare, hospitality, social sciences &amp; international certifications.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Filter tabs -->\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:40px;\" id=\"courseTabs\">\n          <button class=\"crs-tab active\" data-filter=\"all\">All Courses</button>\n          <button class=\"crs-tab\" data-filter=\"medical\"><i data-lucide=\"stethoscope\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i> Medical &amp; Health</button>\n          <button class=\"crs-tab\" data-filter=\"hospitality\"><i data-lucide=\"utensils\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i> Hospitality</button>\n          <button class=\"crs-tab\" data-filter=\"social\"><i data-lucide=\"users\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i> Social Sciences</button>\n          <button class=\"crs-tab\" data-filter=\"international\"><i data-lucide=\"globe\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i> International</button>\n          <button class=\"crs-tab\" data-filter=\"diploma\"><i data-lucide=\"award\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i> Diplomas</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Count bar -->\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;\">\n          <p style=\"margin:0;color:#64748b;font-size:.9rem;\"><span id=\"crsCount\" style=\"font-weight:700;color:var(--dark);\">30</span> programmes available</p>\n          <a href=\"apply.html\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--o);color:#fff;padding:10px 24px;border-radius:50px;font-weight:700;font-size:.88rem;text-decoration:none;\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;\"></i></a>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Cards grid -->\n        <div id=\"crsGrid\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;\">\n\n          <!-- Certificate Courses -->\n          <a href=\"courses/certificate-in-healthcare-support-services-level-5-certified-nursing-assistant.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"medical\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/Nursing-Assistant.jpg\" alt=\"Healthcare Support Services\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge med\">Medical</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 5</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 1&frac12; Yrs</span></div>\n              <h3>Healthcare Support Services (CNA)</h3>\n              <p>Become a licensed Healthcare Support Assistant / Certified Nursing Assistant ready for hospitals and clinics.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/certificate-in-health-care-assistant-hca.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"medical\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/1.jpg\" alt=\"Health Care Assistant\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge med\">Medical</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 4</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 5 Months</span></div>\n              <h3>Certificate in Health Care Assistant (HCA)</h3>\n              <p>Foundational clinical skills training for patient care in home, hospital, and community settings.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/certificate-in-mortuary-science-level-5.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"medical\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_7865.JPG\" alt=\"Mortuary Science\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge med\">Medical</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 5</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 1&frac12; Yrs</span></div>\n              <h3>Certificate in Mortuary Science &ndash; Level 5</h3>\n              <p>Prepares learners for professional roles in mortuaries, funeral homes, hospitals and forensic settings.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/certificate-in-orthopaedic-and-trauma-medicine-level-5.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"medical\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/1(1).jpg\" alt=\"Orthopaedic Medicine\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge med\">Medical</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 5</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 1&frac12; Yrs</span></div>\n              <h3>Orthopaedic &amp; Trauma Medicine &ndash; Level 5</h3>\n              <p>Train in musculoskeletal care and orthopaedic rehabilitation techniques.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/certificate-in-perioperative-theatre-technology-level-5.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"medical\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/perioperative-level-5.jpg\" alt=\"Perioperative Technology\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge med\">Medical</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 5</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 1&frac12; Yrs</span></div>\n              <h3>Perioperative Theatre Technology &ndash; Level 5</h3>\n              <p>Master surgical theatre operations and patient care techniques.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/certificate-in-community-health-assistant-level-5.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"medical\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/caregiving-level-5.jpeg\" alt=\"Community Health\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge med\">Medical</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 5</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 1&frac12; Yrs</span></div>\n              <h3>Community Health Assistant &ndash; Level 5</h3>\n              <p>Equips learners with essential knowledge for supporting community health initiatives.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/certificate-in-food-and-beverage-production-culinary-arts-level-3.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"hospitality\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/Certificate-culinary-arts.jpg\" alt=\"Culinary Arts\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge hosp\">Hospitality</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 3</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 5 Months</span></div>\n              <h3>Food &amp; Beverage Production (Culinary Arts)</h3>\n              <p>Foundational culinary skills for professional kitchen and catering environments.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/certificate-in-front-office-operations-level-3.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"hospitality\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/Front-office.jpg\" alt=\"Front Office\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge hosp\">Hospitality</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 3</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 5 Months</span></div>\n              <h3>Front Office Operations &ndash; Level 3</h3>\n              <p>Professional skills for hotel front offices, corporate reception and customer-facing roles.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/certificate-in-housekeeping-and-accommodation-level-3.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"hospitality\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/Housekeeping-Accomodation.jpg\" alt=\"Housekeeping\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge hosp\">Hospitality</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 3</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 6 Months</span></div>\n              <h3>Housekeeping &amp; Accommodation &ndash; Level 3</h3>\n              <p>Professional housekeeping for hotels, resorts, corporate offices and residential environments.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/certificate-in-homecare-management-level-4.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"hospitality\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img src=\"images/Homecare-management-4.jpg\" alt=\"Homecare Management\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge hosp\">Hospitality</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 4</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 8 Months</span></div>\n              <h3>Homecare Management &ndash; Level 4</h3>\n              <p>Management-level training for running professional homecare services.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/certificate-in-office-administrator-level-5.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"social\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/office-administrator-level-5.png\" alt=\"Office Administrator\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge soc\">Social Sciences</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 5</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 1&frac12; Yrs</span></div>\n              <h3>Office Administrator &ndash; Level 5</h3>\n              <p>Comprehensive administrative and office management skills for corporate environments.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/certificate-in-office-assistant-customer-service-level-4.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"social\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/Certificate-in-Office-Assistant-Customer-Service-Level-4-small.jpeg\" alt=\"Office Assistant\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge soc\">Social Sciences</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 4</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 6 Months</span></div>\n              <h3>Office Assistant / Customer Service &ndash; Level 4</h3>\n              <p>Equips learners with practical office and customer service skills for business environments.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/certificate-in-community-based-services-level-4.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"social\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/Community-Based Services â€“L4.jpeg\" alt=\"Community-Based Services\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge soc\">Social Sciences</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 4</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 8 Months</span></div>\n              <h3>Community-Based Services &ndash; Level 4</h3>\n              <p>A comprehensive program that prepares learners to deliver safe, compassionate community-based services.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <!-- Diplomas -->\n          <a href=\"courses/diploma-in-perioperative-theatre-technology-level-6.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"diploma medical\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/Perioperative-Theatre-Technology.jpg\" alt=\"Perioperative Diploma\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge dip\">Diploma</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 6</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 2&frac12; Years</span></div>\n              <h3>Diploma in Perioperative Theatre Technology Level 6</h3>\n              <p>Advanced surgical theatre and patient care programme for healthcare professionals.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Learn More <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/diploma-in-mortuary-science-level-6.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"diploma medical\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/mortuary-level-5.png\" alt=\"Mortuary Diploma\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge dip\">Diploma</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 6</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 2&frac12; Years</span></div>\n              <h3>Diploma in Mortuary Science &ndash; Level 6</h3>\n              <p>Advanced skills in post-mortem care, pathology support and mortuary management.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Learn More <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/diploma-in-orthopaedic-and-trauma-medicine-level-6.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"diploma medical\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/Orthopaedic-Trauma Medicine.jpg\" alt=\"Orthopaedic Diploma\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge dip\">Diploma</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 6</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 3 Years</span></div>\n              <h3>Diploma in Orthopaedic &amp; Trauma Medicine Level 6</h3>\n              <p>Advanced orthopaedic rehabilitation and trauma care programme.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Learn More <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/diploma-in-social-work-and-community-development-level-6.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"diploma social\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/SOCIAL-WORK-&-COMMUNITY-DEVELOPMENT.jpeg\" alt=\"Social Work Diploma\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge dip\">Diploma</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 6</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 2&frac12; Years</span></div>\n              <h3>Diploma in Social Work &amp; Community Development</h3>\n              <p>Advanced social work practice for community development and social service delivery.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Learn More <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/diploma-in-community-health-assistant-level-6.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"diploma medical\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/Diploma-community-health.jpg\" alt=\"Community Health Diploma\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge dip\">Diploma</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 6</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 2&frac12; Years</span></div>\n              <h3>Diploma in Community Health Assistant Level 6</h3>\n              <p>Advanced community health practice for public and primary healthcare settings.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Learn More <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"schools/hospitality-management.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"diploma hospitality\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/Hotel-and-Hospitality-Management.jpg\" alt=\"Hospitality Diploma\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge dip\">Diploma</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 6</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 2&frac12; Years</span></div>\n              <h3>Hospitality Management Pathways</h3>\n              <p>Comprehensive diploma-level hospitality and hotel management programmes.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Learn More <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <!-- International -->\n          <a href=\"courses/caregiver-course-level-ii.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"international medical\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/caregiver-level-2.jpg\" alt=\"Caregiver Course\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge intl\">International</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level II</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 6 Months</span></div>\n              <h3>Caregiver Course &ndash; Level II</h3>\n              <p>Professional caregiver training aligned to international standards for global placement.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Explore <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/certificate-in-caregiving-level-4.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"international medical\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/caregiving.jpg\" alt=\"Caregiving Level 4\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge intl\">International</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 4</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 8 Months</span></div>\n              <h3>Certificate in Caregiving &ndash; Level 4</h3>\n              <p>Advanced caregiving skills for professional home and institutional care contexts.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Explore <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/certificate-in-home-based-care-support-level-3.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"international medical\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/HBCS.jpeg\" alt=\"Home-Based Care\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge intl\">International</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 3</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 5 Months</span></div>\n              <h3>Home-Based Care Support &ndash; Level 3</h3>\n              <p>Foundational care training for home-based care assistants and nursing assistants.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Explore <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/certificate-in-healthcare-support-services-level-5-certified-nursing-assistant.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"international medical\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/Nursing-Assistant.jpg\" alt=\"Health Services Support\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge intl\">International</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 5</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 1&frac12; Yrs</span></div>\n              <h3>Health Services Support &ndash; Level 5</h3>\n              <p>Licensed Healthcare Support / Certified Nursing Assistant training aligned to international standards for global healthcare roles.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Explore <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/amca-usa-certification.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"international\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/DSC00707.jpg.jpeg\" alt=\"AMCA USA\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge intl\">International</span><span class=\"crs-level\">USA</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> Varies</span></div>\n              <h3>AMCA (USA) Certification</h3>\n              <p>Unlock global healthcare career opportunities with this American Medical Certification.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Explore <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/sdc-canada-certification.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"international\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_5498.JPG.jpeg\" alt=\"SDC Canada\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge intl\">International</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Canada</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> Varies</span></div>\n              <h3>SDC Canada Certification</h3>\n              <p>Canada-aligned training and certification through the Skill Development Council.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Explore <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/certified-nursing-assistant-cna-options.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"international medical\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/IMG_3300-cna.JPG\" alt=\"CNA Options\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge intl\">International</span><span class=\"crs-level\">CNA</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> Varies</span></div>\n              <h3>Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) Options</h3>\n              <p>Multiple pathways to internationally recognised CNA certification.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Explore <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/second-course-sponsorship.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"international\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/slider-four.jpg\" alt=\"Second Course Sponsorship\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge intl\">Sponsorship</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Bonus</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> Free</span></div>\n              <h3>Second Course Sponsorship</h3>\n              <p>GoCare sponsors a second international certification for eligible enrolled students.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Explore <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/certificate-in-homecare-management-level-3.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"hospitality\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/Homecare-management.jpg\" alt=\"Homecare Management L3\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge hosp\">Hospitality</span><span class=\"crs-level\">Level 3</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 6 Months</span></div>\n              <h3>Homecare Management &ndash; Level 3</h3>\n              <p>Entry-level homecare management training for caregiving and support service roles.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Apply Now <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <!-- AHA Emergency Care Courses -->\n          <a href=\"courses/aha-emergency-care-programs.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"international\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/ACLS.jpeg\" alt=\"AHA Emergency Care Programs\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge intl\">International</span><span class=\"crs-level\">AHA</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> Varies</span></div>\n              <h3>AHA Emergency Care Programs</h3>\n              <p>American Heart Association&ndash;certified emergency care training including BLS, ACLS, PALS and Heartsaver.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Learn More <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/basic-life-support-bls.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"international\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/Nursing-Assistant.jpg\" alt=\"Basic Life Support (BLS)\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge intl\">International</span><span class=\"crs-level\">AHA</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 1 Day</span></div>\n              <h3>Basic Life Support (BLS)</h3>\n              <p>AHA-accredited BLS training in CPR, AED use and emergency response for healthcare professionals and first responders.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Learn More <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/advanced-cardiac-life-support-acls.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"international\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/ACLS.jpeg\" alt=\"Advanced Cardiac Life Support (ACLS)\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge intl\">International</span><span class=\"crs-level\">AHA</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 2 Days</span></div>\n              <h3>Advanced Cardiac Life Support (ACLS)</h3>\n              <p>AHA-certified ACLS for managing cardiac emergencies, arrhythmias and advanced resuscitation in clinical settings.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Learn More <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/pediatric-advanced-life-support-pals.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"international\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/PALS-3.jpeg\" alt=\"Pediatric Advanced Life Support (PALS)\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge intl\">International</span><span class=\"crs-level\">AHA</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 3 Days</span></div>\n              <h3>Pediatric Advanced Life Support (PALS)</h3>\n              <p>AHA-certified PALS covering paediatric emergencies, respiratory and shock management and resuscitation protocols.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Learn More <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"courses/heartsaver-first-aid.html\" class=\"crs-card\" data-cat=\"international\">\n            <div class=\"crs-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"images/new-images/First-Aid.jpeg\" alt=\"Heartsaver First Aid CPR & AED\"></div>\n            <div class=\"crs-body\">\n              <div class=\"crs-tags\"><span class=\"crs-badge intl\">International</span><span class=\"crs-level\">AHA</span><span class=\"crs-dur\"><i data-lucide=\"clock\" style=\"width:12px;height:12px;\"></i> 1 Day</span></div>\n              <h3>Heartsaver First Aid CPR &amp; AED</h3>\n              <p>AHA Heartsaver certification for first aid, CPR and AED use in any workplace, home or community setting.</p>\n              <span class=\"crs-cta\">Learn More <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n\n        </div><!-- /crsGrid -->\n\n        <p id=\"crsEmpty\" style=\"display:none;text-align:center;padding:48px 0;color:#64748b;font-size:1rem;\">No courses found for this filter.</p>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    \n\n</div><!-- /ac-page -->\n\n\n  \n  <!-- BACK TO TOP -->\n  <button class=\"back-to-top\" id=\"backToTop\" aria-label=\"Back to top\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 15l-6-6-6 6\"/></svg>\n  </button>', NULL, 0, '[{\"body\": \"Browse GoCare’s full range of certificate and diploma programmes in healthcare, hospitality, social sciences, and internationally recognised certifications. Browse Courses Apply Now\", \"heading\": \"View All Courses\"}, {\"body\": \"Filter by school, level, or duration. School / Category All Schools Medical & Health Sciences Hospitality Management Social Sciences & Business International Certifications Study Duration Any duration 6 Months 1 Year 2 Years Browse Courses →\", \"heading\": \"Find Your Course\"}, {\"body\": \"View Courses\", \"heading\": \"Medical & Health Sciences\"}, {\"body\": \"View Courses\", \"heading\": \"Hospitality Management\"}, {\"body\": \"View Courses\", \"heading\": \"Social Sciences & Business\"}, {\"body\": \"View Courses Real Training.Real Results. Industry-aligned programmes across 4 schools All Programmes\", \"heading\": \"International Certifications\"}, {\"body\": \"Practical, accredited programmes across healthcare, hospitality, social sciences & international certifications. All Courses Medical & Health Hospitality Social Sciences International Diplomas 30 programmes available Apply Now MedicalLevel 5 1½ Yrs\", \"heading\": \"Browse Our Courses\"}, {\"body\": \"Become a licensed Healthcare Support Assistant / Certified Nursing Assistant ready for hospitals and clinics. Apply Now MedicalLevel 4 5 Months\", \"heading\": \"Healthcare Support Services (CNA)\"}, {\"body\": \"Foundational clinical skills training for patient care in home, hospital, and community settings. Apply Now MedicalLevel 5 1½ Yrs\", \"heading\": \"Certificate in Health Care Assistant (HCA)\"}, {\"body\": \"Prepares learners for professional roles in mortuaries, funeral homes, hospitals and forensic settings. Apply Now MedicalLevel 5 1½ Yrs\", \"heading\": \"Certificate in Mortuary Science – Level 5\"}, {\"body\": \"Train in musculoskeletal care and orthopaedic rehabilitation techniques. Apply Now MedicalLevel 5 1½ Yrs\", \"heading\": \"Orthopaedic & Trauma Medicine – Level 5\"}, {\"body\": \"Master surgical theatre operations and patient care techniques. Apply Now MedicalLevel 5 1½ Yrs\", \"heading\": \"Perioperative Theatre Technology – Level 5\"}, {\"body\": \"Equips learners with essential knowledge for supporting community health initiatives. Apply Now HospitalityLevel 3 5 Months\", \"heading\": \"Community Health Assistant – Level 5\"}, {\"body\": \"Foundational culinary skills for professional kitchen and catering environments. Apply Now HospitalityLevel 3 5 Months\", \"heading\": \"Food & Beverage Production (Culinary Arts)\"}, {\"body\": \"Professional skills for hotel front offices, corporate reception and customer-facing roles. Apply Now HospitalityLevel 3 6 Months\", \"heading\": \"Front Office Operations – Level 3\"}, {\"body\": \"Professional housekeeping for hotels, resorts, corporate offices and residential environments. Apply Now HospitalityLevel 4 8 Months\", \"heading\": \"Housekeeping & Accommodation – Level 3\"}, {\"body\": \"Management-level training for running professional homecare services. Apply Now Social SciencesLevel 5 1½ Yrs\", \"heading\": \"Homecare Management – Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Comprehensive administrative and office management skills for corporate environments. Apply Now Social SciencesLevel 4 6 Months\", \"heading\": \"Office Administrator – Level 5\"}, {\"body\": \"Equips learners with practical office and customer service skills for business environments. Apply Now Social SciencesLevel 4 8 Months\", \"heading\": \"Office Assistant / Customer Service – Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"A comprehensive program that prepares learners to deliver safe, compassionate community-based services. Apply Now DiplomaLevel 6 2½ Years\", \"heading\": \"Community-Based Services – Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Advanced surgical theatre and patient care programme for healthcare professionals. Learn More DiplomaLevel 6 2½ Years\", \"heading\": \"Diploma in Perioperative Theatre Technology Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Advanced skills in post-mortem care, pathology support and mortuary management. Learn More DiplomaLevel 6 3 Years\", \"heading\": \"Diploma in Mortuary Science – Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Advanced orthopaedic rehabilitation and trauma care programme. Learn More DiplomaLevel 6 2½ Years\", \"heading\": \"Diploma in Orthopaedic & Trauma Medicine Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Advanced social work practice for community development and social service delivery. Learn More DiplomaLevel 6 2½ Years\", \"heading\": \"Diploma in Social Work & Community Development\"}, {\"body\": \"Advanced community health practice for public and primary healthcare settings. Learn More DiplomaLevel 6 2½ Years\", \"heading\": \"Diploma in Community Health Assistant Level 6\"}, {\"body\": \"Comprehensive diploma-level hospitality and hotel management programmes. Learn More InternationalLevel II 6 Months\", \"heading\": \"Hospitality Management Pathways\"}, {\"body\": \"Professional caregiver training aligned to international standards for global placement. Explore InternationalLevel 4 8 Months\", \"heading\": \"Caregiver Course – Level II\"}, {\"body\": \"Advanced caregiving skills for professional home and institutional care contexts. Explore InternationalLevel 3 5 Months\", \"heading\": \"Certificate in Caregiving – Level 4\"}, {\"body\": \"Foundational care training for home-based care assistants and nursing assistants. Explore InternationalLevel 5 1½ Yrs\", \"heading\": \"Home-Based Care Support – Level 3\"}, {\"body\": \"Licensed Healthcare Support / Certified Nursing Assistant training aligned to international standards for global healthcare roles. Explore InternationalUSA Varies\", \"heading\": \"Health Services Support – Level 5\"}, {\"body\": \"Unlock global healthcare career opportunities with this American Medical Certification. Explore InternationalCanada Varies\", \"heading\": \"AMCA (USA) Certification\"}, {\"body\": \"Canada-aligned training and certification through the Skill Development Council. Explore InternationalCNA Varies\", \"heading\": \"SDC Canada Certification\"}, {\"body\": \"Multiple pathways to internationally recognised CNA certification. Explore SponsorshipBonus Free\", \"heading\": \"Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) Options\"}, {\"body\": \"GoCare sponsors a second international certification for eligible enrolled students. Explore HospitalityLevel 3 6 Months\", \"heading\": \"Second Course Sponsorship\"}, {\"body\": \"Entry-level homecare management training for caregiving and support service roles. Apply Now InternationalAHA Varies\", \"heading\": \"Homecare Management – Level 3\"}, {\"body\": \"American Heart Association–certified emergency care training including BLS, ACLS, PALS and Heartsaver. Learn More InternationalAHA 1 Day\", \"heading\": \"AHA Emergency Care Programs\"}, {\"body\": \"AHA-accredited BLS training in CPR, AED use and emergency response for healthcare professionals and first responders. Learn More InternationalAHA 2 Days\", \"heading\": \"Basic Life Support (BLS)\"}, {\"body\": \"AHA-certified ACLS for managing cardiac emergencies, arrhythmias and advanced resuscitation in clinical settings. Learn More InternationalAHA 3 Days\", \"heading\": \"Advanced Cardiac Life Support (ACLS)\"}, {\"body\": \"AHA-certified PALS covering paediatric emergencies, respiratory and shock management and resuscitation protocols. Learn More InternationalAHA 1 Day\", \"heading\": \"Pediatric Advanced Life Support (PALS)\"}, {\"body\": \"AHA Heartsaver certification for first aid, CPR and AED use in any workplace, home or community setting. Learn More No courses found for this filter.\", \"heading\": \"Heartsaver First Aid CPR & AED\"}]', 'courses.html', 1, '2026-08-03 10:29:26', '2026-08-03 10:34:47');
